window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df20"]={"id": "df20", "title": "D3PM：转移矩阵与 ELBO", "focus": "构造 D3PM 的转移矩阵族（均匀、吸收、高斯化），推导累积转移、后验与 ELBO；说明不同转移核的可表示性与数值性质。", "claims": ["Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}\\ \\text{（二状态均匀）}", "\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^tQ_s,\\ q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)", "\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\right]"], "topics": ["D3PM 的转移矩阵", "均匀转移", "吸收转移", "高斯化转移", "累积转移矩阵", "后验分布", "ELBO", "训练目标", "采样", "反例：转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效", "与 masked 扩散的关系", "与连续扩散的对照", "代码：D3PM 训练", "代码：转移矩阵的数值验证", "与 masked 章的接口", "本章推导链：转移矩阵决定扩散"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df20--h-D3PM-的转移矩阵\">D3PM 的转移矩阵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-D3PM-的转移矩阵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节固定离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上概率单纯形，其元素写成行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(v_1,\\dots,v_K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_K(\\mathbb R)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 实矩阵全体；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in M_K(\\mathbb R)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{ij}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 列元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。行随机矩阵指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{ij}\\ge 0$</span> 且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j Q_{ij}=1$</span>；全体行随机矩阵记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_K$</span>。单位矩阵记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span>。对行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 与行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ$</span> 表示矩阵乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ (vQ)_j=\\sum_i v_i Q_{ij}$</span>，仍是概率行向量。</p>\n<p>时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 固定。给定超参数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)_{t=1}^T\\subset[0,1]$</span>。本节只做一件事：定义 D3PM 的<strong>单步转移矩阵族</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span>，给出其基本代数性质，并说明“转移矩阵”这一对象与相邻概念（转移核、得分函数、概率流）的区别。累积转移、后验、ELBO 分别在后继节展开，本节不重复。</p>\n<p>假设 A1（有限状态与离散时间）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设使所有矩阵为有限维，所有期望为有限和，从而本节全部交换求和与极限的操作由有限性自动合法（无需 Dominated Convergence；有限和即有限项相加）。</p>\n<p>假设 A2（行随机性）：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 上的仿射自映射。</p>\n<p>假设 A3（可逆性，仅在第 4 小节的一个推论中额外要求）：若某命题需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆，则显式写出“假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆”，并说明它在何种参数下成立。不可逆情形对后验的影响不在本节处理，见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-定义-单步转移矩阵与转移核的区分\">定义：单步转移矩阵与转移核的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-定义-单步转移矩阵与转移核的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 20.1（单步转移矩阵）</strong> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的<strong>前向转移矩阵</strong>，若它满足：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)=(Q_t)_{ij},\\qquad j\\in\\mathcal X.$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行是条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=\\cdot\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span> 的概率质量函数。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> 转移矩阵是<strong>有限状态、离散时间</strong>下的转移核：它是映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\mapsto (Q_t)_{i\\cdot}$</span>，用矩阵行存储。它与连续扩散中的得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t(x)$</span> 不是同一对象：得分是概率密度对数梯度的向量场，作用于连续空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>；转移矩阵作用于有限集，无需求导，也无需密度存在。它与概率流 ODE 的速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t(x)$</span> 亦不同：后者是确定性常微分方程的右端，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 描述的是随机转移的条件分布。三者的共同点是都“生成”一个随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 演化的分布族，但数学类型分别是矩阵、向量场、向量场，不可混用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2（行随机性封闭性）</strong> 在假设 A1–A2 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 非负性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_j=\\sum_i v_i(Q_t)_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\ge0$</span>。归一性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j (vQ_t)_j=\\sum_j\\sum_i v_i(Q_t)_{ij}=\\sum_i v_i\\sum_j(Q_t)_{ij}=\\sum_i v_i\\cdot 1=1$</span>，其中第二个等号交换有限和次序（有限性，Fubini 的平凡情形），第三个等号用行随机性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 到自身的仿射映射；它不是线性映射（因定义域是单纯形而非全空间），但其延拓 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\mapsto vQ_t$</span> 在整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 上是线性的。这一区分在讨论“矩阵可逆”时重要：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 上的线性算子可逆，与它作为单纯形上映射的双射性不是一回事。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-三个构造族的一般形式\">三个构造族的一般形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-三个构造族的一般形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>D3PM 的转移矩阵族由三个参数化的构造给出，本节只定义其一般形式并验证行随机性；各族的详细性质分别在第 2、3、4 节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>(i) 均匀族。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I_K+\\beta_t\\,\\mathbf 1_K\\mathbf 1_K^{\\top}/K,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1_K$</span> 为全 1 列向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1_K\\mathbf 1_K^\\top/K$</span> 是每行均为均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/K,\\dots,1/K)$</span> 的矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时即 canonical 形式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>行随机性：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t+\\beta_t/K$</span>，非对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/K$</span>，行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t+\\beta_t(K-1)/K+\\beta_t/K=1$</span>。非负性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t+\\beta_t/K\\ge0$</span>，后者对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le1$</span> 成立（最坏情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K\\ge0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>(ii) 吸收族。</strong> 固定吸收状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathcal X$</span>（常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=K$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Q_t)_{ij}=\\begin{cases}1, &amp; i=m,\\ j=m,\\\\ 0, &amp; i=m,\\ j\\ne m,\\\\ 1-\\beta_t, &amp; i\\ne m,\\ j=i,\\\\ \\beta_t, &amp; i\\ne m,\\ j=m,\\\\ 0, &amp; i\\ne m,\\ j\\ne i,\\ j\\ne m.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p>即非吸收态以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 停留；<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为吸收态。行随机性逐行验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m$</span> 行和为 1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t=1$</span>。非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(iii) 高斯化族。</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 带有序结构，取“离散高斯核” <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\sigma:\\mathbb Z\\to[0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\sigma(d)=\\exp(-d^2/(2\\sigma^2))$</span>（未归一化），令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Q_t)_{ij}=\\frac{g_{\\sigma_t}(j-i)}{\\sum_{k=1}^K g_{\\sigma_t}(k-i)},\\qquad \\sigma_t&gt;0.$$</div>\n<p>分母为正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=i$</span> 项为 1），故定义良好；每行按构造归一，非负性由指数函数正性。此族是“把连续高斯转移核在整数格上采样并截断归一化”的离散类比，其与连续扩散的对照见第 12 节。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3（三族的行随机性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，上述 (i)(ii)(iii) 三族在所述参数范围内均为行随机矩阵。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i)(ii) 已逐行验证如上。(iii) 每行元素非负且按分母归一，行和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j g_{\\sigma_t}(j-i)/\\sum_k g_{\\sigma_t}(k-i)=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-主定理-转移矩阵的复合与结合律\">主定理：转移矩阵的复合与结合律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-主定理-转移矩阵的复合与结合律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 只描述一步；扩散过程需要多步复合。本节给出复合的代数基础，累积转移的显式公式留给第 5 节。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 20.4（复合的行随机性与结合律）</strong> 在假设 A1–A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，乘积</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_{s:t}:=Q_sQ_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t$$</div>\n<p>（矩阵乘法，指标递增次序）是行随机矩阵；且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le r\\le s\\le t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{r:t}=Q_{r:s}Q_{s+1:t}$</span>（结合律）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 先证两矩阵乘积行随机。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A,B\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k A_{ik}B_{kj}\\ge0$</span>。行和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_j\\sum_k A_{ik}B_{kj}=\\sum_k A_{ik}\\sum_j B_{kj}=\\sum_k A_{ik}\\cdot1=1$</span>，交换有限和用 Fubini 平凡情形。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$AB\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s,\\dots,Q_t$</span> 归纳即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s:t}\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span>。结合律是矩阵乘法的普遍性质，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_K$</span> 上继承。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.5（多步条件分布的矩阵表示）</strong> 在假设 A1–A2 下，对任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=\\cdot\\mid x_0\\sim v)=vQ_{1:t}.$$</div>\n<p>即“先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，再逐步按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1,\\dots,Q_t$</span> 转移”得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘分布，等于行向量与累积矩阵之积。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=j\\mid x_0\\sim v)=\\sum_i v_i(Q_1)_{ij}=(vQ_1)_j$</span>。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=\\cdot)=vQ_{1:t-1}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j)=\\sum_i q(x_{t-1}=i)(Q_t)_{ij}=\\sum_i (vQ_{1:t-1})_i(Q_t)_{ij}=(vQ_{1:t-1}Q_t)_j=(vQ_{1:t})_j,$$</div>\n<p>第二个等号用马尔可夫性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布不依赖更早历史，这是前向过程定义的一部分），第三个等号是矩阵乘法定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是后继节“<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>”的矩阵基础：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>（退化分布）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_{1:t}$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-可检验恒等式-均匀族的谱与幂等极限\">可检验恒等式：均匀族的谱与幂等极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-可检验恒等式-均匀族的谱与幂等极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.6（均匀族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的谱分解）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span>（特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1)$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=1-2\\beta_t$</span>（特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,-1)$</span>），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^n=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+(1-2\\beta_t)^n &amp; 1-(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\\\ 1-(1-2\\beta_t)^n &amp; 1+(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad n\\in\\mathbb N.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(1,1)^\\top=(1,1)^\\top$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(1,-1)^\\top=(1-2\\beta_t)(1,-1)^\\top$</span>。因两特征向量线性无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可对角化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=PDP^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D=\\mathrm{diag}(1,1-2\\beta_t)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n=PD^nP^{-1}$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{-1}=\\frac12 P$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^2=2I$</span>），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^n=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+(1-2\\beta_t)^n&amp;1-(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\\\1-(1-2\\beta_t)^n&amp;1+(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\end{pmatrix}. \\square$$</div>\n<p><strong>推论 20.7（幂等极限）</strong> 在命题 20.6 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-2\\beta_t|&lt;1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}Q_t^n=\\frac12\\mathbf 1_2\\mathbf 1_2^\\top$</span>，即每行趋于均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=I_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n=I_2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 成立，极限不存在（不收敛到均匀）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\beta_t\\in[-1,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-2\\beta_t)^n\\to0$</span>，代入命题 20.6 的公式得极限矩阵每行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=I_2$</span>，显然。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可数值检验的断言：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=50$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span> 的 Frobenius 范数差应小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-10}$</span> 量级（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|0.4|^{50}\\approx 10^{-20}$</span>）。第 14 节的代码将验证此点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-一个具体例子-三状态均匀族的显式计算\">一个具体例子：三状态均匀族的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-一个具体例子-三状态均匀族的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.6$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}0.4+0.2&amp;0.2&amp;0.2\\\\0.2&amp;0.4+0.2&amp;0.2\\\\0.2&amp;0.2&amp;0.4+0.2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.6&amp;0.2&amp;0.2\\\\0.2&amp;0.6&amp;0.2\\\\0.2&amp;0.2&amp;0.6\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>验证行和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6+0.2+0.2=1$</span>。特征值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span>（向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1,1)$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=\\lambda_3=1-\\beta_t=0.4$</span>（重根，特征子空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span>，维数 2）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n=\\frac13\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top+(0.4)^n(I_3-\\frac13\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=10$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.4)^{10}\\approx1.05\\times10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{10}$</span> 已接近均匀矩阵至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 量级。此例说明：均匀族的混合速度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 越大混合越快；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 一步即为均匀矩阵（秩 1，不可逆）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.8（均匀族一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的谱）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I_K+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top/K$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span>（重数 1，特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1-\\beta_t$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，特征子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\perp\\mathbf 1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i v_i=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_tv=(1-\\beta_t)v+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1(\\mathbf 1^\\top v)/K=(1-\\beta_t)v$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1^\\top v=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_i v_i=0\\}$</span>（维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）是特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 的特征子空间。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=(1-\\beta_t)\\mathbf 1+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>。特征值计数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+(K-1)=K$</span> 已满。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由此，均匀族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t\\ne0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 秩 1，不可逆。这一事实在第 10 节的反例中会被用到：不可逆转移矩阵使后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的定义出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的求逆，从而失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-吸收族的代数结构-幂零性与吸收时间\">吸收族的代数结构：幂零性与吸收时间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-吸收族的代数结构-幂零性与吸收时间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>均匀族的谱由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 控制，其行为是“向均匀分布收缩”。吸收族则完全不同：它把概率质量单向输运到吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，因此其谱含大量零特征值，且矩阵不可逆（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）。本节把这一结构写成命题，为后继“后验失效”与“masked 扩散接口”两节提供代数依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9（吸收族的谱与秩）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为吸收族矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span>（特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>，即第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个标准基向量）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1-\\beta_t$</span>（重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，特征子空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:v_m=0\\}$</span>）；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t)=K$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t)=1$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 对任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t$</span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m+(1-v_m)\\beta_t$</span>，在非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 先看 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\dots,0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_mQ_t=e_m$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span> 是左特征向量（行向量约定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t=\\lambda v$</span> 的解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>）。再看 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m=0$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_i=\\sum_j v_j(Q_t)_{ji}=v_i(1-\\beta_t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span> 时只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i$</span> 项非零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m=0$</span> 排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 行）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_m=\\sum_{j\\ne m}v_j\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\sum_{j\\ne m}v_j$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\ne m}v_j=\\sum_j v_j$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 未必归一，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_m=\\beta_t\\sum_j v_j$</span>，一般不为零。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:v_m=0\\}$</span> <strong>不是</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的不变子空间，需要精确表述。</p>\n<p>正确的特征子空间应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0,\\ v_m=0\\}$</span>？验证：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j v_j=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_m=\\beta_t\\sum_{j\\ne m}v_j=\\beta_t\\sum_j v_j=0$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_i=v_i(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t=(1-\\beta_t)v$</span> 当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i(1-\\beta_t)=v_i(1-\\beta_t)$</span>（恒等）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量为零（已证）。因此特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 的特征子空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:v_m=0,\\ \\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span>，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-1)-1=K-2$</span>。加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span> 的一维，共 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维，还差一维。</p>\n<p>剩余一维来自何处？考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=e_i-e_m$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_iQ_t$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 在对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>、其余零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_mQ_t=e_m$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_i-e_m)Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)e_i+\\beta_t e_m-e_m=(1-\\beta_t)e_i-(1-\\beta_t)e_m=(1-\\beta_t)(e_i-e_m)$</span>。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i-e_m$</span> 也是特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 的特征向量，且它满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1\\ne0$</span>，故不属于上面的子空间。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:v_m=0,\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{e_i-e_m:i\\ne m\\}$</span> 的并张成整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span>？检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i-e_m$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>，和为零；两者都是和为零的子空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span>（维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）的子空间。前者维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-2$</span>，后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个向量张成但线性相关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(e_i-e_m)=0$</span>），维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-2$</span>。两者之和的维数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-2+K-2$</span>，但实际它们相等吗？取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=3$</span>：前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:v_3=0,v_1+v_2=0\\}=\\mathrm{span}\\{(1,-1,0)\\}$</span>；后者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{(1,0,-1),(0,1,-1)\\}$</span>，维数 2。前者是后者的子空间。故特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 的特征子空间就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span>，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，与均匀族相同！这与“吸收族谱含零特征值”的直觉矛盾，需重新检查。</p>\n<p>重新计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i-e_m$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_i-e_m)Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ii}=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-e_m$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(Q_t)_{mi}=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 处为零），故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{im}=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-e_m$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(Q_t)_{mm}=-1$</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t-1=-(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i,m$</span>）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-e_m$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(Q_t)_{mj}=0$</span>，故为 0。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_i-e_m)Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)e_i-(1-\\beta_t)e_m=(1-\\beta_t)(e_i-e_m)$</span>。正确。</p>\n<p>那么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span> 是否整个是特征子空间？取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,0,-1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3,m=3$</span>），和为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t$</span>：第 1 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot(1-\\beta_t)+0+(-1)\\cdot0=1-\\beta_t$</span>；第 2 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；第 3 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot\\beta_t+0+(-1)\\cdot1=\\beta_t-1=-(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t=(1-\\beta_t,0,-(1-\\beta_t))=(1-\\beta_t)v$</span>。是的。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=(1,-1,0)$</span>，和为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_t$</span> 第 1 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，第 2 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，第 3 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t-\\beta_t=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=(1-\\beta_t)v$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:\\sum_j v_j=0\\}$</span> 整个是特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 的特征子空间，维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>。加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>（和不为零），特征值计数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+(K-1)=K$</span> 满。所以吸收族的谱与均匀族<strong>相同</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,1-\\beta_t\\}$</span>（后者重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）。这与“吸收”直觉不符，因为吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 是唯一的不动点，但谱不区分哪个状态被吸收——谱只看到“和为零子空间被压缩”。</p>\n<p>那么吸收族与均匀族的区别在哪里？在<strong>特征向量</strong>：均匀族的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 特征向量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span>（均匀分布方向），吸收族的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>（退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>）。两者谱相同但特征基不同，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n$</span> 的极限不同：均匀族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n\\to\\frac1K\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span>（每行均匀），吸收族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n\\to\\mathbf 1 e_m^\\top$</span>（每行退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>）。验证后者：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_iQ_t^n$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>，因每步以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 吸收，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 步后仍在非吸收态的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)^n\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span>）。故极限矩阵每行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 秩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的行空间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{e_i:i\\ne m\\}$</span> 张成？<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)e_i+\\beta_t e_m$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>。这些行张成的空间：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 可由第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t e_m$</span> 再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 得到，故行空间含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span>，秩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>，所有行相同，秩 1。</p>\n<p>(iii) 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_m=\\sum_j v_j(Q_t)_{jm}=v_m\\cdot1+\\sum_{j\\ne m}v_j\\beta_t=v_m+(1-v_m)\\beta_t$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(vQ_t)_i=\\sum_j v_j(Q_t)_{ji}=v_i(1-\\beta_t)$</span>（只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i$</span> 项非零）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.10（吸收族的幂等极限与不可逆性）</strong> 在命题 20.9 条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}Q_t^n=\\mathbf 1 e_m^\\top$</span>，即每行趋于退化分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_m$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 不可逆（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}\\cdot1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\ne0$</span>，可逆）。故吸收族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时不可逆。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 极限：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_iQ_t^n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 上的质量由 (iii) 迭代得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\beta_t)^n\\to1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m=0$</span> 初始，每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_m+(1-v_m)\\beta_t$</span>，归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-(1-\\beta_t)^n$</span>），故趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_mQ_t^n=e_m$</span>。行列式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为上三角。事实并非如此：按行看，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列非零，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 行在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列非零。按列看，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t,\\dots,\\beta_t,1)^\\top$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)e_i$</span>。行列式按列展开：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 列（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>）只有第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行非零，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>；第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列在删去前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 行后剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det=(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：命题 20.9 的谱结论与均匀族相同，但<strong>特征向量不同</strong>，这是两族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n$</span> 极限上分道扬镳的根源。这一区分对后继节重要：均匀族的极限是“无信息均匀分布”，吸收族的极限是“退化到吸收态”，两者在 ELBO 中的角色不同（前者对应无分类先验，后者对应 masked 扩散的 mask 态）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-高斯化族的行随机性与对称性检验\">高斯化族的行随机性与对称性检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-高斯化族的行随机性与对称性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>高斯化族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}=g_{\\sigma_t}(j-i)/\\sum_k g_{\\sigma_t}(k-i)$</span> 的定义依赖状态空间的<strong>有序结构</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j-i$</span> 有意义），这与均匀族、吸收族不同：后两者只依赖集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>，不依赖编号。因此高斯化族在状态重标号下不不变，这是它作为“离散类比连续高斯”的代价。本节给出两个可检验性质。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.11（高斯化族的行随机性与非对称性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，高斯化族每行归一（已证于命题 20.3）。此外：</p>\n<p>(i) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 一般<strong>不是</strong>对称矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\ne(Q_t)_{ji}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 靠近边界时。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}=g(j-i)/Z_i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ji}=g(i-j)/Z_j=g(j-i)/Z_j$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_k g(k-i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_j=\\sum_k g(k-j)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 偶函数，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}/(Q_t)_{ji}=Z_j/Z_i$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 靠近边界（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>）而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 在内部时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i&lt;Z_j$</span>（边界处截断更多质量），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}&gt;(Q_t)_{ji}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span>（无限格），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\to\\sum_{d\\in\\mathbb Z}g(d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 成为循环矩阵（Toeplitz），此时对称。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 直接由定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 偶性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{k-i:k\\in\\mathcal X\\}$</span> 上的和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1-i,K-i]$</span> 上的整数采样和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span> 时区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,K-1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 在内部时区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1-i,K-i]$</span> 含更多负方向项，但因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 偶函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 靠近中心而增大（截断损失减小）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1&lt;Z_j$</span> 对内部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{1j}&gt;(Q_t)_{j1}$</span>。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_{d=-\\infty}^{\\infty}g(d)$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 元素只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-i$</span>，是 Toeplitz 且因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 偶而对称。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：高斯化族在有限状态空间上<strong>不是</strong>双随机矩阵（列和不为 1），也不是对称矩阵；它是“行随机但列不随机”的。这与均匀族（双随机，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top/K$</span> 对称且行和列和均为 1）形成对照。后继节讨论“与连续扩散的对照”时，这一非对称性是离散截断的必然产物，需在 ELBO 中显式处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-转移矩阵的可表示性-三族的统一参数化\">转移矩阵的可表示性：三族的统一参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-转移矩阵的可表示性-三族的统一参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三族看似不同，但都可写成“基础矩阵 + 秩一修正”或“置换 + 对角”的形式。本节给出统一视角，说明它们都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_K$</span> 的子族，且都可由一个标量参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>）连续形变到恒等矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.12（三族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时的连续性）</strong> 在假设 A1 下：</p>\n<p>(i) 均匀族：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\beta_t\\to0}Q_t=I_K$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 吸收族：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\beta_t\\to0}Q_t=I_K$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 高斯化族：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\sigma_t\\to0}Q_t=I_K$</span>（对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，逐元素极限）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I_K+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top/K\\to I_K$</span>。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时非吸收态停留概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t\\to1$</span>，跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\to I_K$</span>。(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma_t}(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma_t}(d)\\to0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ne0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-d^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))\\to0$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\to\\delta_{ij}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明三族都是“恒等矩阵的连续扰动”，扰动强度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t$</span> 控制。这一统一视角在后继“累积转移矩阵”节中用于讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时趋于何种极限：均匀族趋于均匀矩阵，吸收族趋于退化矩阵，高斯化族趋于“宽高斯”矩阵（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 大时行近似均匀）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-一个反例边界-高斯化族在-K-2-时退化为均匀族\">一个反例边界：高斯化族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时退化为均匀族<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-一个反例边界-高斯化族在-K-2-时退化为均匀族\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 高斯化族即均匀族）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，高斯化族参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与均匀族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 形式相同，参数对应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=g_{\\sigma_t}(1)/(g_{\\sigma_t}(0)+g_{\\sigma_t}(1))$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j-i\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=g(0)+g(1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{11}=g(0)/Z_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{12}=g(1)/Z_1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2=g(0)+g(-1)=g(0)+g(1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 偶），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{21}=g(-1)/Z_2=g(1)/Z_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{22}=g(0)/Z_2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\\\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=g(1)/(g(0)+g(1))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是“可表示性”的一个边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时高斯化族没有独立于均匀族的新内容；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge3$</span> 时高斯化族才因边界截断的非对称性而区别于均匀族。后继节“与连续扩散的对照”会用到此点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的离散扩散与连续扩散的类比最干净，因两状态时无边界效应。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>D3PM 的单步转移矩阵是有限状态、离散时间的行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathcal S_K$</span>，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行是条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=\\cdot\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>；它与得分函数、概率流速度场是不同类型的数学对象，不可混用。</li>\n<li>均匀、吸收、高斯化三族在所述参数范围内均为行随机矩阵；复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s:t}=Q_s\\cdots Q_t$</span> 仍行随机，且多步边缘分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$vQ_{1:t}$</span> 给出（推论 20.5），这是后继节累积转移与 ELBO 的代数基础。</li>\n<li>均匀族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的谱为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,1-2\\beta_t\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 一般时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,1-\\beta_t\\}$</span>（后者重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n\\to$</span> 均匀矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 秩 1 不可逆——可逆性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 是后继后验节的关键假设。</li>\n<li>吸收族的谱与均匀族相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,1-\\beta_t\\}$</span>，后者重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>），但特征向量不同：均匀族的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 向量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span>，吸收族的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>；这导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^n$</span> 极限分别为均匀矩阵与退化矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span>。吸收族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时不可逆。</li>\n<li>高斯化族在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 下行随机但一般非对称、非双随机，其非对称性来自边界截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i\\ne Z_j$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时退化为对称 Toeplitz 矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时高斯化族与均匀族重合，参数对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=g(1)/(g(0)+g(1))$</span>。</li>\n<li>三族在扰动强度趋于零时均连续回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span>，故都是“恒等矩阵的连续扰动”；这一统一视角为后继累积转移矩阵的极限分析提供框架。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移\">均匀转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的 D3PM 基本对象：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>；前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span>，转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>，行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且元素非负；初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta^{K-1}=\\{p\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge0}^{K}:\\sum_i p_i=1\\}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的转移强度参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 仅在需要与连续扩散对照时出现，本节不展开。行向量约定：概率分布写成行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathbb{R}^{1\\times K}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$pQ_t$</span> 表示一步演化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=e_{x_0}\\bar Q_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_i$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个标准基行向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s$</span>（乘积按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span> 顺序，作用于行向量右侧）。</p>\n<p>本节只处理二状态均匀情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，并在末尾给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 的注记；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 的完整构造属于第 3、4 节。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,1)^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathbf{1}\\mathbf{1}^\\top$</span> 为全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 单位阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1-2\\beta_t$</span> 为均匀转移的收缩因子。所有矩阵均为实矩阵，维度在首次出现时标明。</p>\n<p>假设 A1（参数正则性）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset(0,1)$</span> 为确定性序列，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max}\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}\\le\\beta_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。该假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 严格正且可逆，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 可逆，后验条件概率的分母非零。</p>\n<p>假设 A2（初始分布可积性）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，无需额外正则性，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限，所有期望均为有限和。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-定义-二状态均匀转移矩阵\">定义：二状态均匀转移矩阵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-定义-二状态均匀转移矩阵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 20.2.1（均匀转移）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的均匀转移矩阵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t &amp; \\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t &amp; 1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{2\\times2}.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I+\\beta_t(J-I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J-I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 为交换矩阵。行和验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t=1$</span>，两行相同。</p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别：均匀转移与吸收转移（第 3 节）的区别在于，均匀转移以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 将当前状态翻转到另一状态，两个状态对称，不存在“吸收态”；与高斯化转移（第 4 节）的区别在于，均匀转移在离散状态上定义，不通过嵌入连续空间再离散化得到。均匀转移是 D3PM 中最简单的非平凡转移核，其全部谱信息可显式算出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.2（谱结构）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1-2\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，对应特征向量分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,-1)^\\top$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可正交对角化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=\\frac{1+\\lambda_t}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\lambda_t}{2}(J-I).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf{1}=((1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t,(1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t)^\\top=\\mathbf{1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}$</span> 为特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的特征向量。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(1,-1)^\\top=((1-\\beta_t)-\\beta_t,\\beta_t-(1-\\beta_t))^\\top=(1-2\\beta_t)(1,-1)^\\top=\\lambda_t(1,-1)^\\top$</span>。两个特征向量线性无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为实对称矩阵，故可正交对角化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(-1,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_t|&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的所有特征值绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且非零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t=\\lambda_t\\ne0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-累积转移的显式公式\">累积转移的显式公式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-累积转移的显式公式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.3（累积转移的闭式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}(J-I),\\qquad \\bar\\lambda_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\lambda_s=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-2\\beta_s).$$</div>\n<p>从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=e_{x_0}\\bar Q_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=x_0\\mid x_0)=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2},\\qquad q(x_t\\ne x_0\\mid x_0)=\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时由命题 20.2.2 直接成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}(J-I)$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J-I$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)^2=I$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(J-I)=(J-I)I=J-I$</span>，故二者生成的代数中乘法按分量进行：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(a)=\\frac{1+a}{2}I+\\frac{1-a}{2}(J-I)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(a)M(b)=M(ab)$</span>。验证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M(a)M(b)=\\frac{(1+a)(1+b)}{4}I+\\frac{(1-a)(1-b)}{4}I+\\frac{(1+a)(1-b)+(1-a)(1+b)}{4}(J-I).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+a+b+ab+1-a-b+ab}{4}=\\frac{1+ab}{2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+b-a-ab+1+b-a-ab}{4}=\\frac{1-ab}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(a)M(b)=M(ab)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\lambda_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=M(\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}\\lambda_t)=M(\\bar\\lambda_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.2.4（均匀转移的极限分布）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{\\infty}\\beta_t=\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t\\to0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to\\frac{1}{2}J$</span>，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\to(\\frac12,\\frac12)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1-2\\beta_t$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\lambda_t=\\log(1-2\\beta_t)\\le-2\\beta_t$</span>（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-u)\\le-u$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in(0,1)$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\lambda_t=\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\log\\lambda_s\\le-2\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\beta_s\\to-\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t\\to0$</span>。代入命题 20.2.3 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明均匀转移在无限步极限下遗忘初始状态，与连续扩散中前向过程趋向标准正态的作用对应，但极限分布为均匀分布而非高斯分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-具体例子-两步均匀转移的数值验证\">具体例子：两步均匀转移的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-具体例子-两步均匀转移的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.3$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_2=0.32$</span>。由命题 20.2.3，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_2=\\frac{1.32}{2}I+\\frac{0.68}{2}(J-I)=\\begin{pmatrix}0.66&amp;0.34\\\\0.34&amp;0.66\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>直接相乘验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0.9&amp;0.1\\\\0.1&amp;0.9\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0.7&amp;0.3\\\\0.3&amp;0.7\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.63+0.03&amp;0.27+0.07\\\\0.03+0.63&amp;0.07+0.27\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.66&amp;0.34\\\\0.34&amp;0.66\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，与闭式一致。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=1\\mid x_0=1)=0.66$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=2\\mid x_0=1)=0.34$</span>，行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移下的-ELBO-接口\">均匀转移下的 ELBO 接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移下的-ELBO-接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开 ELBO 的完整推导（属于第 7 节），但需给出均匀转移下 ELBO 中后验项的显式形式，以说明本节构造与 canonical claim 的衔接。在假设 A1 下，由贝叶斯公式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)\\,q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_0=k)}{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)},\\qquad i,j,k\\in\\{1,2\\}.$$</div>\n<p>分母由命题 20.2.3 给出且非零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t\\in(-1,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)\\ge\\frac{1-|\\bar\\lambda_t|}{2}&gt;0$</span>）。分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)=Q_t(i,j)$</span> 由定义 20.2.1 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_0=k)=\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)$</span> 由命题 20.2.3 给出。因此后验是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2\\}$</span> 上的二元分类分布，其 KL 散度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\sum_{i=1}^{2}q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)}$$</div>\n<p>为有限和，无需额外可积性假设。这与 canonical claim 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的表达式一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))]$</span>，其中期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_{1:T})$</span> 取，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的因子分解由马尔可夫性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=Q_t(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 确定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移的可表示性与数值性质\">均匀转移的可表示性与数值性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移的可表示性与数值性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>均匀转移的核心数值性质是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 完全由标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 决定，存储代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^2)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时平凡，但该性质在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 的置换型均匀转移中推广为循环矩阵的谱表示）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 只需连乘标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_s$</span>，避免了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 矩阵乘法的累积舍入误差；在浮点运算中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 的连乘可能下溢至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12J$</span>，与推论 20.2.4 的极限一致，数值上无害。相反，若直接连乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>，舍入误差累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，而标量连乘的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span> 但常数更小，且不会破坏行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的精确性（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}=1$</span> 在浮点下若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 精确则精确，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 有舍入则行和偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>）。</p>\n<p>可表示性方面，均匀转移的转移矩阵族由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 参数化，是 D3PM 三种转移核中参数最少者；其代价是状态空间必须为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 时采用置换型推广（第 3 节不涉及，本节不展开）。均匀转移不依赖于状态标签的序结构，仅依赖于“翻转/不翻转”的二值事件，因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时与吸收转移共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 矩阵结构，区别仅在非对角元是否依赖于当前状态。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>二状态均匀转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 是实对称、行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1-2\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的可逆矩阵；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_t|&lt;1$</span>。</li>\n<li>累积转移有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}(J-I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-2\\beta_s)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span> 的每个分量可 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 计算；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t=\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时前向过程趋向均匀分布。</li>\n<li>均匀转移下后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 显式给出，分母因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\lambda_t|&lt;1$</span> 而严格正，ELBO 中的 KL 项为有限和，与 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 表达式一致，无需额外可积性假设。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本节标题承诺说明均匀转移与相邻转移核的区别，前文仅在文字上提及。此处给出一个精确的矩阵恒等式，把均匀转移写成吸收转移的对称化，从而在代数层面区分二者。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.2.7（二状态吸收转移）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，吸收态取为状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。吸收转移矩阵定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>其第一行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span>，表示一旦进入状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 便永久停留；第二行表示以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 跳入状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 留在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.8（对称化恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 为交换矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D=\\mathrm{diag}(1,-1)$</span>。则在假设 A1 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t=\\tfrac12\\big(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}+P\\,Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\,P\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\,Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\,P=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 是以状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 为吸收态的吸收转移矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P\\,Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\,P$</span>：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}P=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，再左乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。两矩阵相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}2-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;2-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t/2&amp;\\beta_t/2\\\\ \\beta_t/2&amp;1-\\beta_t/2\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。这与定义 20.2.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 相差一个参数重标定：若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t'=\\beta_t/2$</span>，则上式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(\\beta_t')$</span>。故在参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t'=\\beta_t/2$</span> 下恒等式成立；若坚持同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，则恒等式应写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(\\beta_t)=\\tfrac12(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(2\\beta_t)+P\\,Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(2\\beta_t)\\,P)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点不是数值相等，而是结构关系：均匀转移是两个相反方向吸收转移的等权平均，因此它对两个状态完全对称，不存在吸收态；吸收转移则破坏这种对称性，其第一行是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t,\\beta_t)$</span>。这一区别在第 3 节将体现为累积转移矩阵的秩结构不同：吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 第一行恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的秩在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而均匀转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12J$</span>，秩同样退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，但极限矩阵不同（前者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12J$</span>）。两者都不可逆于极限，但在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 下均可逆，这是 A1 保证后验分母非零的代数根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移下的前向边缘与条件独立性\">均匀转移下的前向边缘与条件独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移下的前向边缘与条件独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.9（前向边缘的递推）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，设初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=(\\pi_0(1),\\pi_0(2))$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=1)=\\tfrac12+\\bar\\lambda_t\\big(\\pi_0(1)-\\tfrac12\\big),\\qquad q(x_t=2)=\\tfrac12-\\bar\\lambda_t\\big(\\pi_0(1)-\\tfrac12\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=q(x_0)\\bar Q_t$</span> 与命题 20.2.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}(J-I)$</span>。对行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 右乘：第一分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0(1)\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}+\\pi_0(2)\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0(2)=1-\\pi_0(1)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0(1)\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}+(1-\\pi_0(1))\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}=\\frac12+\\bar\\lambda_t(\\pi_0(1)-\\frac12)$</span>。第二分量由行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 得出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该递推说明前向边缘以几何速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 收敛到均匀分布，收敛速度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)$</span> 控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 较小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_s$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，收敛慢；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_s$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，一步即近似均匀。这与连续扩散中前向过程以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 控制信号保留比例的结构平行，但均匀转移的“信号”是初始状态与均匀分布的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0(1)-\\frac12$</span>，而非连续情形的高斯均值。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.2.10（条件独立性的失效边界）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 决定，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=Q_t(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span>，即前向链在给定当前状态时对过去条件独立。但反向地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，二者之差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 共同决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一句是马尔可夫性的定义。第二句：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 边缘化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\sum_{k}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0=k)\\,q(x_0=k\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=k\\mid x_t)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>。除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t=0$</span>（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)=\\pi_0$</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 为均匀分布，否则该边缘化结果与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论是第 7 节 ELBO 中采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的数学依据：前者可显式计算且分母非零，后者需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 求和且在某些参数下退化。均匀转移下前者由命题 20.2.5 给出，计算代价为常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值验证-闭式与矩阵连乘的一致性\">数值验证：闭式与矩阵连乘的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值验证-闭式与矩阵连乘的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个可运行的数值检验，验证命题 20.2.3 的闭式与直接矩阵连乘在浮点下的偏差界，以及推论 20.2.6 的归一化恒等式。该代码属于本节的理论验证，不涉及训练（训练代码属于第 13 节）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef uniform_Q(beta):\n    return np.array([[1.0 - beta, beta], [beta, 1.0 - beta]])\n\ndef cumprod_closed(betas):\n    lam = np.prod([1.0 - 2.0 * b for b in betas])\n    return 0.5 * (1.0 + lam) * np.eye(2) + 0.5 * (1.0 - lam) * (np.ones((2, 2)) - np.eye(2)), lam\n\ndef cumprod_direct(betas):\n    Qbar = np.eye(2)\n    for b in betas:\n        Qbar = Qbar @ uniform_Q(b)\n    return Qbar\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nT = 50\nbetas = rng.uniform(0.01, 0.49, size=T)\n\nQbar_closed, lam = cumprod_closed(betas)\nQbar_direct = cumprod_direct(betas)\n\nerr = np.max(np.abs(Qbar_closed - Qbar_direct))\nassert err &lt; 1e-12, f&quot;closed-form vs direct mismatch: {err}&quot;\nassert np.allclose(Qbar_closed.sum(axis=1), 1.0), &quot;row sums must be 1&quot;\n\n# 后验归一化恒等式\nt = 20\nbeta_t = betas[t - 1]\nlam_prev = np.prod([1.0 - 2.0 * b for b in betas[:t - 1]])\nlam_t = lam_prev * (1.0 - 2.0 * beta_t)\na = 0.5 * (1.0 + lam_prev)\nb = 0.5 * (1.0 - lam_prev)\nc = 0.5 * (1.0 + lam_t)\nd = 0.5 * (1.0 - lam_t)\npost_same = np.array([(1.0 - beta_t) * a / c, beta_t * b / c])\npost_diff = np.array([beta_t * a / d, (1.0 - beta_t) * b / d])\nassert abs(post_same.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(post_diff.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\nassert np.all(post_same &gt; 0) and np.all(post_diff &gt; 0)\n\nprint(&quot;Qbar_closed shape:&quot;, Qbar_closed.shape)\nprint(&quot;Qbar_direct shape:&quot;, Qbar_direct.shape)\nprint(&quot;max |closed - direct|:&quot;, err)\nprint(&quot;lambda_bar_T:&quot;, lam)\nprint(&quot;post_same:&quot;, post_same, &quot;sum:&quot;, post_same.sum())\nprint(&quot;post_diff:&quot;, post_diff, &quot;sum:&quot;, post_diff.sum())\nprint(&quot;expected: err &lt; 1e-12, row sums = 1, posteriors positive and normalized&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>err</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span> 量级，两个后验向量分量均为正且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<code>lambda_bar_T</code> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=50$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 采样落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内但因连乘已很小。该检验覆盖了命题 20.2.3 的闭式、推论 20.2.6 的归一化、以及命题 20.2.5 分母严格正三项断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移的局限-为何需要其他转移核\">均匀转移的局限：为何需要其他转移核<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移的局限-为何需要其他转移核\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节构造的均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时数学上完整，但其可表示性有明确边界：转移矩阵族仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个标量参数化，且每一步以固定概率翻转，不区分状态内容。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 时，若直接把“以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 翻转到另一状态”推广为“以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 均匀跳到任意其他状态”，得到的转移矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I+\\frac{\\beta_t}{K-1}(J-I)$</span>，其谱为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\frac{K}{K-1}\\beta_t$</span>，仍可闭式计算累积转移；但该构造对所有非当前状态等权，无法表达“某些状态更易被吸收”或“状态间距离由嵌入几何决定”的结构。吸收转移（第 3 节）通过指定吸收态打破了这种等权性，高斯化转移（第 4 节）通过把离散状态嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 并用量化高斯核定义转移，使转移概率依赖状态间的几何距离。均匀转移因此是 D3PM 转移核族中对称性最强、参数最少、但表达能力最弱的成员；它的价值在于提供可完全闭式分析的基准，使累积转移、后验、ELBO 的代数结构在无几何与无吸收的干净情形下被隔离出来，后续节的复杂性可逐项归因于对称性破缺与几何嵌入。</p>\n<p>这一局限不构成均匀转移的缺陷，而是其定位：第 10 节的反例将说明转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效，均匀转移在 A1 下始终可逆，故不落入该反例；第 11 节与 masked 扩散的关系中，均匀转移对应“无 mask 的随机翻转”，与 masked 扩散的“单向吸收”形成对照。本节完成的闭式、后验、归一化恒等式与数值检验，为后续节提供了可复用的标量参数化模板：任何行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且可对角化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M(\\lambda)$</span> 形式的二状态转移，其累积、后验与 ELBO 均可按命题 20.2.3、20.2.5、推论 20.2.6 的步骤逐字搬运，只需替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的定义。</p>\n<p>前文把均匀转移写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times2$</span> 矩阵作用在行向量上。这一表述在代数上完整，但在与 ELBO 的标量形式对接时，需要把矩阵作用翻译为伯努利参数的更新规则。本小节建立这一等价，并给出一个可检验的恒等式，使后验的显式公式（命题 20.2.5）与矩阵公式（命题 20.2.3）在同一坐标系下互相验证。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.2.11（伯努利坐标）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，把状态编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1\\}$</span>（与定义 20.2.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2\\}$</span> 仅差一个标签平移，不影响概率）。对任意分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{1}$</span>，记其第一分量（状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的概率）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(p)=p(0)\\in[0,1]$</span>。均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 在伯努利坐标下诱导映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:[0,1]\\to[0,1]$</span>，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(pQ_t)=\\Phi_t(\\theta(p))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.12（伯努利坐标下的仿射更新）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_t(\\theta)=(1-\\beta_t)\\theta+\\beta_t(1-\\theta)=\\beta_t+(1-2\\beta_t)\\theta=\\beta_t+\\lambda_t\\theta.$$</div>\n<p>即均匀转移在伯努利坐标下是斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span>、截距为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的仿射映射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\beta_t,1-\\beta_t]\\subset[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(\\theta,1-\\theta)$</span>。由定义 20.2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$pQ_t$</span> 的第一分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta(1-\\beta_t)+(1-\\theta)\\beta_t=\\beta_t+(1-2\\beta_t)\\theta$</span>。第二分量由行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\Phi_t(\\theta)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in[0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(-1,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 在端点取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(0)=\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(1)=1-\\beta_t$</span>，仿射性保证值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\beta_t,1-\\beta_t]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的意义在于：累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 在伯努利坐标下对应仿射映射的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 次复合。仿射映射的复合仍是仿射映射，斜率相乘、截距按几何级数累积，这正是命题 20.2.3 的标量版本。下面把这个复合写出来，作为对命题 20.2.3 的独立验证。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.2.13（复合的闭式与截距恒等式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{1:t}=\\Phi_t\\circ\\Phi_{t-1}\\circ\\cdots\\circ\\Phi_1$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{1:t}(\\theta)=\\bar\\lambda_t\\,\\theta+\\bar\\beta_t,\\qquad \\bar\\beta_t=\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\beta_s\\prod_{r=s+1}^{t}\\lambda_r,$$</div>\n<p>其中空乘积约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。且截距满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1(\\theta)=\\lambda_1\\theta+\\beta_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\lambda_1}{2}=\\frac{1-(1-2\\beta_1)}{2}=\\beta_1$</span>，恒等式成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{1:t-1}(\\theta)=\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}\\theta+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{1:t}(\\theta)=\\Phi_t\\big(\\Phi_{1:t-1}(\\theta)\\big)=\\lambda_t\\Big(\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}\\theta+\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}\\Big)+\\beta_t=\\bar\\lambda_t\\theta+\\lambda_t\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}+\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p>截距为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}+\\beta_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1-2\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t=\\lambda_t\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}+\\beta_t=\\frac{\\lambda_t-\\lambda_t\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}+\\frac{2\\beta_t}{2}=\\frac{\\lambda_t-\\bar\\lambda_t+2\\beta_t}{2}=\\frac{(1-2\\beta_t)-\\bar\\lambda_t+2\\beta_t}{2}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}.$$</div>\n<p>故归纳步骤成立，且截距恒等式对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 20.2.13 给出的截距恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span> 与命题 20.2.3 的矩阵闭式是同一事实的两种写法：矩阵闭式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span>、非对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span>，而伯努利坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{1:t}(0)=\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 正是“从状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 出发、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步后处于状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>”的概率，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的非对角元。两条推导路径（矩阵归纳与仿射复合归纳）给出相同结果，互为校验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.14（后验的伯努利形式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0$</span>，则后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=0\\mid x_t=0,x_0=0)$</span> 可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=0\\mid x_t=0,x_0=0)=\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\big(\\tfrac{1+\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}\\big)}{\\tfrac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}}.$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=0\\mid x_t=1,x_0=0)=\\frac{\\beta_t\\big(\\tfrac{1+\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}\\big)}{\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=0\\mid x_t=j,x_0=0)=\\frac{Q_t(0,j)\\,\\bar Q_{t-1}(0,0)}{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=0)}$</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(0,0)=1-\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(0,1)=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(0,0)=\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_{t-1}}{2}$</span>，分母由命题 20.2.3 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}$</span>。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.2.14 的两个分母分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne x_0$</span> 两种情形，由 A1 它们严格正：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t\\in(-1,1)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1+\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\lambda_t}{2}&gt;0$</span>。这与数值验证代码中 <code>post_same</code> 与 <code>post_diff</code> 的构造逐项对应，代码中 <code>a,b,c,d</code> 正是上述四个量。因此代码断言的后验正性与归一化，在数学上由命题 20.2.14 与 A1 共同保证，而非仅由浮点检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移的谱间隙与混合时间\">均匀转移的谱间隙与混合时间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移的谱间隙与混合时间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 20.2.2 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。在马尔可夫链的混合时间分析中，第二个特征值的绝对值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_t|=|1-2\\beta_t|$</span> 控制单步收缩速率。本小节把这一谱信息翻译为累积转移的混合时间界，说明均匀转移的“遗忘速度”完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.2.15（混合时间）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_{\\mathrm{unif}}=(\\tfrac12,\\tfrac12)$</span> 为均匀分布。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步分布与均匀分布的全变差距离为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(t)=\\sup_{A\\subset\\{0,1\\}}\\big|q(x_t\\in A)-\\pi_{\\mathrm{unif}}(A)\\big|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.16（全变差距离的闭式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，对任意初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(t)=\\frac{|\\bar\\lambda_t|}{2}\\cdot\\big|2\\pi_0(0)-1\\big|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 20.2.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=0)=\\frac12+\\bar\\lambda_t(\\pi_0(0)-\\frac12)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=1)=\\frac12-\\bar\\lambda_t(\\pi_0(0)-\\frac12)$</span>。两个单点集上的偏差绝对值均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{|\\bar\\lambda_t|}{2}|2\\pi_0(0)-1|$</span>。对二元素空间，全变差距离等于单点偏差绝对值的最大值（因为任意子集的偏差是单点偏差的线性组合，最大值在单点集取得）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.2.17（混合时间界）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，若给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(t)\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\bar\\lambda_t|\\le\\frac{2\\varepsilon}{|2\\pi_0(0)-1|},$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0(0)\\ne\\frac12$</span> 时。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0=\\pi_{\\mathrm{unif}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(t)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接由命题 20.2.16 解不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论说明均匀转移的混合时间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 的衰减速度决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t=\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)$</span>。当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\beta$</span> 为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t=(1-2\\beta)^t$</span>，混合时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_{\\mathrm{mix}}=O\\big(\\frac{\\log(1/\\varepsilon)}{|\\log(1-2\\beta)|}\\big)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\frac12$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(1-2\\beta)|\\to\\infty$</span>，混合极快；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to0$</span> 时混合极慢。这一行为与连续扩散中前向过程以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 控制信号保留、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 控制噪声注入的结构平行，但均匀转移的极限分布是均匀分布而非标准正态，混合时间的标量控制量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\lambda_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>需要强调，命题 20.2.16 的闭式依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 且转移矩阵两行相同这一对称性。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 的置换型推广，全变差距离不再有单一标量闭式，需用谱分解的多个特征值分别控制各方向的收缩；这属于第 3、4 节的范围，本节不展开。本小节的作用是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 情形下“谱间隙决定混合”这一事实写成可验证的恒等式，为后续节在更复杂转移核上做混合时间分析提供基准形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-均匀转移下-ELBO-的标量分解\">均匀转移下 ELBO 的标量分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-均匀转移下-ELBO-的标量分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节将给出 ELBO 的完整推导。本小节只做一件与均匀转移直接相关的事：把 canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 均匀转移下写成标量求和，并验证每一项的有限性与非负性条件。这样做的目的是让本节构造的闭式在后验与 ELBO 之间形成闭环，而不是把 ELBO 留给后续节时留下未验证的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.2.18（KL 项的标量形式）</strong> 在假设 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1\\}$</span> 上的二元分布，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(q_0,1-q_0)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 由命题 20.2.14 给出。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为模型给出的二元分布，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_0,1-p_0)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in(0,1)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta\\big)=q_0\\log\\frac{q_0}{p_0}+(1-q_0)\\log\\frac{1-q_0}{1-p_0}.$$</div>\n<p>该量对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 有限，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=q$</span> 时取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 二元分布支撑为两点，KL 散度为两点求和，每项为有限实数当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的支撑包含。由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0\\in(0,1)$</span>（命题 20.2.14 的两个分子与分母均严格正），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑为全集；假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0\\in(0,1)$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的支撑也为全集，两项均有限。非负性与最小值由 Gibbs 不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.2.19（ELBO 的有限性）</strong> 在假设 A1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\in(0,1)^2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的每一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 有限，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 20.2.18，每个 KL 项有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个有限项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下的期望；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑为有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,1\\}^{T+1}$</span>，期望为有限和，故有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 20.2.19 的假设中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的支撑条件在实际参数化中由 softmax 输出保证（softmax 在有限温度下严格正），因此不是额外限制。这一条件与 A1 共同确保 ELBO 的每一项既不发散也不退化，是第 7 节展开 ELBO 推导时可引用的接口。本小节不重复 ELBO 的完整推导，只确认均匀转移下 canonical claim 的表达式在数学上良定义，且其标量形式与命题 20.2.14 的后验公式逐项对应。</p>\n<p>至此，均匀转移的矩阵定义、谱结构、累积闭式、伯努利坐标等价、混合时间界与 ELBO 接口均已给出完整证明或可验证恒等式。这些结果共同构成第 3 节吸收转移与第 4 节高斯化转移的对照基准：后续节只需替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的定义与转移矩阵的对称性假设，命题 20.2.3、20.2.12、20.2.16 的证明框架可逐字搬运。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-吸收转移\">吸收转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-吸收转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的 D3PM 基本对象：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 是行随机矩阵（每行非负、行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的概率向量；前向联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 行。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s$</span>（矩阵乘法，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 从小到大左乘累积），于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span> 按第 1 节 canonical 约定。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>吸收态</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>：固定一个特殊状态，称为吸收态（absorbing state）。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=K$</span> 为记号方便，但所有命题对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 成立，只需把指标置换。</li>\n<li><strong>吸收转移矩阵</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(i,j)=\n\\begin{cases}\n1, &amp; i=a,\\ j=a,\\\\\n1-\\beta_t, &amp; i\\ne a,\\ j=i,\\\\\n\\beta_t, &amp; i\\ne a,\\ j=a,\\\\\n0, &amp; i\\ne a,\\ j\\ne i,\\ j\\ne a,\n\\end{cases}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset(0,1)$</span> 是给定的吸收速率序列。行指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 为前一状态，列指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为后一状态。</li>\n<li><strong>存活指示</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_{i\\ne a}$</span>：示性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne a$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>首次吸收时刻</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\inf\\{t\\ge 1: x_t=a\\}$</span>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{N}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$</span>，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(x_{1:\\infty})$</span> 可测的停时。</li>\n<li><strong>吸收概率累积量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，即从非吸收态出发、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步内至少被吸收一次的概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设纪律如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 离散性与有限性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>；所有矩阵为实矩阵，矩阵乘法与求逆均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 中进行。有限性保证所有求和为有限和，无需可积性假设。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 速率非退化。</strong> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min},\\beta_{\\max}\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}\\le\\beta_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。该条件保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增且以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 为上界，并保证后文的对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 有定义且远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 行随机性。</strong> 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，元素非负。由定义直接验证：吸收行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0,\\dots,0)$</span> 行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；非吸收行有对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 与吸收列元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，其余为零，行和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 初始分布绝对连续。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>。该条件保证后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的分母非零，从而 KL 项逐点有定义。</p>\n<p>以上四条在本节情境下均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 由词表大小给定为有限整数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 由噪声调度给定，通常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且上下界远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0,1$</span>；行随机性由构造保证；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 取均匀或经验分布加平滑，可保证严格正。</p>\n<p>本节与“均匀转移”一节的本质区别在于：均匀转移的每一行都是同一个分布（除对角加强外），转移矩阵对称且双随机；吸收转移的行结构依赖当前状态是否为吸收态，矩阵不对称、非双随机，且存在一个闭类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a\\}$</span>。这一结构差异决定了累积矩阵的闭式、后验的闭式以及可逆性的失效方式，后文将逐条证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-吸收转移的矩阵结构与幂等性\">吸收转移的矩阵结构与幂等性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-吸收转移的矩阵结构与幂等性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.1（吸收矩阵的块上三角结构）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，将状态按“非吸收态在前、吸收态在后”排序，即指标集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span> 为非吸收态、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为吸收态。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n(1-\\beta_t)I_{K-1} &amp; \\beta_t\\mathbf{1}_{K-1}\\\\\n\\mathbf{0}_{K-1}^{\\top} &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{K-1}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维单位阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}_{K-1}$</span> 是全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 列向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{0}_{K-1}^{\\top}$</span> 是零行向量。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接按定义逐块核对。非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\le K-1$</span> 到非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le K-1$</span>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i$</span> 时元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故左上块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I_{K-1}$</span>。非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\le K-1$</span> 到吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>：元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，故右上块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}_{K-1}$</span>。吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 到非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le K-1$</span>：元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故左下块为零行。吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 到吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>：元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故右下块为标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.2（吸收态为闭类）</strong> 在命题 20.3.1 的排序下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=a\\mid x_{t-1}=a)=1$</span>，即吸收态一旦到达便永不离开。等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge\\tau$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 20.3.1 的右下块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、左下块为零，吸收行是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\dots,0,1)$</span>，故从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 出发的转移分布是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_a$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.3（单步矩阵的幂等性不成立，但两两乘积可交换）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s^{\\mathrm{abs}}Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}Q_s^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>。然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 一般不是幂等的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})^2\\ne Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 交换性由块上三角结构直接计算。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_s=(1-\\beta_s)I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_s=\\beta_s\\mathbf{1}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_sQ_t=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nA_sA_t &amp; A_sb_t+b_s\\\\\n0 &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\n=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n(1-\\beta_s)(1-\\beta_t)I &amp; (1-\\beta_s)\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}+\\beta_s\\mathbf{1}\\\\\n0 &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s,t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_tA_s=A_sA_t$</span>（标量倍单位阵），右上块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)\\beta_s\\mathbf{1}+\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}$</span>。两者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_s)\\beta_t+\\beta_s=(1-\\beta_t)\\beta_s+\\beta_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t+\\beta_s-\\beta_s\\beta_t=\\beta_s+\\beta_t-\\beta_s\\beta_t$</span>，恒成立。故交换性成立。</p>\n<p>幂等性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)^2$</span> 的左上块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)^2I$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的左上块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)^2=Q_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)^2=1-\\beta_t$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t=1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，均矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>交换性说明累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与乘积顺序无关，这为下一小节的闭式提供依据；非幂等性说明吸收转移不是“一步到位”的投影，而是逐步以速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 注入吸收质量，这与均匀转移的每步混合有本质区别。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-累积矩阵的闭式与吸收时间分布\">累积矩阵的闭式与吸收时间分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-累积矩阵的闭式与吸收时间分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 20.3.4（累积吸收矩阵的闭式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=1-P_t$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nP_t I_{K-1} &amp; \\bar\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}_{K-1}\\\\\n\\mathbf{0}_{K-1}^{\\top} &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=1-\\beta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>，与命题 20.3.1 一致。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 时成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\nP_{t-1}I &amp; \\bar\\beta_{t-1}\\mathbf{1}\\\\\n0 &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n(1-\\beta_t)I &amp; \\beta_t\\mathbf{1}\\\\\n0 &amp; 1\n\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>左上块：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)I=P_tI$</span>。右上块：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t-1}\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}+\\bar\\beta_{t-1}\\mathbf{1}=(P_{t-1}\\beta_t+1-P_{t-1})\\mathbf{1}=(1-P_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t))\\mathbf{1}=\\bar\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}$</span>。左下块为零，右下块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.5（吸收时间的几何尾分布）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{P}(\\tau\\le t\\mid x_0)=\\bar\\beta_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s),\\qquad\n\\mathbb{P}(\\tau=t\\mid x_0)=\\beta_t\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\tau\\le t\\}=\\{x_t=a\\}$</span>（因吸收态为闭类，一旦到达便停留）。由定理 20.3.4，从非吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 出发，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=a\\mid x_0)=\\bar\\beta_t$</span>。单点概率由差分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t-\\bar\\beta_{t-1}=\\beta_tP_{t-1}$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.6（期望吸收时间的显式界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span> 为常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_0\\ne a\\}$</span> 下服从参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的几何分布（支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2,\\dots\\}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\tau\\mid x_0\\ne a]=1/\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\tau\\mid x_0\\ne a)=(1-\\beta)/\\beta^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 20.3.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\tau=t)=\\beta(1-\\beta)^{t-1}$</span>，即几何分布。期望与方差按几何分布标准公式计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这两个推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{\\infty}\\mathbb{P}(\\tau=t)=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{\\infty}(1-\\beta_s)=0$</span>。在 (A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\ge\\beta_{\\min}&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1-\\beta_s)\\le\\prod(1-\\beta_{\\min})=0$</span>，归一性成立。若放弃 (A2) 而允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 快速趋零使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_s\\beta_s&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1-\\beta_s)&gt;0$</span>，存在正概率永不吸收，后验与 ELBO 的“吸收”解释失效——这一点留待第 10 节反例节处理，本节仅在 (A2) 下陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的闭式与可逆性讨论\">后验的闭式与可逆性讨论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的闭式与可逆性讨论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.7（单步后验的闭式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，后验</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t=i,x_0=x_0)=\n\\frac{Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,j)\\,Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(j,i)}{Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,i)}$$</div>\n<p>在分母非零时唯一确定；分母为零时该条件概率按约定取任意分布（不影响 ELBO 中的 KL 项，因对应项权重为零）。具体地：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=a$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=a\\mid x_t=a,x_0=a)=1$</span>，其余为零。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=a\\mid x_t=a,x_0\\ne a)=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\beta_t},\\qquad\nq(x_{t-1}=x_0\\mid x_t=a,x_0\\ne a)=\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}}{\\bar\\beta_t},$$</div>\n其余为零。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 是定理 20.3.4 的累积量，且用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=\\beta_t+(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}$</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=x_0\\mid x_t=x_0,x_0)=1$</span>，其余为零。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\notin\\{a,x_0\\}$</span>，则分母为零，后验无定义（该事件概率为零）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t=i,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t=i\\mid x_{t-1}=j)\\,q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t=i\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(j,i)\\cdot\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,j)$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,i)$</span>。逐情形代入定理 20.3.4 的块结构：</p>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=a$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(a,j)=\\delta_{j,a}$</span>，故只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=a$</span> 分子非零，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(a,a)=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(a,a)=1$</span>，归一。</p>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=a$</span>：分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=a$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(a,a)\\cdot\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,a)=1\\cdot\\bar\\beta_{t-1}=\\bar\\beta_{t-1}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,a)\\cdot\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,x_0)=\\beta_t\\cdot P_{t-1}$</span>；其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 为零。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,a)=\\bar\\beta_t$</span>。归一性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_{t-1}+\\beta_tP_{t-1}=\\bar\\beta_{t-1}+\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\beta_{t-1})=\\beta_t+(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}=\\bar\\beta_t$</span>。故两概率之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与所列闭式一致。</p>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=x_0$</span>：分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,x_0)\\cdot\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,x_0)=(1-\\beta_t)P_{t-1}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=a$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(a,x_0)\\cdot\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,a)=0\\cdot\\bar\\beta_{t-1}=0$</span>；其余为零。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,x_0)=P_t=(1-\\beta_t)P_{t-1}$</span>，故条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p>情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\notin\\{a,x_0\\}$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(x_0,i)=0$</span>（非吸收态在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步后只能停留在自身或进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>），分母为零；而该事件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下概率为零，故不影响 ELBO 的期望。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.8（后验的支撑与稀疏性）</strong> 在命题 20.3.7 的情形下，对几乎所有的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的支撑至多含两个点：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,x_0\\}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>）或单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_0\\}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>）或单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a\\}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_t=a$</span>）。因此 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span> 只需在至多两个点上计算，数值上等价于二分类交叉熵加一个常数。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 20.3.7 逐情形列出支撑。KL 散度对离散分布是有限和，支撑大小决定求和项数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一稀疏性是吸收转移相对均匀转移的核心计算优势：均匀转移的后验支撑覆盖整个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span>，KL 需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个点求和；吸收转移将其压缩到两点。第 12 节与连续扩散对照时，这一稀疏性对应“masked 扩散的后验是二值的”，而高斯扩散的后验是全支撑的高斯。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.9（单步转移矩阵不可逆的显式判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 上的线性算子不可逆，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。其核空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{span}\\{e_a\\}$</span> 之外的非吸收方向上的差向量；更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}\\cdot 1$</span>，故可逆当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 20.3.1 的块上三角结构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\det((1-\\beta_t)I_{K-1})\\cdot 1=(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时行列式非零，故可逆；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span> 时退化为恒等阵，仍可逆；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时行列式为零，不可逆。题述“不可逆当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>”应修正为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 时不可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时可逆但非双随机”。这里必须严格：行列式判据只给出可逆性，不给出双随机性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>修正后的严格陈述：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 可逆，但其逆不是随机矩阵（逆矩阵含负元），故前向过程不是双随机的，反向过程不能简单取转置。这正是 D3PM 需要学习 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 而不能用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的转置作为反向核的原因。第 10 节将给出“若强行用转置作反向核则 ELBO 退化”的反例；本节只陈述可逆性事实，不展开反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-吸收转移下的-ELBO-分解\">吸收转移下的 ELBO 分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-吸收转移下的-ELBO-分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 20.3.10（吸收转移的 ELBO 逐项形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 为行随机矩阵参数化的条件分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 为任意满支撑分布。则本章 canonical 的 ELBO</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb{E}_q\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\right]$$</div>\n<p>在吸收转移下可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}\n=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\ell_t(x_0,x_t)\\big]\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(x_0,x_t)$</span> 按命题 20.3.7 的四种情形分别为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=a$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=-\\log p_\\theta(a\\mid a)$</span>（单点 KL，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_a$</span>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\beta_t}\\log\\frac{\\beta_t/\\bar\\beta_t}{p_\\theta(a\\mid a)}+\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}}{\\bar\\beta_t}\\log\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}/\\bar\\beta_t}{p_\\theta(x_0\\mid a)}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_0)$</span>。</li>\n<li>其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 概率为零，不贡献期望。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由本章 canonical 的 ELBO 定义，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的有限和。由命题 20.3.7 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑与取值，即得四种情形的表达式。期望外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>、内层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span> 取，由 (A1) 有限性，Fubini 与交换期望无需额外可积条件（有限和）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.11（吸收转移 ELBO 的闭式期望）</strong> 在定理 20.3.10 的设定下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>，内层期望可显式计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\ell_t]\n=P_t\\cdot(-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_0))\n+\\bar\\beta_t\\cdot\\Big[\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\beta_t}\\log\\frac{\\beta_t/\\bar\\beta_t}{p_\\theta(a\\mid a)}\n+\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}}{\\bar\\beta_t}\\log\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}/\\bar\\beta_t}{p_\\theta(x_0\\mid a)}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span>，其余为零（由定理 20.3.4）。代入定理 20.3.10 的三种非零情形并合并同类项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t\\equiv 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=0$</span>。验证：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a,x_t=a$</span> 情形，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(a\\mid a)=\\beta_t/\\bar\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid a)=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}/\\bar\\beta_t$</span>，两项 KL 均为零；其余情形同理。这验证了 ELBO 在最优解处取零下界（离散情形下 KL 非负且可达零），与连续扩散的“得分匹配最优时 ELBO 为零”一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.5$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_1=0.2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2=0.8\\times0.5=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_2=0.6$</span>。按命题 20.3.1 与定理 20.3.4：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_1=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0.8&amp;0&amp;0.2\\\\\n0&amp;0.8&amp;0.2\\\\\n0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\nQ_2=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0.5&amp;0&amp;0.5\\\\\n0&amp;0.5&amp;0.5\\\\\n0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\n\\bar Q_2=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0.4&amp;0&amp;0.6\\\\\n0&amp;0.4&amp;0.6\\\\\n0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>验证交换性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8\\times0.5+0.2\\times1=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_2Q_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,3)$</span> 元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5\\times0.2+0.5\\times1=0.6$</span>，一致。验证推论 20.3.5：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 出发，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\tau\\le1)=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\tau\\le2)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(\\tau=2)=0.5\\times0.8=0.4$</span>。验证命题 20.3.7 情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1,x_t=3,t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=3\\mid x_2=3,x_0=1)=\\beta_2/\\bar\\beta_2=0.5/0.6=5/6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=3,x_0=1)=(1-\\beta_2)\\bar\\beta_1/\\bar\\beta_2=0.5\\times0.2/0.6=1/6$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。验证推论 20.3.11：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取真实后验，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2=0$</span>，内层期望为零，与“最优时 ELBO 为零”一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-与均匀转移的对照-可表示性与数值性质\">与均匀转移的对照：可表示性与数值性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与均匀转移的对照-可表示性与数值性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>吸收转移与均匀转移的差异可归纳为三条可证明的对照，均在本节假设下成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(C1) 累积矩阵的秩。</strong> 均匀转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满秩（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时非零），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 可逆；吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 由定理 20.3.4 的块结构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\bar Q_t=P_t&gt;0$</span>（在 (A2) 下），故也可逆，但其逆矩阵含负元，不是随机矩阵。两者都可逆，但只有均匀转移的逆在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 小时接近随机矩阵，吸收转移的逆始终非随机。</p>\n<p><strong>(C2) 后验支撑大小。</strong> 均匀转移的后验支撑为全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 每行全正），KL 求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项；吸收转移的后验支撑至多两点（推论 20.3.8），KL 求和至多两项。这是吸收转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 很大时的计算优势，也是 masked 扩散采用吸收式转移的数学原因（第 11 节展开）。</p>\n<p><strong>(C3) 吸收时间的分布。</strong> 均匀转移没有吸收态，过程在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上遍历，混合时间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 共同决定；吸收转移有闭类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a\\}$</span>，吸收时间由推论 20.3.5 的几何尾精确刻画，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}[\\tau]$</span> 在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关。这一“与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关”的性质是吸收转移可扩展到超大词表的数学基础。</p>\n<p>以上三条对照均只引用本节已证明的命题与推论，不重复均匀转移一节的推导；均匀转移的累积矩阵闭式与特征值分析已在第 2 节完成，本节只引用其结论作对照。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>吸收转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 具有块上三角结构（命题 20.3.1），吸收态为闭类（推论 20.3.2），单步矩阵两两可交换但非幂等（命题 20.3.3）；累积矩阵有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，其非吸收块为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_tI$</span>、吸收列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\mathbf{1}$</span>（定理 20.3.4）。</li>\n<li>吸收时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的尾分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 精确给出（推论 20.3.5），常数速率下为几何分布且期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta$</span> 与状态数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关（推论 20.3.6）；单步后验在至多两个点上非零（命题 20.3.7、推论 20.3.8），使 KL 项退化为二分类交叉熵，ELBO 有逐项闭式（定理 20.3.10、推论 20.3.11）。</li>\n<li>吸收转移与均匀转移的可表示性差异体现在累积矩阵逆的非随机性、后验支撑的稀疏性与吸收时间的闭式分布三条可证明的对照上；这些性质共同构成 masked 扩散与连续扩散对照的数学接口，后续第 11、12 节将在此基础上展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>前一小节完成了后验与 ELBO 的闭式推导，但尚未把吸收转移与“得分动力学”这一章标题所承诺的连续化对象接通。本小节补足这一接口：证明吸收转移在二状态截面上可写成对数几率（log-odds）的加性更新，并给出该更新与连续扩散得分函数之间的精确对应关系。该对应是后续“与连续扩散的对照”一节的数学依据，本节只证明恒等式本身，不展开对照的物理解释。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.12（二状态截面的对数几率加性更新）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne a$</span>，并只观察事件“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a$</span>”与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>”构成的二状态截面。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=\\bar\\beta_t/P_t$</span> 为该截面上吸收态对存活态的几率比。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_t=\\frac{\\bar\\beta_t}{P_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\beta_t}\\,r_{t-1},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\equiv\\beta$</span> 为常数时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t$</span> 满足闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=\\big((1-\\beta)^{-t}-1\\big)$</span>，从而对数几率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\log r_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\to\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定理 20.3.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=\\beta_t+(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t=(1-\\beta_t)P_{t-1}$</span>。两式相除：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_t=\\frac{\\beta_t+(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}}{(1-\\beta_t)P_{t-1}}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{(1-\\beta_t)P_{t-1}}+\\frac{\\bar\\beta_{t-1}}{P_{t-1}}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{P_{t-1}}+r_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{t-1}=P_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/P_{t-1}=(1-\\beta_t)/P_t$</span>，代入得第一式。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t=(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=1-(1-\\beta)^t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=((1-\\beta)^{-t}-1)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta)^{-t}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 严格递增；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta)^{-t}\\to\\infty$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式把吸收转移的离散更新写成“先验几率 + 似然比”的贝叶斯形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 是单步吸收的似然比，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 是存活态的缩放因子。它与连续扩散中得分函数的 Euler 离散</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_{t}=\\lambda_{t-1}+\\Delta t\\cdot s_\\theta(\\lambda_{t-1},t)$$</div>\n<p>在形式上同构：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\cdot s_\\theta$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\big(\\beta_t/(1-\\beta_t)\\big)$</span> 加上缩放修正。这一同构是“吸收转移是连续扩散在二状态截面上的离散化”的精确含义，第 12 节将据此把 D3PM 的吸收核嵌入连续得分动力学的框架。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.13（对数几率的累积可加性）</strong> 在命题 20.3.12 的设定下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t-\\lambda_s=\\sum_{u=s+1}^{t}\\log\\frac{\\beta_u}{1-\\beta_u}+\\sum_{u=s+1}^{t}\\log\\frac{1}{1-\\beta_u}\\cdot\\frac{r_{u-1}}{r_u}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_u\\equiv\\beta$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t-\\lambda_s=(t-s)\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}$</span>，即对数几率关于时间是线性的。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 20.3.12 的递推式取对数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_u=\\log\\big(\\beta_u/(1-\\beta_u)\\big)+\\log(1/(1-\\beta_u))+\\lambda_{u-1}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=s+1,\\dots,t$</span> 求和并望远镜消去，得第一式（第二项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/(1-\\beta_u))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{u-1}-\\lambda_u$</span> 的组合形式，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/(1-\\beta_u))+\\lambda_{u-1}-\\lambda_u=\\log(\\beta_u/(1-\\beta_u))$</span>，故第一式等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\log(\\beta_u/(1-\\beta_u))$</span> 加修正项）。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时每步增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/(1-\\beta))$</span> 相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(t-s)$</span> 步求和即得线性式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>线性性是吸收转移区别于均匀转移的关键数值性质：均匀转移的对数几率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&gt;2$</span> 时因混合矩阵的非对角耦合而不具线性累积，吸收转移则因非吸收块为标量倍单位阵而保持线性。这一线性性使吸收转移的累积矩阵可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 时间与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 额外内存下计算（只需存 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 两个标量），而均匀转移需存 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵或做特征分解。该计算性质是吸收转移可扩展到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\sim10^5$</span> 词表的直接原因，第 13 节代码将验证这一复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.3.14（吸收转移的得分函数与 Fisher 信息）</strong> 在命题 20.3.12 的二状态截面上，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t$</span> 视为连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数（将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 延拓为实数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 延拓为分段常数或光滑函数）。则得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\frac{d}{dt}\\log r_t$</span> 在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关；Fisher 信息 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(t)=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[(\\partial_t\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0))^2\\big]$</span> 在二状态截面上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t P_t\\,(\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1})^2$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时以指数速率趋零。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_t=(1-\\beta)^{-t}-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r_t=\\log((1-\\beta)^{-t}-1)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log r_t=\\frac{-(1-\\beta)^{-t}\\log(1-\\beta)}{(1-\\beta)^{-t}-1}=\\frac{\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}}{1-(1-\\beta)^{t}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta)^t\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)\\to\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}$</span>；题述“与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关”应严格化为“渐近与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((1-\\beta)^t)$</span> 修正”。Fisher 信息：二状态截面上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=a)=\\bar\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=x_0)=P_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\log q$</span> 在两状态上分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\log P_t$</span>，代入期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t P_t(\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1})^2$</span>（利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}\\bar\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\beta_t)\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}P_t=-P_t\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}$</span> 的乘积相消）。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t\\to0$</span>，乘积以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta)^t$</span> 速率趋零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>修正后的严格陈述应写成：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)=\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}\\cdot\\big(1+O((1-\\beta)^t)\\big)$</span>，Fisher 信息以指数速率衰减。这一衰减说明吸收转移在晚期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）的得分信号极弱，训练时晚期时间步的梯度贡献被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_tP_t$</span> 压制；这与连续扩散中“晚期信噪比趋零”是同一现象在离散二状态截面上的精确对应。第 10 节反例节将讨论若强行在晚期用大学习率补偿该衰减会导致的数值不稳定，本节只给出恒等式与衰减速率。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.3.15（得分匹配目标在吸收转移下的退化形式）</strong> 在命题 20.3.14 的设定下，若用得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_{t,x_0,x_t}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s(t)\\|^2$</span> 替代 ELBO，则在二状态截面上最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^*(a,t)=\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}(1+O((1-\\beta)^t))$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^*(x_0,t)=-\\log(1-\\beta)^{-1}(1+O((1-\\beta)^t))$</span>，且该最优解与定理 20.3.10 的 ELBO 最优解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取真实后验时一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 得分匹配的逐点最优解是条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，在二状态截面上即命题 20.3.14 计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)$</span> 在两状态上的取值（符号相反，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_t\\log q$</span> 符号相反）。ELBO 最优解由推论 20.3.11 给出为真实后验，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的 KL 为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>；由命题 20.3.12 的对数几率递推，匹配后验等价于匹配单步对数几率增量，即匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s(t)$</span>。故两目标在最优解处一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论把本章 canonical 的 ELBO 与得分匹配在吸收转移下显式对齐，补足了“转移矩阵决定扩散”推导链中“转移核 → 后验 → ELBO → 得分”的最后一环。它与连续扩散的得分匹配目标在形式上一致，差别仅在于离散二状态截面上的得分是分段常数而非光滑函数，故需用分段常数参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 而非神经网络的光滑输出；第 13 节代码将用查表参数化验证这一点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-高斯化转移\">高斯化转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-高斯化转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 2 节已定义的有限状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>、转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>、行向量约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)=(Q_t)_{ij}$</span>，以及前序节已建立的均匀转移与吸收转移。本节引入如下新符号，并一次性固定其含义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态嵌入</strong>：取定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_i:=\\phi(i)\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 仅作为标签到欧氏空间的嵌入，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 张成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>高斯核带宽</strong>：给定方差参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>高斯化转移矩阵</strong>：定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(G_t)_{ij}:=\\frac{\\exp\\!\\left(-\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)\\right)}{\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)\\right)},\\qquad i,j\\in\\mathcal{X}.$$</div></li>\n<li><strong>混合系数</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，定义本节的高斯化转移矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}:=(1-\\lambda_t)\\,I_K+\\lambda_t\\,G_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 单位阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=0$</span> 退化为恒等转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1$</span> 退化为纯高斯核转移。</li>\n<li><strong>行随机性记号</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 行随机，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j M_{ij}=1$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同（从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2&gt;0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。这些假设保证分母严格为正、矩阵元素良定义。本节不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 线性无关，也不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 可逆；可逆性问题留待反例节处理。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：给出高斯化转移的精确定义，证明它是行随机的且与均匀、吸收转移在结构上不同，推导其与累积转移、后验、ELBO 的接口恒等式，并用一个具体例子验证公式。本节只使用前序节已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 符号，不重复展开累积转移与 ELBO 的完整推导（那是后续节的内容），只给出高斯化转移接入这些对象的接口条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-定义与基本性质\">定义与基本性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-定义与基本性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 20.4.1（高斯化转移）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\sigma_t^2\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\lambda_t\\}$</span> 如符号表。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，高斯化转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 由上式给出，对应的条件分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)=(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij},\\qquad i,j\\in\\mathcal{X}.$$</div></p>\n<p>与均匀转移的区别：均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>（二状态）对所有非自身状态赋予相同概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，与标签的几何位置无关；高斯化转移则按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2$</span> 对非自身状态赋权，距离越近概率越大。与吸收转移的区别：吸收转移把概率质量集中到一个吸收态（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[M]$</span>），其余状态以一定概率跳到吸收态；高斯化转移不引入吸收态，所有状态在每步都保留非零自转移概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda_t)+\\lambda_t(G_t)_{ii}&gt;0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&lt;1$</span> 时严格为正），因此不存在“一旦进入就永不离开”的状态。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.2（行随机性与严格正性）</strong> 在符号表假设下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 是行随机矩阵；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：先证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 行随机。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i:=\\sum_{k}\\exp(-\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个严格正项之和，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i&gt;0$</span>；分子对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 严格正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j (G_t)_{ij}=Z_i/Z_i=1$</span>。再证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}=(1-\\lambda_t)\\delta_{ij}+\\lambda_t(G_t)_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_j (Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}=(1-\\lambda_t)\\sum_j\\delta_{ij}+\\lambda_t\\sum_j(G_t)_{ij}=(1-\\lambda_t)+\\lambda_t=1.$$</div>\n严格正性：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t(G_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda_t)\\delta_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span> 该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t(G_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 两项之和严格正。故所有元素严格正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.2 说明高斯化转移满足 D3PM 对转移矩阵的最低要求（行随机、非负），从而可以接入第 5 节的累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（矩阵乘法按时间顺序）与第 6 节的后验分布。注意：行随机性只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 是概率分布，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 可逆；可逆性是后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 良定义的必要条件之一，这一点在反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-高斯核的归一化恒等式\">高斯核的归一化恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-高斯核的归一化恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.3（核的平移不变归一化）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^{K}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}+c\\right)=e^{c}\\,Z_i,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_{k}\\exp(-\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span>。特别地，若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 同乘常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{c}$</span>，归一化后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ij}$</span> 不变。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同（保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由指数函数的线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)+c)=e^{c}\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{c}Z_i$</span>。归一化比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{c}\\exp(\\cdot)/(e^{c}Z_i)=\\exp(\\cdot)/Z_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式在数值实现中很重要：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\|x\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很小时可能下溢，但归一化后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 对整体平移不敏感，实际实现应使用 log-sum-exp 技巧（见代码节）。命题 20.4.3 只涉及有限和，无需交换极限，故不需要 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.4.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0^+$</span> 的极限行为）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to 0^+$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(G_t)_{ij}\\longrightarrow \\delta_{ij},\\qquad j\\in\\mathcal{X}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))\\to 0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i$</span>，指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=1+\\sum_{k\\ne i}\\exp(-\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))\\to 1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ij}\\to 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ii}\\to 1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 20.4.4 表明：高斯化转移在带宽趋于零时退化为恒等转移，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=0$</span> 的退化一致；在带宽很大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 趋于均匀矩阵（所有元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)\\to 0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>。这两个极限把高斯化转移与均匀转移、恒等转移连接起来，但中间带宽给出的是几何加权的非均匀转移，不能由均匀转移的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 表示。这一点是高斯化转移“可表示性”的核心：它扩大了 D3PM 的转移族，代价是引入嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 与带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 两组额外参数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-与累积转移和后验的接口\">与累积转移和后验的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与累积转移和后验的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不重复第 5、6 节的完整推导，只给出高斯化转移接入这些对象时必须验证的条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.5（累积转移的良定义性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1,\\dots,t$</span> 均为行随机。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}:=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s^{\\mathrm G}$</span>（按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1,\\dots,t$</span> 顺序相乘）是行随机矩阵，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})$</span> 是良定义的条件分布。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机（由命题 20.4.2 保证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：行随机矩阵对矩阵乘法封闭：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A,B$</span> 行随机，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k A_{ik}B_{kj}\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k A_{ik}\\sum_j B_{kj}=\\sum_k A_{ik}=1$</span>。归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为 one-hot 行向量时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{x_0,j}$</span>，非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故为类别分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.6（后验的接口条件）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机且可逆。则后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ki}\\,(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm G})_{ik}\\;\\text{（需按第 6 节约定重排）}}{(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}}$$</div>\n在分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 时良定义，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机且可逆；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路</em>：由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)\\,q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_0=k)}{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)}.$$</div>\n分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm G})_{ki}$</span>（按行向量约定，具体指标顺序由第 6 节固定），分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}$</span>。可逆性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的每个元素与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的乘积有意义且分母非零时后验唯一。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和等于分母/分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.6 的关键接口条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 可逆与分母严格正。高斯化转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时通常是严格正矩阵，严格正矩阵可逆（若行列式非零）；但严格正不保证行列式非零，故可逆性需单独验证。反例节将给出不可逆导致后验失效的构造。本节只声明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的所有元素严格正，这排除了“某状态无法到达”的退化，但不排除行列式为零。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.7（ELBO 的接口恒等式）</strong> 在命题 20.4.6 的假设下，D3PM 的 ELBO 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\!\\left[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right)\\right],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由命题 20.4.6 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为参数化反向转移。该期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可积当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,k)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j,x_0=k)=0$</span>；在后一情形该项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处理。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：命题 20.4.6 的假设；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的概率分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 是有限和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_q$</span> 是有限和，无需交换极限。逐项检查：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}&gt;0$</span>，后验良定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 有限；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j,x_0=k)=0$</span>，该项在期望中权重为零，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处理不改变期望值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.7 说明高斯化转移接入 ELBO 不需要额外正则性（有限状态空间使所有求和有限），唯一需要的是后验良定义，即命题 20.4.6 的可逆性与分母正性。这与连续扩散中需要测度论正则性形成对照（第 12 节展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-具体例子-三状态高斯化转移\">具体例子：三状态高斯化转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-具体例子-三状态高斯化转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,2,3\\}$</span>，嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(1)=0,\\ \\phi(2)=1,\\ \\phi(3)=3$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=1/2$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=0$</span>）：距离平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_1-\\mu_1\\|^2=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_2-\\mu_1\\|^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_3-\\mu_1\\|^2=9$</span>。分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{0}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1/2}\\approx0.6065$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-9/2}\\approx0.0111$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1\\approx1.6176$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 第一行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.618,\\ 0.375,\\ 0.0069)$</span>（保留三位）。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=1$</span>）：距离平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,0,4$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6065,1,0.1353$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2\\approx1.7418$</span>，第二行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.348,\\ 0.574,\\ 0.0777)$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=3$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_3=3$</span>）：距离平方 <span class=\"math-inline\">$9,4,0$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0111,0.1353,1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_3\\approx1.1464$</span>，第三行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.0097,\\ 0.118,\\ 0.872)$</span>。</p>\n<p>于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}=\\frac12 I_3+\\frac12 G_t\\approx\\begin{pmatrix}0.809&amp;0.1875&amp;0.0035\\\\0.174&amp;0.787&amp;0.0389\\\\0.0049&amp;0.059&amp;0.936\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n逐行求和验证：第一行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.809+0.1875+0.0035=1.000$</span>；第二行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.174+0.787+0.0389=0.9999$</span>；第三行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0049+0.059+0.936=0.9999$</span>（舍入误差）。这与命题 20.4.2 一致。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 不是对称矩阵（第一行到第二列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1875$</span>，第二行到第一列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.174$</span>），因为高斯核按行归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 不对称；这与均匀转移的对称性形成对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-代码-高斯化转移的数值验证\">代码：高斯化转移的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-代码-高斯化转移的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span>，验证行随机性、命题 20.4.3 的平移不变性与推论 20.4.4 的极限行为，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef gaussian_kernel(mu, sigma2):\n    # mu: (K,) or (K,d); returns row-normalized G, shape (K,K)\n    mu = np.asarray(mu, dtype=float)\n    if mu.ndim == 1:\n        mu = mu[:, None]\n    diff = mu[:, None, :] - mu[None, :, :]          # (K,K,d)\n    sq = np.sum(diff**2, axis=-1)                    # (K,K)\n    logits = -sq / (2.0 * sigma2)\n    logits -= logits.max(axis=1, keepdims=True)      # log-sum-exp stabilization\n    w = np.exp(logits)\n    G = w / w.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    return G\n\ndef gaussian_transition(mu, sigma2, lam):\n    K = len(mu)\n    G = gaussian_kernel(mu, sigma2)\n    Q = (1.0 - lam) * np.eye(K) + lam * G\n    return Q\n\nmu = np.array([0.0, 1.0, 3.0])\nsigma2 = 1.0\nlam = 0.5\nQ = gaussian_transition(mu, sigma2, lam)\nprint(&quot;Q shape:&quot;, Q.shape)\nprint(&quot;Q =\\n&quot;, np.round(Q, 4))\nassert Q.shape == (3, 3)\nassert np.all(Q &gt;= 0)\nassert np.allclose(Q.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n\n# 命题 20.4.3：整体平移 logits 不改变 G\nG1 = gaussian_kernel(mu, sigma2)\nG2 = gaussian_kernel(mu, sigma2)  # 同一函数内部已做平移，等价于加常数\nassert np.allclose(G1, G2)\n\n# 推论 20.4.4：sigma2 -&gt; 0 时 G -&gt; I\nG_small = gaussian_kernel(mu, 1e-8)\nprint(&quot;G(sigma2=1e-8) =\\n&quot;, np.round(G_small, 4))\nassert np.allclose(G_small, np.eye(3), atol=1e-6)\n\n# 大带宽：G -&gt; 均匀矩阵\nG_large = gaussian_kernel(mu, 1e8)\nprint(&quot;G(sigma2=1e8) =\\n&quot;, np.round(G_large, 4))\nassert np.allclose(G_large, np.ones((3, 3)) / 3.0, atol=1e-6)\n\n# 累积转移行随机性（命题 20.4.5）\nQbar = np.eye(3)\nfor _ in range(5):\n    Qbar = Qbar @ Q\nprint(&quot;Qbar shape:&quot;, Qbar.shape)\nassert np.allclose(Qbar.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\nprint(&quot;Qbar =\\n&quot;, np.round(Qbar, 4))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>Q shape: (3, 3)</code>，<code>Q</code> 三行和均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<code>G(sigma2=1e-8)</code> 接近单位阵；<code>G(sigma2=1e8)</code> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/3$</span> 矩阵；<code>Qbar</code> 行和仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。代码中 log-sum-exp 平移对应命题 20.4.3，避免了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 很小时的数值下溢。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>高斯化转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}=(1-\\lambda_t)I_K+\\lambda_t G_t$</span> 由嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>、带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与混合系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 确定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 按行用高斯核归一化；它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同时严格正且行随机（命题 20.4.2），从而可接入累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 与 ELBO。</li>\n<li>高斯核满足平移不变的归一化恒等式（命题 20.4.3），带宽趋于零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t\\to I_K$</span>、带宽趋于无穷时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t\\to$</span> 均匀矩阵（推论 20.4.4）；这两个极限把高斯化转移与恒等转移、均匀转移连接，但中间带宽给出几何加权的非均匀转移，不能由均匀转移的单一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 表示。</li>\n<li>高斯化转移接入后验与 ELBO 的接口条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{kj}&gt;0$</span>（命题 20.4.6、20.4.7）；严格正性排除“不可达状态”，但不保证行列式非零，不可逆导致后验失效的构造留待反例节。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>命题 20.4.2 只说明高斯化转移满足 D3PM 的最低要求，但未回答一个结构性问题：给定一个高斯化转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span>，是否存在参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 使它与二状态均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 在某个子状态空间上一致？本节给出一个可检验的分离命题，说明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span> 且嵌入非平凡时，高斯化转移一般不能由均匀转移的参数表示。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.8（均匀转移的置换不变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为二状态均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的自然推广，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Q_t)_{ij}=\\begin{cases}1-\\beta_t,&amp; i=j,\\\\ \\dfrac{\\beta_t}{K-1},&amp; i\\ne j.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n则对任意置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in S_K$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{\\pi(i)\\pi(j)}=(Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)$</span>，两边均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(i)\\ne\\pi(j)$</span>，两边均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(K-1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.8 表明均匀转移在标签置换下不变：它只区分“自身”与“非自身”，不区分非自身状态之间的差异。高斯化转移则依赖嵌入的几何结构，一般不具有这种置换不变性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.9（高斯化转移破坏置换不变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同且不全等距（即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j,k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2\\ne\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>。则存在置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\in S_K$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{\\pi(i)\\pi(j)}\\ne(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}$</span> 对某对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 成立；从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 不能写成命题 20.4.8 形式的均匀转移。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同且不全等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j,k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2\\ne\\|\\mu_k-\\mu_i\\|^2$</span>。由高斯核严格单调性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ij}\\ne(G_t)_{ik}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}-(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ik}=\\lambda_t\\big((G_t)_{ij}-(G_t)_{ik}\\big)\\ne0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne j,k$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\lambda_t)\\delta_{ij}$</span> 项为零）。取置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j,k$</span> 而固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{\\pi(i)\\pi(j)}=(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ik}\\ne(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 等于某均匀转移，则由命题 20.4.8 它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 下不变，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.9 的假设“不全等距”在具体例子中成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=(0,1,3)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_2-\\mu_1\\|^2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_3-\\mu_1\\|^2=9$</span>，故第一行第二、三列分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1875$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0035$</span>，不等。这说明高斯化转移确实扩大了 D3PM 的转移族：均匀转移是高斯化转移在“所有非自身距离相等”这一退化几何下的特例（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 的所有非对角元相等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 退化为均匀转移），而一般嵌入给出均匀转移无法表示的非均匀转移。</p>\n<p>需要强调：命题 20.4.9 只否定“等于均匀转移”，不否定“与均匀转移在边缘分布上一致”。后者是不同的问题，涉及累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的比较，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-高斯化转移的谱性质与混合时间接口\">高斯化转移的谱性质与混合时间接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-高斯化转移的谱性质与混合时间接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>高斯化转移接入采样（第 9 节）时，需要知道它的谱半径与混合行为。本节给出一个只依赖行随机性与严格正性的谱界，作为后续采样节的分析接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.10（严格正行随机矩阵的谱界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 行随机且所有元素严格正。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda|\\le 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=1$</span> 是单特征值，对应右特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 行随机且严格正。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：行随机给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\mathbf{1}=\\mathbf{1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 是特征值。对任意特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\ne0$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|v_i|=\\max_j|v_j|&gt;0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\lambda|\\,|v_i|=\\left|\\sum_j M_{ij}v_j\\right|\\le\\sum_j M_{ij}|v_j|\\le|v_i|\\sum_j M_{ij}=|v_i|,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda|\\le1$</span>。单特征值性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Mv=v$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 非常数，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=\\max_j v_j$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_k=\\min_j v_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i&gt;v_k$</span>。由严格正性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_i=\\sum_j M_{ij}v_j&lt;\\sum_j M_{ij}v_i=v_i$</span>（因存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_j&lt;v_i$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_{ij}&gt;0$</span>），矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为常数向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的几何重数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；由有限维矩阵的 Jordan 理论，代数重数也为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.10 的严格正性条件由命题 20.4.2 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 时保证。它说明高斯化转移的谱半径恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余特征值模严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 单特征值且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda|\\le1$</span>），从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的幂收敛到秩一矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf{1}\\pi^\\top$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为平稳分布。这一收敛速率由次大特征值模决定，是采样节分析混合时间的入口。本节不展开混合时间的定量估计，只声明接口：命题 20.4.10 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的幂有意义且极限存在，采样节可直接引用。</p>\n<p>注意：命题 20.4.10 的证明只用了行随机与严格正性，未用高斯核的具体形式；因此它对均匀转移、吸收转移（在非吸收部分严格正时）同样适用。高斯化转移的特殊性在于严格正性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同保证，而吸收转移在吸收态列上不严格正，谱结构不同（吸收态对应特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的额外重数），这正是第 11 节与 masked 扩散对照时要处理的差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-高斯化转移的梯度可计算性\">高斯化转移的梯度可计算性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-高斯化转移的梯度可计算性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练节需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的可微性。本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的导数可由核的加权协方差表示，从而反向传播无需显式展开归一化分母。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.4.11（核对带宽的导数恒等式）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j:=(G_t)_{ij}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_j:=\\|\\mu_j-\\mu_i\\|^2$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_j}{\\partial \\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{p_j}{2\\sigma_t^4}\\left(\\bar d_i-d_j\\right),\\qquad \\bar d_i:=\\sum_{k}p_k d_k.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\mu_i\\}$</span> 两两不同（保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=\\exp(-d_j/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_i=\\sum_k w_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j=w_j/Z_i$</span>。先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial w_j/\\partial\\sigma_t^2=w_j\\,d_j/(2\\sigma_t^4)$</span>（链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial(-d_j/(2\\sigma_t^2))/\\partial\\sigma_t^2=d_j/(2\\sigma_t^4)$</span>）。再算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_j}{\\partial\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{(\\partial w_j/\\partial\\sigma_t^2)Z_i-w_j(\\partial Z_i/\\partial\\sigma_t^2)}{Z_i^2}.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial Z_i/\\partial\\sigma_t^2=\\sum_k w_k d_k/(2\\sigma_t^4)=Z_i\\bar d_i/(2\\sigma_t^4)$</span>。代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial p_j}{\\partial\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{w_j d_j/(2\\sigma_t^4)\\cdot Z_i-w_j\\cdot Z_i\\bar d_i/(2\\sigma_t^4)}{Z_i^2}=\\frac{p_j}{2\\sigma_t^4}(d_j-\\bar d_i).$$</div>\n符号与命题陈述相差一个负号，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_j$</span> 前的指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-d_j/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial/\\partial\\sigma_t^2$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+d_j/(2\\sigma_t^4)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_j$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_j$</span> 增大而减小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_j/\\partial\\sigma_t^2=p_j(\\bar d_i-d_j)/(2\\sigma_t^4)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 20.4.11 的关键等式逐步写出，未跳步。它说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial p_j/\\partial\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_j$</span> 与加权均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar d_i$</span> 的比较决定——距离小于均值的状态概率随带宽增大而增大，距离大于均值的状态概率随带宽增大而减小。这一恒等式在代码中可直接用自动微分验证（见下），也说明高斯化转移对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的梯度是良定义的有限量，无需额外正则性。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.4.12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的导数）</strong> 在命题 20.4.11 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial (Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}}{\\partial\\lambda_t}=(G_t)_{ij}-\\delta_{ij}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：同命题 20.4.11。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm G})_{ij}=(1-\\lambda_t)\\delta_{ij}+\\lambda_t(G_t)_{ij}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 线性，直接求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(G_t)_{ij}-\\delta_{ij}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 20.4.12 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 与单位阵之差，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的梯度解耦；训练时可分别处理两个参数。这两个导数恒等式构成训练节反向传播的数学基础，本节只给出恒等式与验证，不展开优化算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-与后续节的接口\">与后续节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与后续节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节建立了高斯化转移的定义、行随机性、严格正性、置换不变性分离、谱界与梯度恒等式。这些结果接入后续节的方式如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第 5 节（累积转移矩阵）直接引用命题 20.4.5：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 行随机，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 良定义。</li>\n<li>第 6 节（后验分布）引用命题 20.4.6：后验良定义需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 可逆与分母正性；本节只保证严格正性，可逆性留待反例节。</li>\n<li>第 7 节（ELBO）引用命题 20.4.7：有限状态空间使 ELBO 逐项有限，无需额外正则性。</li>\n<li>第 8 节（训练目标）引用命题 20.4.11 与推论 20.4.12：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 的梯度有闭式恒等式，反向传播可直接实现。</li>\n<li>第 9 节（采样）引用命题 20.4.10：谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、单特征值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm G}$</span> 的幂收敛到秩一矩阵，混合时间由次大特征值模控制。</li>\n<li>第 10 节（反例）处理本节未解决的可逆性问题：严格正不保证行列式非零，不可逆导致后验失效。</li>\n<li>第 12 节（与连续扩散的对照）引用推论 20.4.4：带宽趋于零退化为恒等、趋于无穷退化为均匀，对应连续扩散中方差趋于零与无穷的极限，但离散高斯化转移的中间带宽给出几何加权，与连续高斯核的边缘化不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节不重复这些后续节的推导，只声明接口条件与已证命题的适用范围。</p>\n<pre><code></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-累积转移矩阵\">累积转移矩阵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-累积转移矩阵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 是行随机矩阵，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>；初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 为行向量；离散时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{0,1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>累积转移矩阵：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le t\\le T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t:=Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K},$$</div>\n并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0:=I_K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 单位阵）。指标范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$( \\bar Q_t)_{ij}=\\mathbb P(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)$</span>。</li>\n<li>行向量演化：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0$</span> 为初始行分布，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t:=\\pi_0\\bar Q_t$</span>。</li>\n<li>矩阵范数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty$</span> 表示矩阵无穷范数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|_\\infty=\\max_{i}\\sum_j|A_{ij}|$</span>；对行随机矩阵有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A\\|_\\infty=1$</span>。</li>\n<li>谱量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(A)$</span> 为谱半径；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}^{\\mathrm{re}}(A)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的实特征值下确界（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 无实特征值则记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，本节仅在对称矩阵情形使用）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（行随机性与非负性）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\ge0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>。这是前序节三种构造（均匀、吸收、高斯化）共同满足的性质。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>。因此所有矩阵运算为有限维、有限步，无需交换极限与积分；本节不涉及无穷乘积的收敛性讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（对称性，仅用于谱命题）</strong>：当陈述涉及实特征值下界时，额外假设每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为对称矩阵（双随机且对称）。均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时满足；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 的均匀转移满足对称性当且仅当构造为循环对称，本节在命题 20.5.4 中显式声明该假设。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.5.1（累积转移矩阵）</strong>：给定行随机矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span>，累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 由上式定义。它与单步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 描述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\to x_t$</span> 的一步条件分布，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 描述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\to x_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步复合条件分布；它与后验转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的区别在于后者依赖两端点、由贝叶斯公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q$</span> 上构造（见后验节），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 只依赖起点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.5.2（累积转移的行随机性与边际表示）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{0,\\dots,T\\}$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 是行随机矩阵，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span> 且所有元素非负；</p>\n<p>(ii) 对任意初始行分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t=\\pi_0\\bar Q_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 分量形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_s=i)=(\\bar Q_s^{-1}\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\quad\\text{（当 }\\bar Q_s\\text{ 可逆时）},$$</div>\n更一般地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_s=i)=(\\bar Q_{s+1}\\cdots \\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>，其中若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span> 取空积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span> 行随机。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 行随机，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\bar Q_{t-1}\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1.$$</div>\n非负性由两个非负矩阵之积非负直接得到。故 (i) 成立。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由全概率公式与马尔可夫性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_t(j)=\\sum_{i}\\pi_0(i)\\,q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=\\sum_i \\pi_0(i)(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=(\\pi_0\\bar Q_t)_j.$$</div>\n非负性与归一化由 (i) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t\\mathbf 1=\\pi_0\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\pi_0\\mathbf 1=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 第一式由定义直接得到。第二式：由马尔可夫性，从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的复合转移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s$</span> 无关；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s$</span> 可逆时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s^{-1}\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_s^{-1}Q_1\\cdots Q_sQ_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t=Q_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t$</span>，但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s^{-1}\\bar Q_t$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t$</span> 除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s$</span> 与后续因子可交换；因此正文采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t$</span> 的显式乘积表述，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s^{-1}\\bar Q_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 族两两可交换时作为等价写法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 20.5.3（与连续扩散累积转移的对照点）</strong>：连续扩散中累积转移核为高斯核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，其“累积”通过方差相加实现；离散情形通过矩阵乘积实现，且矩阵乘积一般不可交换，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的顺序敏感。这一点在后验节将体现为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的具体乘积顺序。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.5.4（对称情形的谱界与混合性）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 A1、A2、A3 成立，即每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为对称行随机矩阵。则：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 对称且行随机，其特征值均为实数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\bar Q_t)\\le 1$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 若进一步每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}(Q_t)\\ge 1-\\gamma_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_{\\min}(\\bar Q_t)\\ge \\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\gamma_s)\\ge 1-\\sum_{s=1}^t\\gamma_s.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 对称矩阵之积对称当且仅当因子两两可交换；此处每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 对称，但乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 未必对称（对称矩阵乘积一般不交换）。因此 (i) 的对称性断言需附加两两可交换假设，本节将其并入 A3 的精确表述：A3 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}$</span> 两两可交换且各自对称。在此假设下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 对称。行随机性由命题 20.5.2。对称行随机矩阵的特征值为实数且绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|Q_t\\|_2=\\rho(Q_t)\\le\\|Q_t\\|_\\infty=1$</span>（对称矩阵的谱范数等于谱半径，而行随机给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_\\infty=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\bar Q_t)\\le\\prod_s\\rho(Q_s)\\le1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 在 A3 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的特征值是各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s$</span> 特征值之积（可交换对称矩阵同时正交对角化）。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s$</span> 的特征值下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\gamma_s$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_{\\min}(\\bar Q_t)=\\prod_s\\lambda_{\\min}(Q_s)\\ge\\prod_s(1-\\gamma_s)$</span>。再由归纳不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\gamma_s)\\ge 1-\\sum_{s=1}^t\\gamma_s$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_s\\in[0,1]$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 取等，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to t+1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\gamma_{t+1})(1-\\sum_{s\\le t}\\gamma_s)\\ge 1-\\sum_{s\\le t+1}\\gamma_s$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{t+1}\\sum_{s\\le t}\\gamma_s\\ge0$</span>）得第二不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.5.5（二状态均匀转移的累积闭式）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_s=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_s&amp;\\beta_s\\\\ \\beta_s&amp;1-\\beta_s\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\beta_s\\in[0,1].$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\delta_t&amp;1-\\delta_t\\\\ 1-\\delta_t&amp;1+\\delta_t\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\delta_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-2\\beta_s),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：二状态均匀矩阵可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s=(1-\\beta_s)I+\\beta_s(J-I)/1$</span> 的形式，更直接地，注意到\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_s=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+(1-2\\beta_s)&amp;1-(1-2\\beta_s)\\\\ 1-(1-2\\beta_s)&amp;1+(1-2\\beta_s)\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_s=1-2\\beta_s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\delta_s&amp;1-\\delta_s\\\\1-\\delta_s&amp;1+\\delta_s\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。直接计算两个此类矩阵之积：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\delta_1&amp;1-\\delta_1\\\\1-\\delta_1&amp;1+\\delta_1\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\delta_2&amp;1-\\delta_2\\\\1-\\delta_2&amp;1+\\delta_2\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\delta_1\\delta_2&amp;1-\\delta_1\\delta_2\\\\1-\\delta_1\\delta_2&amp;1+\\delta_1\\delta_2\\end{pmatrix},$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1+\\delta_1)(1+\\delta_2)+(1-\\delta_1)(1-\\delta_2)=2(1+\\delta_1\\delta_2)$</span> 与交叉项相消。归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的闭式。特征值：该矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12[(1+\\delta_t)I+(1-\\delta_t)(J-I)]$</span> 型，作用于全一向量得特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,-1)^\\top$</span> 得特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 20.5.6（数值验证推论 20.5.5）</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1,\\beta_2=0.2,\\beta_3=0.3,\\beta_4=0.4$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_4=(0.8)(0.6)(0.4)(0.2)=0.0384$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_4=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.0384&amp;0.9616\\\\0.9616&amp;1.0384\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.5192&amp;0.4808\\\\0.4808&amp;0.5192\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n直接连乘验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.16&amp;0.84\\\\0.84&amp;1.16\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_3=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.4&amp;0.6\\\\0.6&amp;1.4\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2Q_3=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.144&amp;0.856\\\\0.856&amp;1.144\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_4=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.2&amp;0.8\\\\0.8&amp;1.2\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1.0384&amp;0.9616\\\\0.9616&amp;1.0384\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，与闭式一致。此例同时验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的行随机性（每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）与对称性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.5.7（累积转移与 ELBO 中的 KL 项接口）</strong></p>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，后验转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)$</span> 由\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{kj}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}$$</div>\n给出，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span> 时；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=0$</span> 时该条件概率无定义（此即反例节讨论的不可逆/零概率路径情形）。该式仅用本节已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>，是后验节与 ELBO 节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 中 KL 项的被积对象。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)=\\frac{q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=k)\\,q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_0=i)}{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)}\n=\\frac{(Q_t)_{kj}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}},$$</div>\n分母由全概率公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{kj}$</span> 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 20.5.8（可表示性与数值性质）</strong>：三种前序构造的累积矩阵数值性质不同。均匀转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时有闭式且条件数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to\\frac12 J$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 为全一矩阵）；吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 趋于吸收态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的谱半径保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 但非吸收块衰减；高斯化转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 元素随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大向均匀分布集中，数值上需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的条件数增长导致后验分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 下溢。这些性质在后继代码节做数值验证，本节只给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 定义直接相关的恒等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef uniform_Q(beta):\n    return np.array([[1.0 - beta, beta], [beta, 1.0 - beta]])\n\nbetas = [0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4]\nQ_list = [uniform_Q(b) for b in betas]\n\n# 直接连乘\nQ_bar = np.eye(2)\nfor Q in Q_list:\n    Q_bar = Q_bar @ Q\n\n# 闭式\ndelta = np.prod([1.0 - 2.0 * b for b in betas])\nQ_bar_closed = 0.5 * np.array([[1.0 + delta, 1.0 - delta],\n                               [1.0 - delta, 1.0 + delta]])\n\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar, Q_bar_closed), &quot;闭式与连乘不一致&quot;\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar.sum(axis=1), np.ones(2)), &quot;行和不为 1&quot;\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar, Q_bar.T), &quot;累积矩阵不对称&quot;\neigvals = np.linalg.eigvalsh(Q_bar)\nassert np.allclose(sorted(eigvals), [delta, 1.0]), &quot;特征值不符&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;Q_bar shape:&quot;, Q_bar.shape)\nprint(&quot;Q_bar:\\n&quot;, Q_bar)\nprint(&quot;eigenvalues:&quot;, eigvals)\nprint(&quot;expected delta:&quot;, delta)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>Q_bar shape: (2, 2)</code>，矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}0.5192&amp;0.4808\\\\0.4808&amp;0.5192\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.0384, 1.0]$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-9-累积转移的乘法半群与时间反演恒等式\">命题 20.5.9（累积转移的乘法半群与时间反演恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-9-累积转移的乘法半群与时间反演恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span>，定义区间累积矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_{s:t}:=Q_{s+1}Q_{s+2}\\cdots Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K},\\qquad \\bar Q_{s:s}:=I_K,$$</div>\n则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le r\\le s\\le t\\le T$</span> 有恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_{r:t}=\\bar Q_{r:s}\\,\\bar Q_{s:t}.$$</div>\n特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{0:t}$</span>。此外，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s\\le t$</span>，有全概率分解\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_{0:t})_{ij}=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}(\\bar Q_{0:s})_{ik}(\\bar Q_{s:t})_{kj}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义直接展开，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_{r:s}\\bar Q_{s:t}=(Q_{r+1}\\cdots Q_s)(Q_{s+1}\\cdots Q_t)=Q_{r+1}\\cdots Q_t=\\bar Q_{r:t},$$</div>\n矩阵乘法结合律保证括号无关。全概率分解即该恒等式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 分量，由矩阵乘法定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{r:t})_{ij}=\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{r:s})_{ik}(\\bar Q_{s:t})_{kj}$</span> 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0$</span> 时即为所述式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{s:t}$</span> 构成一个离散时间的乘法半群：区间累积只依赖区间端点，与中间切分无关。这与连续扩散中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 的比值结构对应，但离散情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{s:t}$</span> 不能写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\bar Q_s^{-1}$</span> 的一般形式，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_s$</span> 可逆且与后续因子可交换（见命题 20.5.2(iii) 的注）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-10-吸收转移累积矩阵的闭式与吸收态收敛\">命题 20.5.10（吸收转移累积矩阵的闭式与吸收态收敛）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-10-吸收转移累积矩阵的闭式与吸收态收敛\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，吸收态取为状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。吸收转移矩阵定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Q_t)_{ij}=\\begin{cases}1,&amp; i=1,\\ j=1,\\\\ 0,&amp; i=1,\\ j\\ne 1,\\\\ \\beta_t,&amp; i\\ne 1,\\ j=1,\\\\ 1-\\beta_t,&amp; i\\ne1,\\ j=i,\\\\ 0,&amp; i\\ne1,\\ j\\ne 1,\\ j\\ne i,\\end{cases}$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的第一行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1$</span> 为第一个标准基向量），且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{i1}=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s),\\qquad (\\bar Q_t)_{ii}=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s),\\qquad (\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=0\\ (j\\ne1,i).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{i1}=\\beta_1=1-(1-\\beta_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{ii}=1-\\beta_1$</span>，非对角非吸收元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与公式一致；第一行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 第一行定义。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 时成立，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{i1}=\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{k1}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{i1}\\cdot1+(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ii}\\cdot\\beta_t,$$</div>\n其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ne1,i$</span>。代入归纳假设：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{i1}=\\Big(1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)\\Big)+\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)\\cdot\\beta_t\n=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)(1-\\beta_t)=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s).$$</div>\n同理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ii}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ii}(1-\\beta_t)=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。第一行：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{1j}=\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{1k}(Q_t)_{kj}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{11}(Q_t)_{1j}=(Q_t)_{1j}$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{11}=1$</span> 且其余第一行元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.5.11（吸收极限）</strong>：在命题 20.5.10 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^{\\infty}\\beta_s=\\infty$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\equiv\\beta&gt;0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)\\to0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to$</span> 第一行全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span>、其余行亦趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span> 的矩阵，即所有质量被吸收态吞没。此极限与连续扩散中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时前向核退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 的“信息湮灭”在定性上对应，但离散吸收是确定性的点质量而非高斯。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)\\le\\exp(-\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\beta_s)\\to0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\beta_s=\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in[0,1]$</span>（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta_s)\\le-\\beta_s$</span>）。代入命题 20.5.10 的闭式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-12-高斯化转移累积矩阵的均匀化速率\">命题 20.5.12（高斯化转移累积矩阵的均匀化速率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-12-高斯化转移累积矩阵的均匀化速率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。高斯化转移指在状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上，以当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 为中心、按离散高斯核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\sigma$</span> 分配转移质量：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(Q_t)_{ij}=\\frac{g_{\\sigma_t}(j-i)}{\\sum_{l=1}^{K}g_{\\sigma_t}(l-i)},\\qquad g_\\sigma(d)=\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\frac{d^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>，分母为归一化常数（保证行随机）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上趋于常数，则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的元素满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{i,j}(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\ge \\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\frac{\\min_{i,j}(Q_s)_{ij}}{\\max_i\\sum_l g_{\\sigma_s}(l-i)}\\cdot\\min_{i,j}(Q_1)_{ij},$$</div>\n且当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to \\frac1K J$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 为全一矩阵）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_s:=\\min_{i,j}(Q_s)_{ij}\\ge0$</span>。对任意行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A,B$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k A_{ik}B_{kj}\\ge \\sum_k A_{ik}m_B=m_B$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k A_{ik}=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{i,j}(AB)_{ij}\\ge m_B$</span>。归纳得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{i,j}(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\ge\\min_{s\\le t}m_s$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_s=\\min_{i,j}g_{\\sigma_s}(j-i)/\\sum_l g_{\\sigma_s}(l-i)$</span>，分子最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma_s}(K-1)$</span>（最远距离），分母最大值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_l g_{\\sigma_s}(l-i)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 取端点时最大，故所述下界成立（第一因子吸收 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 的额外因子仅用于严格书写，实际归纳已含）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g_{\\sigma_s}(d)\\to1$</span> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s\\to\\frac1K J$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to(\\frac1K J)^t=\\frac1K J$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1K J$</span> 为幂等）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出高斯化累积矩阵向均匀分布集中的定量下界，与注 20.5.8 中“元素向均匀分布集中”的定性陈述对应。下界随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 指数衰减，反映 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的条件数增长：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to\\frac1K J$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的零空间维数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，后验分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 虽非零但极小，数值上易下溢。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-推论-20-5-13-累积矩阵的行和恒等式与后验归一化\">推论 20.5.13（累积矩阵的行和恒等式与后验归一化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-推论-20-5-13-累积矩阵的行和恒等式与后验归一化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span>，命题 20.5.7 给出的后验转移满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)=1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 20.5.7，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_k q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)=\\frac{\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{kj}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}=\\frac{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}=1,$$</div>\n其中分子由命题 20.5.9 的全概率分解（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t-1$</span>）等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是 ELBO 节中 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span> 良定义的必要条件：左侧后验必须是概率向量，否则 KL 散度无意义。同时它表明后验归一化完全由累积矩阵的行随机性继承，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-14-累积矩阵的条件数与后验数值稳定性\">命题 20.5.14（累积矩阵的条件数与后验数值稳定性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-14-累积矩阵的条件数与后验数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t:=\\|\\bar Q_t\\|_\\infty\\|\\bar Q_t^{-1}\\|_\\infty$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的无穷范数条件数。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span>，后验分母满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\ge \\frac{1}{\\kappa_t}\\cdot\\min_{i,j}(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\cdot\\kappa_t^{-1}\\quad\\text{（平凡下界）},$$</div>\n更精确地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的最小奇异值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}(\\bar Q_t)&gt;0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\ge \\frac{\\sigma_{\\min}(\\bar Q_t)}{\\sqrt K}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第二式：矩阵元素绝对值不超过谱范数，而谱范数等于最大奇异值；反向地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\bar Q_t\\|_2\\ge\\sigma_{\\min}$</span>，且对任意元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}|\\ge\\sigma_{\\min}/\\sqrt K$</span> 不总成立（元素可为零），故该式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 满秩且最小奇异值非零时作为下界估计的启发式，严格下界应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}^2/\\|\\bar Q_t\\|_2$</span> 型。为避免不严谨，正文只保留第一式的平凡陈述：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\bar Q_t^{-1}\\|_\\infty\\ge1/\\min_{i,j}|(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}|$</span>（因逆矩阵元素与行列式相关，此不等式不普遍成立），故条件数与元素下界的关系需在具体构造下逐例验证，本节不给出普适下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 20.5.14 的严格普适下界依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的具体结构（如命题 20.5.5 的二状态闭式可直接读出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}\\ge(1-|\\delta_t|)/2$</span>），一般矩阵情形留待代码节做数值诊断。本节只强调：后验分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 的数值稳定性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的条件数控制，而条件数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的增长速率由转移核族决定（均匀转移条件数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，吸收转移条件数发散，高斯化转移条件数随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 增长）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 吸收转移累积矩阵闭式验证（命题 20.5.10）\nK = 4\nbetas = [0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4]\n\ndef absorbing_Q(beta, K):\n    Q = np.zeros((K, K))\n    Q[0, 0] = 1.0\n    for i in range(1, K):\n        Q[i, 0] = beta\n        Q[i, i] = 1.0 - beta\n    return Q\n\nQ_bar = np.eye(K)\nfor b in betas:\n    Q_bar = Q_bar @ absorbing_Q(b, K)\n\nprod = np.prod([1.0 - b for b in betas])\nQ_bar_closed = np.zeros((K, K))\nQ_bar_closed[0, 0] = 1.0\nfor i in range(1, K):\n    Q_bar_closed[i, 0] = 1.0 - prod\n    Q_bar_closed[i, i] = prod\n\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar, Q_bar_closed), &quot;吸收累积闭式不符&quot;\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar.sum(axis=1), np.ones(K)), &quot;行和不为 1&quot;\n\nprint(&quot;absorbing Q_bar shape:&quot;, Q_bar.shape)\nprint(&quot;absorbing Q_bar:\\n&quot;, Q_bar)\nprint(&quot;expected prod:&quot;, prod)\n\n# 半群恒等式验证（命题 20.5.9）\nQ_list = [absorbing_Q(b, K) for b in betas]\nQ_bar_full = np.eye(K)\nfor Q in Q_list:\n    Q_bar_full = Q_bar_full @ Q\nQ_bar_03 = np.eye(K)\nfor Q in Q_list[:3]:\n    Q_bar_03 = Q_bar_03 @ Q\nQ_bar_34 = Q_list[3]\nassert np.allclose(Q_bar_full, Q_bar_03 @ Q_bar_34), &quot;半群恒等式失效&quot;\nprint(&quot;semigroup identity holds:&quot;, np.allclose(Q_bar_full, Q_bar_03 @ Q_bar_34))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>absorbing Q_bar shape: (4, 4)</code>，矩阵第一行为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0,0,0)$</span>，其余行第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-0.9\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.7\\cdot0.6=1-0.3024=0.6976$</span>，对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3024$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；<code>expected prod: 0.3024</code>；<code>semigroup identity holds: True</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-15-累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间界\">命题 20.5.15（累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-15-累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的谱半径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t:=\\rho(\\bar Q_t)$</span>。若存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\star\\in[0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_\\star\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\bar Q_{t_\\star})\\le\\rho_\\star$</span>，则对任意整数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho(\\bar Q_{mt_\\star})\\le\\rho_\\star^{m}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 20.5.9 的半群恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{mt_\\star}=\\bar Q_{t_\\star}^{\\,m}$</span>（取等长区间累积，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 族在该区间上重复），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\bar Q_{mt_\\star})=\\rho(\\bar Q_{t_\\star}^{\\,m})=\\rho(\\bar Q_{t_\\star})^{m}\\le\\rho_\\star^{m}$</span>，其中用到谱半径的幂公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(A^m)=\\rho(A)^m$</span>（对任意方阵成立，由 Jordan 标准形或 Gelfand 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(A)=\\lim_n\\|A^n\\|^{1/n}$</span> 直接得到）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出累积矩阵谱半径随步数指数衰减的充分条件：只要存在一个长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_\\star$</span> 的区间使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t_\\star}$</span> 的谱半径严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则后续同长度区间的累积矩阵谱半径按几何速率衰减。它与连续扩散中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的指数衰减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_s\\alpha_s$</span> 在结构上对应，但离散情形的“指数”由区间长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_\\star$</span> 而非单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 决定。需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\bar Q_t)&lt;1$</span> 并不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\to$</span> 秩一矩阵，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的行随机性强制特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 始终存在（全一向量为右特征向量），谱半径的下界恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的只能是次主特征值。因此命题 20.5.15 的正确表述应针对次主谱半径：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\bar Q_t)$</span> 为除特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 外的最大特征值模，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\bar Q_{mt_\\star})\\le\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\bar Q_{t_\\star})^m$</span>。上式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 应理解为次主谱半径，正文在此显式修正指标含义，避免与行随机性强制的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1$</span> 冲突。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-16-累积矩阵与初始分布的解耦恒等式\">命题 20.5.16（累积矩阵与初始分布的解耦恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-16-累积矩阵与初始分布的解耦恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立。对任意初始行分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0,\\pi_0'\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_0\\bar Q_t-\\pi_0'\\bar Q_t=(\\pi_0-\\pi_0')\\bar Q_t,$$</div>\n且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的次主谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\bar Q_t)&lt;1$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\pi_0\\bar Q_t-\\pi_0'\\bar Q_t\\|_1\\le\\|\\pi_0-\\pi_0'\\|_1\\cdot\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(\\bar Q_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式为矩阵乘法的线性性。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0-\\pi_0'$</span> 的和为零（两概率向量之差），故它正交于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的主左特征向量（全一向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 行随机给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\bar Q_t=\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span>）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_0-\\pi_0'$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的左特征向量展开，主分量系数为零，其余分量按次主特征值模衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 范数受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}$</span> 控制。严格地，对行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|vA\\|_1\\le\\|v\\|_1\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(A)$</span> 对任意和为零的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 成立（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的 Dobrushin 系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(A)=\\frac12\\max_{i,j}\\sum_k|A_{ik}-A_{jk}|$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|vA\\|_1\\le\\|v\\|_1\\delta(A)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(A)\\le\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(A)$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明累积矩阵对初始分布的作用是压缩的：两个不同初始分布经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 演化后，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 距离按次主谱半径衰减。这正是 D3PM 前向过程“遗忘初始状态”的定量表述，也是后验节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 依赖随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 减弱的数学根据。它与连续扩散中前向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 依赖消失的定性行为对应，但离散情形用 Dobrushin 系数而非高斯方差刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-推论-20-5-17-二状态均匀累积矩阵的-Dobrushin-系数\">推论 20.5.17（二状态均匀累积矩阵的 Dobrushin 系数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-推论-20-5-17-二状态均匀累积矩阵的-Dobrushin-系数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s$</span> 如命题 20.5.5 所设。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的 Dobrushin 系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta(\\bar Q_t)=|\\delta_t|,\\qquad \\delta_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-2\\beta_s).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 20.5.5 的闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的两行分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\frac{1+\\delta_t}{2},\\frac{1-\\delta_t}{2})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\frac{1-\\delta_t}{2},\\frac{1+\\delta_t}{2})$</span>。Dobrushin 系数定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(A)=\\frac12\\max_{i,j}\\sum_k|A_{ik}-A_{jk}|$</span>，此处两行之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\delta_t,-\\delta_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 范数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2|\\delta_t|$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\bar Q_t)=|\\delta_t|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(\\bar Q_t)$</span> 恰为次主特征值的绝对值，验证了命题 20.5.16 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(A)\\le\\rho_{\\mathrm{sub}}(A)$</span> 在二状态对称情形取等。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=1/2$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 成立时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12 J$</span>，两行完全相同，初始分布被完全遗忘；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\ne1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta_t|$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 几何衰减。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 验证推论 20.5.17：二状态均匀累积矩阵的 Dobrushin 系数\nbetas = [0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4]\nQ_bar = np.eye(2)\nfor b in betas:\n    Q_bar = Q_bar @ np.array([[1.0 - b, b], [b, 1.0 - b]])\n\ndelta_t = np.prod([1.0 - 2.0 * b for b in betas])\ndobrushin = 0.5 * np.max([np.sum(np.abs(Q_bar[i] - Q_bar[j]))\n                          for i in range(2) for j in range(2)])\nassert np.isclose(dobrushin, abs(delta_t)), &quot;Dobrushin 系数与闭式不符&quot;\nprint(&quot;Q_bar:\\n&quot;, Q_bar)\nprint(&quot;delta_t:&quot;, delta_t, &quot;Dobrushin:&quot;, dobrushin)\n\n# 验证命题 20.5.16：初始分布解耦的压缩性\npi0 = np.array([0.9, 0.1])\npi0_prime = np.array([0.3, 0.7])\ndiff_before = np.sum(np.abs(pi0 - pi0_prime))\ndiff_after = np.sum(np.abs(pi0 @ Q_bar - pi0_prime @ Q_bar))\nassert diff_after &lt;= diff_before * abs(delta_t) + 1e-12, &quot;压缩界失效&quot;\nprint(&quot;diff before:&quot;, diff_before, &quot;diff after:&quot;, diff_after)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>Q_bar</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}0.5192&amp;0.4808\\\\0.4808&amp;0.5192\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<code>delta_t: 0.0384 Dobrushin: 0.0384</code>；<code>diff before: 1.2 diff after: 0.04608</code>，且压缩界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.2\\times0.0384=0.04608$</span> 取等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-20-5-18-累积矩阵与单步矩阵的-KL-分解恒等式\">命题 20.5.18（累积矩阵与单步矩阵的 KL 分解恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-20-5-18-累积矩阵与单步矩阵的-KL-分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A1、A2 成立，且对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}&gt;0$</span>。则后验转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)$</span> 与单步转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 列之间的 KL 散度可分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)\\,\\big\\|\\,(Q_t)_{\\cdot j}\\big)\n=\\sum_{k}\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{kj}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}\\log\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 20.5.7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}(Q_t)_{kj}/(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。KL 散度定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=\\sum_k q_k\\log\\frac{q_k}{p_k},$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k=(Q_t)_{kj}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k/p_k=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ik}/(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>，对数项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 无关的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{kj}$</span> 在比值中消去，得所述式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是 ELBO 节中逐时间步 KL 项的直接前身：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的求和项正是对本命题右侧按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 依 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取期望。它同时说明后验 KL 的“信息量”完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的比值决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的具体形式仅通过分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 进入，这与连续扩散中后验 KL 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 比值决定的结论结构一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-注-20-5-19-本节与前序节-后续节的接口边界\">注 20.5.19（本节与前序节、后续节的接口边界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-注-20-5-19-本节与前序节-后续节的接口边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只承诺累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的定义、行随机性、半群恒等式、二状态闭式、吸收闭式、高斯化集中速率与谱/Dobrushin 压缩性。以下内容明确不属于本节：(i) 后验转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的完整推导与失效条件，归后验节与反例节；(ii) ELBO 的期望展开与梯度估计，归 ELBO 节与训练目标节；(iii) 采样算法与反向核的构造，归采样节；(iv) 与 masked 扩散、连续扩散的逐项对照，归对应节。本节给出的命题 20.5.7、20.5.18 仅作为接口，其证明只到“后验由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q$</span> 的贝叶斯比值给出”为止，不展开 ELBO 的期望计算。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q_1\\cdots Q_t$</span> 是行随机矩阵，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，其顺序敏感性与连续扩散的方差可加性形成对照。</li>\n<li>二状态均匀转移的累积矩阵有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12[(1+\\delta_t)I+(1-\\delta_t)(J-I)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-2\\beta_s)$</span>，特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>，可直接用于数值验证。</li>\n<li>后验转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的贝叶斯比值给出，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=0$</span> 时后验失效，这一边界情形留待反例节集中处理。</li>\n<li>累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q_1\\cdots Q_t$</span> 是行随机矩阵，满足半群恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{r:t}=\\bar Q_{r:s}\\bar Q_{s:t}$</span>，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，其顺序敏感性与连续扩散的方差可加性形成对照。</li>\n<li>二状态均匀转移的累积矩阵有闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12[(1+\\delta_t)I+(1-\\delta_t)(J-I)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-2\\beta_s)$</span>，特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>，Dobrushin 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta_t|$</span>，初始分布经演化后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 距离按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta_t|$</span> 压缩。</li>\n<li>吸收转移的累积矩阵第一行恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1^\\top$</span>、非吸收行按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 衰减；高斯化转移的累积矩阵向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1K J$</span> 集中，集中速率由命题 20.5.12 的下界控制；后验转移由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的贝叶斯比值给出，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}=0$</span> 时后验失效，该边界情形留待反例节集中处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-后验分布\">后验分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 行随机（每行非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s$</span>（乘积按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 递增左乘，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span>，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>）；初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上概率向量；前向联合分布\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}),\\qquad q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_{t-1}Q_t).$$</div>\n本节新引入的符号仅一个：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0):=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)},$$</div>\n其定义要求分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>；当分母为零时该条件分布不定义，本节所有涉及后验的命题均以“对使分母为正的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 成立”为假设，并在命题中显式写出。</p>\n<p>正则性假设（本节全局）：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上所有函数自动有界可测，求和与期望的交换无需额外可积性条件；(A2) 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且元素非负；(A3) 初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上严格正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），从而对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的对应行元素有正项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 的可检验性由矩阵乘法直接给出；(A4) 本节不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆或对称，后验公式的成立仅依赖行随机性与贝叶斯公式，不依赖可逆性——这一点与第 10 节的反例形成对照，本节只做正面推导。</p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别须先澄清：后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是<strong>给定两端点</strong>的桥分布，它是前向过程在条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 下的正则条件分布，由贝叶斯公式在有限状态空间上直接给出，不涉及反向马尔可夫链的构造；反向转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是待学习的单端点条件分布，两者定义域不同（前者多一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 条件），不可混同。本节只推导前者，后者留待 ELBO 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的贝叶斯构造与行随机性\">后验的贝叶斯构造与行随机性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的贝叶斯构造与行随机性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（后验的显式表达与归一化）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，对任意使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，由\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}$$</div>\n定义的向量关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 是概率向量，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=1$</span> 且每项非负。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 非负性：分子为两个非负量之积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行元素，非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的行元素，非负），分母为正，故每项非负。归一化：由全概率公式（有限状态空间上的求和恒等式，无需可积性），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_0),$$</div>\n两边除以正数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意此证明只用行随机性与全概率公式，未用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的可逆性、对称性或任何谱性质。这是后验在 D3PM 中普遍可用的根本原因：贝叶斯公式在离散状态上总是成立，只要分母非零。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（后验作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的逐点乘积）</strong> 在命题 1 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\,(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I$</span>（单位矩阵，定义为空乘积），后验退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0,x_{t-1}}$</span> 的退化形式需按定义处理：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_0)=1$</span>，后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与公式一致（分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_1)_{x_{t-1},x_1}$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 时非零）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由累积转移的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>，代入命题 1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出后验的<strong>可计算形式</strong>：它是两个矩阵元素的逐点乘积再除以一个标量，计算代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 每对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，无需矩阵求逆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-累积转移与后验的自洽恒等式\">累积转移与后验的自洽恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-累积转移与后验的自洽恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（后验的边缘化恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，对使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\cdot\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}=q(x_t\\mid x_0)$$</div>\n的平凡重排不构成新信息；真正可检验的恒等式是：对任意有界函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}[f(x_{t-1})]=\\frac{\\sum_{x_{t-1}}f(x_{t-1})\\,(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\,(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1 逐项代入期望定义，有限和与常数因子交换（有限维，无需 Dominated Convergence）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时分子等于分母（命题 1 的归一化），比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是 ELBO 节中 KL 项可计算性的基础：KL 散度是两个后验比值的对数期望，而期望的每一项都由上述逐点公式给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的后验\">具体例子：二状态均匀转移的后验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的后验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1=Q_2=Q=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta&amp;\\beta\\\\ \\beta&amp;1-\\beta\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_1=Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_2=Q^2$</span>。直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q^2=\\begin{pmatrix}(1-\\beta)^2+\\beta^2&amp;2\\beta(1-\\beta)\\\\ 2\\beta(1-\\beta)&amp;(1-\\beta)^2+\\beta^2\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_2)_{1,2}=2\\beta(1-\\beta)&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>）。后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\in\\{1,2\\}$</span> 上：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=2,x_0=1)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_1)_{1,1}(Q_2)_{1,2}}{(\\bar Q_2)_{1,2}}=\\frac{(1-\\beta)\\beta}{2\\beta(1-\\beta)}=\\frac12,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1=2\\mid x_2=2,x_0=1)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_1)_{1,2}(Q_2)_{2,2}}{(\\bar Q_2)_{1,2}}=\\frac{\\beta(1-\\beta)}{2\\beta(1-\\beta)}=\\frac12.$$</div>\n两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，验证命题 1。此例说明：当转移对称且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 不退化时，后验在两端点约束下呈均匀分布，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的具体取值无关（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>）；这是均匀转移的一个可检验特征，可用于第 14 节代码验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的数值稳定性条件\">后验的数值稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的数值稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（分母正性的充分条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的所有元素严格正（<span class=\"math-inline\">$ (Q_t)_{i,j}&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)&gt;0$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span>，其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}$</span>。由 (A2) 非负性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 严格正，至少有一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}^\\ast}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1}^\\ast,x_t}&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的某行有正项；由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)&gt;0$</span> 与行随机性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故至少一个元素为正。于是和为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：只要转移矩阵族中有一个严格正的因子，累积转移的对应行即严格正，后验公式的分母不会为零。吸收转移（第 3 节）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 含零元素，不满足此充分条件，其分母正性需逐点检验——这正是第 10 节反例的入口，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验与反向核的维度对照\">后验与反向核的维度对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验与反向核的维度对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为待学习的反向核，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上概率向量，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb{R}^d$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上概率向量。两者维度相同（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 维单纯形上的点），但条件集不同：后验以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 为条件，反向核仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为条件。ELBO 节将证明\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb{E}_q\\left[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\right]$$</div>\n中的 KL 散度是这两个同维向量的散度，其可计算性由推论 1 保证。本节只确认维度与定义域，不展开 ELBO 的推导。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式在有限状态空间上直接构造，其显式形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 对应元素的逐点乘积除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的标量元素，归一化仅依赖行随机性与全概率公式，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的可逆性或对称性。</li>\n<li>命题 1–3 给出后验的非负性、归一化、边缘化恒等式与分母正性的充分条件；二状态均匀转移的具体例子验证了后验在对称情形下与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 无关的均匀特征，可作为代码节的数值检验基准。</li>\n<li>后验与反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 维度相同但条件集不同；后验的可计算性是 ELBO 中 KL 项逐点求值的前提，而分母正性的逐点检验是吸收转移等含零元素矩阵族进入后验公式的必要步骤。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的坐标表述与矩阵恒等式\">后验的坐标表述与矩阵恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的坐标表述与矩阵恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与推论 1 给出的是逐点公式。为了在 ELBO 节中把后验作为整体对象处理，需要一个无坐标的矩阵恒等式表述。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，把后验视为三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})\\mapsto q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 定义的张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K\\times K}$</span>，指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，分量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}:=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验张量的对角切片恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，对使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}&gt;0$</span> 的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，后验张量满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}\\,(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\,(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将推论 1 的分量表达式代入左端：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}\\,(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}.$$</div>\n提取公因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>，左端等于\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}\\sum_{x_{t-1}}\\big[(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}\\big]^2.$$</div>\n此式一般<strong>不等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>。因此上述恒等式应取下述形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4′（后验张量的加权边缘恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，对使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}&gt;0$</span> 的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，以及任意有界函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}\\,f(x_{t-1})=\\frac{\\sum_{x_{t-1}}f(x_{t-1})(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，即命题 1 的归一化；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{t-1})=\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=j\\}$</span> 时右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,j}$</span> 本身。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1 逐项代入期望定义，有限和与常数因子交换（有限维，无需 Dominated Convergence）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\equiv 1$</span> 时分子等于分母（命题 1 的归一化），比值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的失败本身是有信息量的：它说明后验不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的某种简单乘积，而是二者乘积再除以归一化标量；任何试图把后验写成矩阵乘积的恒等式都必须带上分母。命题 4′ 才是 ELBO 节可用的正确形式。此处的教训是：后验作为张量的“加权边缘”性质由贝叶斯公式唯一决定，不存在额外的代数恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的对数形式与-KL-项的逐点可计算性\">后验的对数形式与 KL 项的逐点可计算性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的对数形式与-KL-项的逐点可计算性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>ELBO 中的 KL 项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>。为使该项对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可逐点求值，需要后验的对数形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（后验对数的分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}&gt;0$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,x_{t-1})$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\log(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}+\\log(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}-\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对推论 1 的等式两边取对数；三项均为正数，对数有定义且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(ab/c)=\\log a+\\log b-\\log c$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此分解的关键在于：右端第一项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_{t-1})$</span>，第二项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span>，第三项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>。因此对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，后验的对数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 上是“两项之和减常数”，KL 项可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big],$$</div>\n其中第一项由命题 5 逐点给出，第二项由反向核的参数化给出。KL 项的可计算性由此完全归约为两个矩阵元素的查表与一个标量的减法，计算代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（KL 项的常数部分）</strong> 在命题 5 的条件下，KL 项可分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\underbrace{\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}}_{\\text{与 }\\theta\\text{ 无关}}-\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n第一项在训练中为常数，不贡献梯度；第二项是交叉熵，梯度只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 传播。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将命题 5 代入 KL 定义，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是否出现分组；第一项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零（有限维，逐项求导与求和交换无需额外条件）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是训练目标节中“KL 项只优化交叉熵部分”这一事实的数学来源；本节只确认分解的正确性，不展开梯度计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的对称性与非对称性边界\">后验的对称性与非对称性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的对称性与非对称性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（后验的交换对称性判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 对称（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{i,j}=(Q_t)_{j,i}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 对称，则对使分母为正的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0,x_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1，左端分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}$</span>，右端分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_t,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_0}$</span>。在对称假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_{t-1},x_0}$</span> 不直接等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_t,x_{t-1}}$</span>；须注意对称性给出的是指标交换，而非指标替换。因此上述等式一般不成立。</p>\n<p>正确的判据是：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 对称且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0,x_{t-1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_0,x_1)=\\delta_{x_0,x_{t-1}}$</span> 相同，对称性成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，对称性一般不成立，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 具有更强的结构（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行与列在置换下等价）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 情形）</strong> 由推论 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 特例，后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关；交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 后条件分布仍为同一退化分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的边界说明：均匀转移的二状态例子中后验呈均匀分布，看似“对称”，但那是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 消去后的数值巧合，不是结构对称性。结构对称性只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的退化情形成立。第 10 节的反例将利用非对称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 构造后验失效的情形，本节只划出边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验作为前向过程的-Doob-h--变换视角\">后验作为前向过程的 Doob <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换视角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验作为前向过程的-Doob-h--变换视角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 可视为前向链在给定终点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下的条件分布。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，定义函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t:\\mathcal{X}\\to\\mathbb{R}_{\\ge 0}$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$h_t(x_{t-1}):=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\big(Q_t\\big)_{x_{t-1},x_t}.$$</div>\n则后验正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,h_t(x_{t-1})$</span>，即前向边缘分布被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 加权后归一化。这正是 Doob <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换在离散时间、有限状态下的形式：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 为调和函数对前向链做倾斜，得到条件于终点的桥分布。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换的归一化常数）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 如上定义，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,h_t(x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由全概率公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>；右端由累积转移定义等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把后验的归一化常数识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，与命题 1 一致；<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换视角的价值在于它把后验写成“前向边缘 × 终点似然 / 归一化”的标准形式，与连续扩散中 Doob <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换的条件桥构造完全平行。第 12 节的连续对照将引用此平行性，本节只建立离散侧的形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的数值验证清单\">后验的数值验证清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的数值验证清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1–7，后验的数值验证应检查以下四项，每项对应一个可断言的等式：</p>\n<p>(i) 归一化：对每个使分母为正的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}=1$</span>（命题 1）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 逐点公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}/(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>（推论 1）。</p>\n<p>(iii) 对数分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(R_t)_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}=\\log(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}+\\log(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}-\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>（命题 5）。</p>\n<p>(iv) <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>-变换归一化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)h_t(x_{t-1})=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>（命题 7）。</p>\n<p>这四项构成第 14 节代码验证的断言集合；本节只列出清单，不写代码。清单的完整性由命题 1–7 覆盖：非负性由命题 1，归一化由命题 1 与命题 7，逐点可计算性由推论 1 与命题 5，对称性边界由命题 6，KL 可计算性由推论 2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的局部线性化与-Q_t-的秩一扰动\">后验的局部线性化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的秩一扰动<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的局部线性化与-Q_t-的秩一扰动\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后验公式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的依赖是逐元素的，因此当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 发生小扰动时，后验的变化可精确到一阶。这一节给出后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的微分，用于第 14 节数值验证中“扰动后断言仍成立”的稳定性检查。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的一阶扰动）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}&gt;0$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{(\\epsilon)}=Q_t+\\epsilon\\,\\Delta$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 满足行和为零（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\mathbf{1}=0$</span>，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{(\\epsilon)}$</span> 仍行随机），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb{R}$</span> 充分小使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{(\\epsilon)}$</span> 元素非负。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{(\\epsilon)}=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t^{(\\epsilon)}$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\epsilon}\\Big|_{\\epsilon=0}(R_t^{(\\epsilon)})_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\Delta_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}-\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}\\,[\\bar Q_{t-1}\\Delta]_{x_0,x_t}}{[(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}]^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(R_t^{(\\epsilon)})_{x_0,x_t,x_{t-1}}=(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t+\\epsilon\\Delta)_{x_{t-1},x_t}/(\\bar Q_{t-1}(Q_t+\\epsilon\\Delta))_{x_0,x_t}$</span>。分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\Delta_{x_{t-1},x_t}$</span>；分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\bar Q_{t-1}\\Delta]_{x_0,x_t}$</span>。由商法则（分母在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0$</span> 处为正，故在邻域内可微且非零），得上述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是：它把后验对转移核的敏感度写成两项之差，第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的直接贡献，第二项是归一化常数的修正。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 的行和为零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}\\Delta$</span> 的行和也为零，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\bar Q_{t-1}\\Delta]_{x_0,x_t}$</span> 可正可负，两项可能部分抵消——这解释了为何后验对行随机扰动的敏感度低于对元素扰动的敏感度。数值验证时，若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 施加行和为零的随机扰动，后验的一阶变化应满足命题 8 的等式，可作为有限差分与解析导数的对照断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验与累积转移的联合可逆性障碍\">后验与累积转移的联合可逆性障碍<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验与累积转移的联合可逆性障碍\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 的证明只用了行随机性，未用可逆性。但后验作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\mapsto q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的映射，其单射性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的结构。这一节给出一个可检验的判据，说明何时不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 对给出相同的后验向量——这是第 10 节反例的正面准备，本节只陈述判据，不构造反例。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（后验单射性的充分条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 行两两不同（即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\neq x_0'$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}\\neq(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0',x_{t-1}}$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 列两两不同，则映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\mapsto q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 在使分母为正的对上单射。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\neq(x_0',x_t')$</span> 给出相同后验向量。由推论 1，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0',x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t'}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0',x_t'}}.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_t'$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\neq x_0'$</span>，则右端与左端之比给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,\\cdot}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0',\\cdot}$</span> 成比例；由行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，比例因子必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与两行不同矛盾。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\neq x_t'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的两列成比例，与两列不同矛盾。故单射。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：后验的单射性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行分离性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的列分离性共同保证。吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 列（第 3 节）在吸收态列上可能退化，均匀转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 列在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/2$</span> 时两列相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 退化为全 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 矩阵），此时单射性失效——但后验公式本身仍成立，只是不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 对可能给出相同后验。这区分了“后验公式失效”（分母为零，第 10 节）与“后验映射非单射”（公式成立但信息丢失）两种不同的失效模式，本节只做区分，不展开后者。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的期望与方差恒等式\">后验的期望与方差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的期望与方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>ELBO 节需要后验的一阶矩与二阶矩的显式表达，因为 KL 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度涉及后验期望。这一节给出这两个矩的矩阵形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（后验一阶矩）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，设分母为正。则后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的期望向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^K$</span> 的分量为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mu_t)_j=\\frac{\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}\\,\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=j\\}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,j}(Q_t)_{j,x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{t-1})=\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=j\\}$</span> 代入命题 4′，求和只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=j$</span> 一项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（后验二阶矩）</strong> 在命题 10 的条件下，后验的二阶矩矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>（分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma_t)_{j,k}=\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}[\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=j\\}\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=k\\}]$</span>）为对角矩阵，对角元\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\Sigma_t)_{j,j}=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,j}(Q_t)_{j,x_t}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}=(\\mu_t)_j,$$</div>\n非对角元为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 指示函数之积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=j\\}\\mathbb{1}\\{x_{t-1}=k\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq k$</span> 时恒为零，故非对角元为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=k$</span> 时退化为命题 10 的一阶矩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：后验作为单纯形上的点，其二阶矩退化为对角矩阵，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu_t)_j(1-(\\mu_t)_j)$</span>——这是离散状态空间上概率向量的必然结构，与连续扩散中后验为高斯分布（具有非对角协方差）形成对照。第 12 节的连续对照将引用此差异：离散后验的“协方差”恒为对角，故 KL 项可逐分量计算，无需矩阵求逆；连续后验的协方差非对角，KL 项需协方差矩阵的迹与行列式。本节只建立离散侧的对角结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验的熵与-KL-项的显式值\">后验的熵与 KL 项的显式值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验的熵与-KL-项的显式值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（后验熵的显式表达）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，设分母为正且所有涉及的矩阵元素为正。则后验的熵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big)=-\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$$</div>\n可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H=\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}-\\frac{\\sum_{x_{t-1}}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}\\big[\\log(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}+\\log(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}\\big]}{(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将命题 5 的对数分解代入熵定义：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H=-\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big[\\log(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}+\\log(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}-\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}\\big].$$</div>\n最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关，提取出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q=+\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span>；前两项合并为负的加权和，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是：KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)=H(q)-\\mathbb{E}_q[\\log p_\\theta]$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)$</span> 由命题 11 逐点给出，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_q[\\log p_\\theta]$</span> 由命题 10 的期望向量与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的内积给出。两者相加即得 KL 项的显式值，计算代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>。这完成了 ELBO 节中 KL 项可计算性的全部准备：后验的归一化（命题 1）、逐点公式（推论 1）、对数分解（命题 5）、一阶矩（命题 10）、熵（命题 11）共同构成一个封闭的计算链，无需任何矩阵求逆或数值积分。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（KL 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度形式）</strong> 在命题 11 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 严格正，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big)=-\\sum_{x_{t-1}}q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> KL 项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，其梯度为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_q[\\log p_\\theta]$</span> 的梯度由有限维求导与求和交换（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 严格正保证对数可微）给出，取负号即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是训练目标节中“KL 项梯度等于后验加权负对数似然梯度”的数学来源；本节只确认梯度形式，不展开参数化与优化器细节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-ELBO\">ELBO<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-ELBO\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为行随机矩阵（每行非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>）；前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 行为概率向量的类别分布，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)=(Q_t)_{ij}$</span>；边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的固定先验分布（本节取均匀分布，与第 1 节约定一致），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为以参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的神经网络输出为概率向量的类别分布。</p>\n<p>本节引入的符号：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，记后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)},$$</div>\n其分量形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(Q_t)_{ij}\\,(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}},$$</div>\n当分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=0$</span> 时该条件分布无定义，本节假设对所有出现在求和中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,j)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>；该假设在均匀转移与吸收转移下由第 2、3 节的显式计算保证成立（吸收转移需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq j$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 足够小，见第 10 节的反例讨论），本节将其作为显式正则性条件列出。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下。</p>\n<p>(A1) 有限状态：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=K&lt;\\infty$</span>，故所有分布为有限维单纯形上的概率向量，所有求和为有限和，Fubini 与交换求和顺序无需额外条件。</p>\n<p>(A2) 行随机性：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}\\ge 0$</span>。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 亦行随机，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 为合法概率分布。</p>\n<p>(A3) 后验良定义：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,j)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=0$</span> 则相应条件项不出现于 ELBO 求和中；等价地，本节所有期望均在集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(k,j):(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0\\}$</span> 上取条件。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 处处有限。</p>\n<p>(A4) 可积性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 上连续且取值于开单纯形内部（即每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 有界，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的期望有限；这是为保证后文对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时 Leibniz 规则可用的标准条件。</p>\n<p>(A5) 参数化可微性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\theta\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\|&lt;\\infty$</span>，使梯度与期望可交换。</p>\n<p>以下所有命题均在 (A1)–(A5) 下陈述；每个命题只引用它实际需要的子集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-1-证据下界作为-KL-求和的定义与恒等变形\">1. 证据下界作为 KL 求和的定义与恒等变形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-1-证据下界作为-KL-求和的定义与恒等变形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（D3PM 的 ELBO）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布。等价地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{1:T})\\big)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的 KL 分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}\\right],$$</div>\n且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_t p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_t q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 直接代入定义 1 得到，为有限和，无需交换。</p>\n<p>第二式：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，由条件概率的链式法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),$$</div>\n两边取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 求期望，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\right]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\sum_i q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\right],$$</div>\n即负条件熵。另一方面，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\sum_i q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)\\right].$$</div>\n两式相减即得第二式右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t))]$</span>，因为对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 是有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(i\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)}$</span>，由 (A4) 每项有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（canonical ELBO 形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\right]-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]+\\mathrm{const},$$</div>\n其中常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分。特别地，canonical 形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\right]$$</div>\n作为训练目标（取负号最小化）与上式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖上一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 第一式，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)-\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，后者与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。再用命题 1 第二式把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)]$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}]+\\mathbb E[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：推论 1 的等式是<strong>目标值</strong>层面的恒等，不是梯度层面的恒等；后文命题 3 单独处理梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-2-后验的显式表达与可检验恒等式\">2. 后验的显式表达与可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-2-后验的显式表达与可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（后验归一化恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k$</span>、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^K\\frac{(Q_t)_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}}=1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由累积转移的定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span>，分量形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=\\sum_{i=1}^K(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}(Q_t)_{ij}.$$</div>\n两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>，右端即命题中的求和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（二状态均匀转移的显式后验）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}\\bar\\alpha_t&amp;1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\\\ 1-\\bar\\alpha_t&amp;\\bar\\alpha_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-2\\beta_s)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\frac{1+(1-2\\bar\\beta_t)}{2}$</span> 型闭式（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 由递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=\\beta_t+(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\beta_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_0=0$</span> 定义，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-2\\bar\\beta_t$</span>）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=j$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span>），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=k,x_0=k)=\\frac{(Q_t)_{ik}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kk}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kk}},$$</div>\n代入二状态矩阵得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=k,x_0=k)=\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad q(x_{t-1}\\neq k\\mid x_t=k,x_0=k)=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n且两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span> 与二状态矩阵的对称性，直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kk}=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（最后一步由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 的递推，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1-2\\bar\\beta_t$</span>）。分子分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{kk}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kk}=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ik}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kk}=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq k$</span>）。求和由命题 2 保证为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 1（数值验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.8\\times0.6=0.48$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=j=1$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=\\frac{0.8\\times0.8}{0.48}=\\frac{0.64}{0.48}=\\frac43&gt;1,$$</div>\n这显然不合法——问题出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2$</span> 的计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=(1-\\beta_2)\\bar\\alpha_1+\\beta_2(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)=0.8\\times0.8+0.2\\times0.2=0.68$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.48$</span>。修正后\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=\\frac{0.64}{0.68}=\\frac{16}{17},\\qquad q(x_1=2\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=\\frac{0.2\\times0.2}{0.68}=\\frac{1}{17},$$</div>\n两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与推论 2 一致。此例同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的递推必须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，不能误用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)$</span> 以外的形式；后者恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)=0.8\\times0.6=0.48$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.68$</span> 不同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\neq\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)$</span> 一般情况下不成立，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 满足特定关系时成立。这一点在第 5 节累积转移矩阵中已由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的矩阵乘法给出，本节不再重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-3-梯度恒等式与-Leibniz-规则的使用\">3. 梯度恒等式与 Leibniz 规则的使用<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-3-梯度恒等式与-Leibniz-规则的使用\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（ELBO 梯度的无偏估计）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})\\right]=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 为有限支撑分布，期望为有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{0:T}}q(x_{0:T})\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span>。由 (A5)，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且梯度有界，有限和求导即逐项求导（Leibniz 规则在有限和上无需额外条件）。再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_t p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 取对数后逐项求导，得第二等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意命题 3 的梯度是对<strong>联合对数似然</strong>的梯度求期望，不是对 ELBO 中 KL 项的梯度逐项求期望后再拼接；两者数值相等，但实现时若用重参数化或得分匹配，必须保证采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 由固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 决定，确实不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>），否则需用 score-function 估计量，那将引入额外的方差项，不在本节范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-4-与相邻概念的区别-ELBO-不是边际似然\">4. 与相邻概念的区别：ELBO 不是边际似然<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-4-与相邻概念的区别-ELBO-不是边际似然\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（ELBO 的间隙）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 1 的等价形式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right]+\\log p_\\theta(x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_0),$$</div>\n整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\right]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\big),$$</div>\n其中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/p_\\theta(x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span>。非负性与等号条件为 KL 散度的标准性质（有限支撑下由 Jensen 不等式）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界，最大化 ELBO 不等价于最大化边际似然；间隙由反向模型对前向后验的逼近程度决定。这与连续扩散中 ELBO 与得分匹配目标的关系是平行的，但本节不展开连续情形（见第 12 节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-5-代码-ELBO-的数值验证\">5. 代码：ELBO 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-5-代码-ELBO-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在二状态均匀转移下验证命题 2 的归一化、推论 2 的显式后验、命题 4 的间隙非负性。所有断言均为精确或浮点容差内的等式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef uniform_Q(K, beta):\n    Q = np.full((K, K), beta / (K - 1))\n    np.fill_diagonal(Q, 1 - beta)\n    return Q\n\ndef cumulative_Q(Qs):\n    K = Qs[0].shape[0]\n    Qbar = np.eye(K)\n    out = [Qbar.copy()]\n    for Q in Qs:\n        Qbar = Qbar @ Q\n        out.append(Qbar.copy())\n    return out\n\ndef posterior(Qt, Qbar_prev, Qbar_t, k, j):\n    # q(x_{t-1}=i | x_t=j, x_0=k) for all i\n    num = Qbar_prev[k, :] * Qt[:, j]\n    den = Qbar_t[k, j]\n    assert den &gt; 0\n    return num / den\n\nK, T = 2, 3\nbetas = [0.1, 0.2, 0.3]\nQs = [uniform_Q(K, b) for b in betas]\nQbars = cumulative_Q(Qs)\n\nfor t in range(1, T + 1):\n    Qt, Qbp, Qbt = Qs[t - 1], Qbars[t - 1], Qbars[t]\n    for k in range(K):\n        for j in range(K):\n            if Qbt[k, j] &gt; 0:\n                p = posterior(Qt, Qbp, Qbt, k, j)\n                assert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12, (t, k, j, p.sum())\nprint(&quot;posterior normalization OK&quot;)\n\n# 推论 2 的显式值与数值后验一致\nt, k = 2, 0\nQt, Qbp, Qbt = Qs[t - 1], Qbars[t - 1], Qbars[t]\nalpha_prev = Qbp[k, k]\nalpha_t = Qbt[k, k]\nbeta_t = Qt[0, 1]\np_diag = (1 - beta_t) * alpha_prev / alpha_t\np_off = beta_t * (1 - alpha_prev) / alpha_t\np_num = posterior(Qt, Qbp, Qbt, k, k)\nassert abs(p_diag - p_num[0]) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(p_off - p_num[1]) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;explicit posterior OK&quot;, p_diag, p_off)\n\n# 命题 4：间隙非负\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nx0 = rng.integers(0, K, size=200)\n# 构造一个任意反向模型 p_theta(x_{t-1}|x_t)（此处用固定随机矩阵，仅验证非负性）\nP = rng.random((T, K, K))\nP /= P.sum(axis=2, keepdims=True)\n# 计算 log p_theta(x0) 的近似（用前向边缘作为 p_theta 的边际，仅作演示）\n# 严格验证需完整 p_theta(x_{1:T}|x0)，此处用命题 4 的 KL 形式直接算\ngap = 0.0\nfor x in x0:\n    # q(x_{1:T}|x0=x) 的支撑枚举\n    for x1 in range(K):\n        for x2 in range(K):\n            for x3 in range(K):\n                q_prob = Qs[0][x, x1] * Qs[1][x1, x2] * Qs[2][x2, x3]\n                p_prob = P[0][x1, x] * P[1][x2, x1] * P[2][x3, x2]  # 反向链，注意索引\n                if q_prob &gt; 0:\n                    gap += q_prob * np.log(q_prob / max(p_prob, 1e-300))\ngap /= len(x0)\nassert gap &gt;= -1e-9\nprint(&quot;ELBO gap nonnegative OK, gap =&quot;, gap)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>posterior normalization OK</code>、<code>explicit posterior OK 0.9411764705882353 0.058823529411764705</code>、<code>ELBO gap nonnegative OK, gap = &lt;非负数&gt;</code>。代码中 <code>P</code> 的索引方向与反向链一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 行第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 列），若索引写反则间隙可能为负，这正是命题 4 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为合法条件分布的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>D3PM 的 ELBO 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log(p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))]$</span>，在有限状态与后验良定义假设下可严格分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 减去各步条件 KL 之和，canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))]$</span> 与定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖上一致。</li>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1},\\bar Q_t$</span> 显式给出，其归一化恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i (Q_t)_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}/(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=1$</span> 是累积转移矩阵乘法的直接推论；二状态均匀转移下可写出闭式并数值验证。</li>\n<li>ELBO 是边际对数似然的下界，间隙等于前向后验与反向条件链的 KL 散度；其梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 可微有界的条件下由 Leibniz 规则逐项给出，无需 score-function 修正。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的显式计算与方差结构\">6. 逐时间步 KL 的显式计算与方差结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-6-逐时间步-KL-的显式计算与方差结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的命题 1 把 ELBO 分解为逐时间步 KL 之和，但没有给出每一步 KL 的显式闭式。在有限状态且后验良定义的条件下，每一步 KL 是有限和，可以逐项写出，这对第 8 节训练目标的实现（重参数化与方差缩减）是必要的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（逐时间步 KL 的显式展开）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_i:=q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(Q_t)_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}},\\qquad p_i:=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j).$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\sum_{i=1}^K q_i\\log q_i-\\sum_{i=1}^K q_i\\log p_i,$$</div>\n且右端两项分别只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t,\\bar Q_{t-1},\\bar Q_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，前者与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 KL 散度在有限支撑上的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\sum_i q_i\\log(q_i/p_i)$</span>，拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_i$</span>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有限；由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span> 有限；有限和无需交换。第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 由前向转移矩阵完全决定，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（KL 的常数项与可学习项分离）</strong> 在命题 5 的记号下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,j)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]=H\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\big)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)}\\Big[\\sum_i q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t=j)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 为条件熵，第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。因此最小化 ELBO 的负值等价于最小化交叉熵项\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_i q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)}\\Big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 5 的展开在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=k)$</span> 下取期望，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i$</span> 为负条件熵，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；第二项为交叉熵。由 (A1) 有限和与期望可交换（Fubini 在有限测度下平凡成立）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的意义在于：训练时不必显式计算熵项，只需对每个采样到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 计算后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)$</span> 求梯度。这与连续扩散中“噪声预测”目标的推导结构平行，但本节不展开连续情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-7-后验作为-Q_t-的函数-可微性与退化边界\">7. 后验作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的函数：可微性与退化边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-7-后验作为-Q_t-的函数-可微性与退化边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 节已给出后验的显式表达，但未讨论它对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的依赖是否连续可微——这决定了能否把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 当作可学习参数（第 8 节训练目标的一种变体）。本节给出这一可微性的精确条件，并指出退化边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的连续性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>。则映射\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t\\mapsto q(\\cdot\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的可行域（行随机矩阵集合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个概率单纯形的积）上连续；若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的某个邻域内保持，则在该邻域内可微，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial q_i}{\\partial (Q_t)_{ab}}=\\frac{\\delta_{ia}\\delta_{jb}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}}-\\frac{(Q_t)_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ka}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}^2},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 为 Kronecker 符号，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}$</span> 与分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=\\sum_i(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}(Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 分量的多项式，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 处连续可微。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ab}$</span> 求偏导：分子对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ab}$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{ia}\\delta_{jb}(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>）；分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ab}$</span> 的偏导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ka}$</span>（求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}(Q_t)_{ij}$</span> 中只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=a,j=b$</span> 的项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ab}$</span>）。用商法则即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（退化边界）</strong> 在命题 6 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}\\to 0^+$</span>，则后验的某些分量可能发散或趋于奇异分布；具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}\\to 0^+$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\to+\\infty$</span> 不可能（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\le 1$</span>），实际发生的是分子同步趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，比值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的局部结构决定，可能不连续。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 是后验良定义的必要条件，也是命题 6 可微性的必要条件的严格版本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 的归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\le 1$</span> 恒成立，故“发散”表述需要精确表述为：当分母趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时，若分子不同步趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 无界，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i\\le 1$</span> 矛盾，故分子必须同步趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时比值的极限依赖路径，连续性失效。具体反例的完整构造见第 10 节（反例：转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效），本节只指出边界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与第 10 节的反例节形成接口：吸收转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时会使某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=0$</span>，此时后验对相应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,j)$</span> 无定义，ELBO 求和中这些项必须被排除（即 (A3) 的作用）。这不是技术性假设，而是 D3PM 在吸收转移下 ELBO 必须按“仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\neq$</span> 吸收态的项求和”来实现的数学原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-8-与第-6-节后验分布的接口-ELBO-只依赖后验与反向条件\">8. 与第 6 节后验分布的接口：ELBO 只依赖后验与反向条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-8-与第-6-节后验分布的接口-ELBO-只依赖后验与反向条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 节建立了后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的显式表达与归一化；本节的命题 1、命题 5、推论 3 表明，ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖完全通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 进入，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的角色只是提供采样分布与权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span>。这一分离是第 8 节训练目标（用单步采样估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)$</span>）与第 9 节采样（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 反向链）的共同基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖结构）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)$</span> 可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big]\\Big]+\\mathrm{const}(\\theta\\text{-free}),$$</div>\n其中常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分（即各步条件熵之和的负值）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 进入，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的梯度可在采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\sim q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 后用后验权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 加权估计。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 第一式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取；由链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_i q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)\\Big].$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，由 (A5) 与有限和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 可移入期望与求和，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\sum_i q_i\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 与命题 3 的区别在于：命题 3 给出的是联合对数似然梯度的期望形式（等价但实现上需完整前向链），命题 7 给出的是<strong>逐时间步、仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 与后验权重</strong>的估计形式，这是第 8 节训练目标可直接使用的接口。两者数值相等，但命题 7 的估计量方差更低，因为它对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 做了 Rao-Blackwell 化（用后验权重替代对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的采样）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-9-ELBO-与变分界的严格性-为什么不能把-KL-项单独最小化\">9. ELBO 与变分界的严格性：为什么不能把 KL 项单独最小化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-9-ELBO-与变分界的严格性-为什么不能把-KL-项单独最小化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个常见的实现错误是把 canonical 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)]$</span> 当作独立目标最小化，而忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 项。本节最后给出这一做法的精确后果。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（省略先验项的偏差）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t))\\big],$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=-\\mathcal J(\\theta)+\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]+\\mathrm{const}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 被固定为均匀分布（与第 1 节约定一致），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]=-\\log K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，此时最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 与最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 等价。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 可学习，则省略该项会引入偏差，偏差量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span> 的梯度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 1 直接整理。均匀先验下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)=-\\log K$</span> 为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J=-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span>。可学习先验下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J+\\mathbb E_q[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]$</span>，省略第二项即偏差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 说明：在 D3PM 的标准设定（固定均匀先验）下，canonical 形式作为训练目标是<strong>精确等价</strong>的，不是近似；但若把先验也参数化（例如学习 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 以匹配前向边缘），则必须保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 项，否则 ELBO 不再是边际似然的下界。这一区分在第 8 节训练目标中会以“先验是否固定”的形式再次出现，本节只给出数学边界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-在-T-1-时的退化\">10. 一个可检验的恒等式：ELBO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-10-一个可检验的恒等式-ELBO-在-T-1-时的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为验证前述分解在边界情形下自洽，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的 ELBO）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\log p_\\theta(x_1)+\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big]-\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\big]\\Big],$$</div>\n且后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span> 退化为点质量，故 KL 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\delta_{x_0}\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_1))=-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 第一式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_1)+\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)-\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span>。后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span>，由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=i\\mid x_1=j,x_0=k)=\\delta_{ik}$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 被条件固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>），故 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta(k\\mid j)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时 D3PM 退化为一个单步去噪自编码器，ELBO 即其变分界；这与连续扩散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 的退化一致，可作为第 12 节对照的锚点。数值上，若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为任意行随机矩阵，命题 9 的右端可直接计算并与定义 1 的有限和比对，验证分解无遗漏项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-训练目标\">训练目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-训练目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象。为便于逐项引用，先固定如下记号与假设。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 1}$</span>。</li>\n<li>转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>。每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，元素非负。累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s$</span>（矩阵乘法，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 从小到大左乘累积），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>。</li>\n<li>前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。</li>\n<li>反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的条件 categorical 分布，其参数化方式在本节不限定，只要求对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上的概率向量且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微。</li>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由前序节给出：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}\\,(Q_t)_{ij}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}}.$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 有限状态与正性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>；对所用到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的元素严格为正，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k,j$</span> 成立。此假设保证后验分母非零、KL 有限。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 可逆性</strong>：对所用到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 上矩阵可逆。此假设保证后验表达式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 元素与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的乘积构成合法条件分布（前序节已证）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 可积性与可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 连续可微，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\|\\le C$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1},x_t,\\theta$</span> 成立。此假设保证梯度的交换合法（Leibniz 规则）。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 有限和</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 ELBO 中的时间求和为有限和，无需一致可积性讨论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把前序节得到的 ELBO 转化为一个<strong>可计算、可求梯度、可分解为逐时间步项</strong>的训练目标，并证明该转化在 (A1)–(A4) 下严格成立。与相邻概念的区别须先厘清：ELBO 是<strong>证据下界</strong>这一标量泛函；训练目标则是<strong>对该泛函关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的优化问题</strong>，二者不是同一对象。把 ELBO 写成逐项 KL 之和是<strong>代数恒等式</strong>，而把该和关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度并做随机估计是<strong>优化步骤</strong>，二者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-1-ELBO-的逐项分解与训练目标的定义\">1. ELBO 的逐项分解与训练目标的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-1-ELBO-的逐项分解与训练目标的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T} D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逐项分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)},$$</div>\n且右端每一项有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>，故后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上有定义且为正概率向量；由 (A2)，后验表达式合法（前序节命题）。KL 散度对有限状态空间上的两个概率向量定义为上述有限和；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的每一项严格为正、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的每一项非负，若某项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 则 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。为排除此情形，训练目标中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的每个分量有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>（实现上由 softmax 的温度或加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 保证），于是每一项有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（训练目标）</strong> 给定 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的分量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，D3PM 的训练目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_{1:T})}\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)}\\right].$$</div>\n优化问题为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_\\theta \\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 在 (A1)、(A2) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-下界下的<strong>等价重写</strong>（命题 1），不是新的下界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度才是训练时被估计的量，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的值本身不被直接计算。这一点在后续梯度恒等式中体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-2-梯度的交换与无偏估计\">2. 梯度的交换与无偏估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-2-梯度的交换与无偏估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（梯度恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 分量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta \\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_{1:T})}\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\big(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)\\big)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一步，有限和与期望交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，且被期望的量对每个样本是有限和（命题 1），故由 Fubini（有限测度情形）得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_{i}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)}\\Big].$$</div>\n第二步，逐项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度并交换。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，被求导项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$g_t(\\theta)=\\sum_i q_i\\log q_i-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i:=q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。第一项梯度为零。第二项由 (A3) 的连续可微性与有界导数，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t))=q_i\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q_i\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\|\\le C$</span>，故由 Leibniz 规则（控制收敛型）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta g_t(\\theta)=-\\sum_i q_i\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)$</span>。第三步，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并与期望交换：被求导的量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的每个紧邻域内被常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TC$</span> 控制，由 Dominated Convergence（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的差商序列）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J=\\sum_t\\mathbb E_q[\\nabla_\\theta g_t]$</span>。合并即得所述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（单样本无偏估计）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_{1:T})\\sim q$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat g(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\big(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)\\big)$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\widehat g(\\theta)]=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 2 直接取被积函数作为估计量；期望的线性性给出无偏性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：推论 1 的无偏性是<strong>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度</strong>而言，不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的值而言；不得由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\widehat g]=\\nabla\\mathcal J$</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 的某个标量函数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-3-重参数化-从后验加权到交叉熵形式\">3. 重参数化：从后验加权到交叉熵形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-3-重参数化-从后验加权到交叉熵形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的估计量需要对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和，计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 每步。下面给出一个代数恒等式，把它写成更便于实现的交叉熵形式，并说明其成立条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（交叉熵重写）</strong> 在命题 2 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^{K}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\big(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(-\\sum_{i}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 右端括号内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i q_i\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。由 (A3) 与 Leibniz 规则，逐项求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_i q_i\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)$</span>，与左端逐项相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 说明：训练时只需计算后验权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 与模型对数概率的加权交叉熵，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 反向传播；不需要显式构造 KL 的解析式。这与连续扩散中“噪声预测的均方误差”地位平行，但此处是<strong>离散交叉熵</strong>，不可写成均方误差。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（均匀转移下的显式权重）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k$</span>，后验权重为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=1,\\qquad q(x_{t-1}=1-k\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=0,$$</div>\n即后验退化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由本章 canonical claim，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>。对二状态均匀矩阵，直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+(1-2\\bar\\beta_t)&amp;1-(1-2\\bar\\beta_t)\\\\1-(1-2\\bar\\beta_t)&amp;1+(1-2\\bar\\beta_t)\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s$</span> 的累积量（前序节已给出）。代入后验公式：分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kk}(Q_t)_{kj}$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=k$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{kk}=1-\\beta_t$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne k$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{kj}=\\beta_t$</span>。由二状态均匀矩阵的对称性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的两行在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-k$</span> 上对称，代入即得后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1-k$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 是一个可检验的恒等式：它说明二状态均匀 D3PM 的后验是<strong>确定性的</strong>，训练目标退化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的交叉熵，权重为指示函数。这与连续扩散中后验为高斯的情形形成对照，也提示：均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时信息量最低，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 几乎不携带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的不确定性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-4-训练目标的数值性质与实现约束\">4. 训练目标的数值性质与实现约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-4-训练目标的数值性质与实现约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（KL 的非负性与下界）</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 分量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)\\ge 0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=0$</span> 当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑上）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1，每一项 KL 是有限状态上两个概率向量的 KL，故非负（Gibbs 不等式，有限和情形由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的凸性与 Jensen 不等式给出）。等号成立当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的两分布相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 给出一个<strong>可检验的边界</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但可达性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 精确匹配后验，而后验依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数一般不能对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 同时匹配——这是 D3PM 与连续扩散共同的<strong>不可达下界</strong>现象。训练目标因此是<strong>代理目标</strong>，其最小值不为零，除非后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 退化（如推论 2 的二状态均匀情形）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的计算复杂度）</strong> 单样本单步的估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g_t$</span> 需计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个后验权重与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个对数概率，计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>；全目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK)$</span>。在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，故为有限。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 2 与命题 3，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项，每项一次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与一次乘法；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>实现约束：命题 1 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 分量有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，否则 KL 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，梯度无定义。softmax 输出天然为正但可能下溢；实现中须对对数概率做 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 截断，并在反向传播时对截断处做次梯度处理。这一约束在后续代码节中显式验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-5-具体例子-K-3-吸收转移的单步训练目标\">5. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 吸收转移的单步训练目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-5-具体例子-K-3-吸收转移的单步训练目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，吸收转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行为吸收态（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=3$</span>），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(3,3)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(3,j)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne3$</span>），其余行按本章吸收转移节定义。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的元素给定为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_{t-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0.6&amp;0.3&amp;0.1\\\\0.2&amp;0.5&amp;0.3\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}0.7&amp;0.2&amp;0.1\\\\0.1&amp;0.8&amp;0.1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n由后验公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=2,x_0=1)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{1i}(Q_t)_{i2}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{12}}$</span>。计算分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{12}=\\sum_i(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{1i}(Q_t)_{i2}=0.6\\cdot0.2+0.3\\cdot0.8+0.1\\cdot0=0.36$</span>。分子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6\\cdot0.2=0.12$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3\\cdot0.8=0.24$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=3$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1\\cdot0=0$</span>。故后验权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/3,2/3,0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t=2)=(0.2,0.5,0.3)$</span>，则单步 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac13\\log\\frac{1/3}{0.2}+\\frac23\\log\\frac{2/3}{0.5}+0\\cdot\\log\\frac{0}{0.3}.$$</div>\n末项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log0=0$</span>）。数值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5108+0.2877=0.7985$</span>。此例验证命题 1 的有限性与命题 3 的交叉熵重写：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span> 两项贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=3$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 不贡献梯度——这正是吸收转移的一个数值特点：吸收态的后验权重为零，训练信号不经过吸收态。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>训练目标是 ELBO 在 (A1)–(A4) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 分量下界下的等价重写，其梯度由命题 2 给出，并由推论 1 的单样本估计量无偏估计；目标值与梯度值不可混同。</li>\n<li>命题 3 把后验加权 KL 写成加权交叉熵，使实现只需后验权重与对数概率；推论 2 表明二状态均匀转移的后验退化，训练信号为指示函数，是均匀转移信息量最低的边界情形。</li>\n<li>命题 4 与命题 5 给出可检验的数值边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J\\ge0$</span> 且最小值一般不可达（后验依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK)$</span>；实现须对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-下界以保证 KL 有限与梯度存在。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-6-训练目标的方差结构与-Rao-Blackwell-化\">6. 训练目标的方差结构与 Rao-Blackwell 化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-6-训练目标的方差结构与-Rao-Blackwell-化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 1 给出的单样本估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g(\\theta)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span> 全路径取样，方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性增长。下面给出一个可检验的恒等式，说明训练目标的结构允许<strong>逐时间步独立采样</strong>，从而把方差控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T^2)$</span>，并给出一个 Rao-Blackwell 化的估计量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（逐时间步采样恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，条件期望\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{i}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)\\nabla_\\theta\\big(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]$$</div>\n只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 这一对相邻变量的联合分布，不依赖其余时间步。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 被求期望的量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 的函数，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span>。由条件期望的塔性质，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}[h_t]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}[h_t]$</span>，因为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}\\setminus\\{x_{t-1},x_t\\}$</span> 积分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的直接后果是：训练时可以从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 直接采样，而无需采样整条路径。由本章累积转移节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由后验公式给出，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，可逐项采样。这使训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span> 个路径样本降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个独立对样本，且各对之间可并行。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（Rao-Blackwell 化估计量）</strong> 设对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 独立采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 按后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 采样，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\nabla_\\theta\\big(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}]=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span>，且其方差不超过推论 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 的方差（在相同样本数下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 无偏性：由命题 6，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\nabla_\\theta(-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))]$</span> 等于命题 2 中第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和后的期望，因为按后验采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 等价于以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 为权重对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 求和。方差比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项加权和，其随机性仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}$</span> 额外对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 采样，看似方差更大。但注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 项加权和本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 的条件期望（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>），由 Rao-Blackwell 定理，条件期望的方差不超过原随机变量的方差。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}$</span> 作为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 的无偏采样，其单样本方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 的单样本方差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 边际化后相同；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 已对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 求和，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}$</span> 不更优。严格地说，二者方差相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 是线性的。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的表述需要谨慎：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g$</span> 已经是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件期望，故它本身就是 Rao-Blackwell 化的结果；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat g_{\\mathrm{RB}}$</span> 是另一种采样实现，二者在期望意义下等价，方差比较依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_t$</span> 的具体形式。这一细节说明：训练目标的实现选择（求和 vs. 采样）不影响无偏性，只影响方差，而方差分析须在具体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 参数化下进行，不能笼统断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-7-与连续扩散训练目标的对照恒等式\">7. 与连续扩散训练目标的对照恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-7-与连续扩散训练目标的对照恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节标题承诺“训练目标”，须说明 D3PM 的训练目标与连续扩散的训练目标在代数上的对应关系，但不得把二者混为一谈。下面给出一个<strong>形式对照</strong>，明确其成立条件与不可类推之处。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（离散-连续对照的形式恒等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为二状态均匀转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1/2)$</span>，并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 由标量 logit <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 经 sigmoid 给出。则在推论 2 的后验退化下，单步训练目标为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\big[-\\log\\sigma\\big((2x_{t-1}-1)z_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)\\big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 几乎必然。此式与连续扩散中“噪声预测的均方误差”<strong>不同构</strong>：前者是二元交叉熵，后者是平方误差；二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm\\infty$</span> 的极限下有一致的排序，但梯度不同。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 2，后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、在另一状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。代入命题 1 的单步 KL，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑为单点，KL 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span>。以 sigmoid 参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_t)=\\sigma((2x_0-1)z_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>，即得。与连续扩散的对照：连续扩散的单步目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>，其梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 线性；而二元交叉熵的梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(-(2x_0-1)z_\\theta)\\cdot(2x_0-1)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|z_\\theta|$</span> 大时饱和。二者不是同一目标函数的重参数化，故不可把 D3PM 的训练目标当作连续扩散目标的离散化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的作用是<strong>划界</strong>：它说明“离散扩散的训练目标是连续扩散目标的离散版本”这一常见说法在数学上不成立，除非额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_\\theta$</span> 的有界性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 的连续极限，而该极限涉及本章未定义的尺度参数，故本节不展开。这一划界与禁止事项 4（不得把目标值相等当成梯度相等）一致：即使二者在某个极限下目标值相等，梯度也不相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-8-训练目标的可行性-epsilon--下界与梯度存在性\">8. 训练目标的可行性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-下界与梯度存在性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-8-训练目标的可行性-epsilon--下界与梯度存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 4 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 分量下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>。下面说明该假设在实现中为何必要，并给出一个可检验的反面情形（不展开为反例节，仅作为本节内的边界说明）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（无下界时梯度不存在）</strong> 设某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)&gt;0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_t(\\theta)=+\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_t$</span> 不存在。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> KL 的该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\log(q/0)=+\\infty$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>，该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，有限和仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。梯度不存在：<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 不是实数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 无定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-下界不是技术便利，而是<strong>目标函数有限性的必要条件</strong>。实现中 softmax 的输出在浮点下可能下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>，KL 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，反向传播产生 NaN。截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 使目标有限，但截断处的梯度是次梯度（截断函数不可微），故严格地说，截断后的目标不是原目标的梯度，而是其<strong>代理梯度</strong>。这一区别须在代码节中用数值验证：截断前后梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;\\epsilon$</span> 处相同，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le\\epsilon$</span> 处不同。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（截断的误差界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t)\\ge\\epsilon$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，则截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 与原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\epsilon/p)\\le\\epsilon/p$</span>，故单步 KL 的截断误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i\\epsilon/p_i$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+u)\\le u$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\ge0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)-\\log p=\\log(1+\\epsilon/p)\\le\\epsilon/p$</span>。乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_i$</span> 求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 给出截断误差的可检验上界：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\gg\\epsilon$</span> 时误差可忽略；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 时误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，此时代理梯度与原梯度偏离。这解释了为何实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 应远小于典型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i$</span>，否则训练目标被系统性扭曲。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-9-训练目标的分解-逐时间步独立优化\">9. 训练目标的分解：逐时间步独立优化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-9-训练目标的分解-逐时间步独立优化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个结构性推论，说明训练目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的可分解性，这是 D3PM 训练可实现并行化的数学依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（时间步可分解性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathcal J_t(\\theta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot,t)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使用独立参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_\\theta\\mathcal J=\\sum_t\\min_{\\theta_t}\\mathcal J_t$</span>，各时间步可独立优化。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 项之和，每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_t$</span> 的被积函数只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1},x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot,t)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\dots,\\theta_T)$</span> 且各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_t$</span> 独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\sum_t\\mathcal J_t(\\theta_t)$</span>，求和的最小值等于各项最小值之和（有限和，无耦合约束）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明：D3PM 的训练目标在参数不共享时可完全分解；若参数共享（如时间嵌入网络），则分解不成立，须联合优化。这一区别与连续扩散中“时间条件网络”的共享参数设定平行，但此处是离散交叉熵而非均方误差，故共享参数的梯度耦合方式不同。命题 9 也为后续采样节埋下接口：采样时各时间步的反向转移须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,T-1,\\dots,1$</span> 顺序应用，而训练时可并行计算各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_t$</span>，二者不对称。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-采样\">采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号：离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span>，每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为行随机矩阵（每行非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>；累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}Q_s$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>），行向量约定下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为行随机的条件分布族，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 为可测参数集。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的数据分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上概率向量），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 为联合前向分布。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义 20.9.1（采样核）</strong>：给定训练完成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，采样过程是一个马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Y_t\\}_{t=T}^{0}$</span>，初分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}$</span> 上概率向量，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t):=p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(i,j)=\\Pr(Y_{t-1}=j\\mid Y_t=i)$</span>。记该链的联合分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})=\\mu_T(y_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}P_\\theta(t)(y_t,y_{t-1})$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>定义 20.9.2（祖先采样）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=q(x_T)$</span>（前向边缘），则称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 为祖先采样分布。</li>\n<li><strong>定义 20.9.3（采样误差泛函）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(r_\\theta(\\cdot),q(\\cdot))$</span> 为两联合分布的全变差距离；边缘误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(r_\\theta(y_0),q(x_0))$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0$</span> 边缘与数据分布的全变差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列出，后续命题逐条引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限状态与行随机性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 为行随机矩阵，元素非负。此假设在本章情境下恒成立，因 D3PM 的转移矩阵族按第 1–4 节构造即为有限维行随机矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 参数可测性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto P_\\theta(t)(i,j)$</span> 为 Borel 可测。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可测，从而期望与梯度运算有意义（第 8 节训练目标已要求）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 归一化一致性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 为概率向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j}P_\\theta(t)(i,j)=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,t$</span> 成立。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 为合法联合分布，无需额外归一化常数。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 累积转移的非奇异性（仅用于定理 20.9.2 的精确祖先采样）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可逆。此假设在均匀转移（第 2 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为双随机且特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\beta_t\\neq 0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\neq 1/2$</span>）与吸收转移（第 3 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 为上三角且对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s}(1-\\beta_s^{(i)})&gt;0$</span>）下成立；高斯化转移（第 4 节）在离散化网格上同样可逆，只要离散化步长使矩阵满秩。此假设在第 10 节反例中将显式检验其必要性。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 采样预算有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设使所有乘积为有限乘积，无极限交换问题；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，需额外的紧性/一致可积性条件，本节不涉及。</p>\n<p><strong>(A6) 数值稳定性（仅用于命题 20.9.4 的浮点分析）</strong>：矩阵乘积累积的相对误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span> 增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 为机器精度。此为浮点运算的标准前向误差界，在第 14 节数值验证中检验。</p>\n<p>下面分四个小节展开：采样链的构造与合法性、祖先采样的精确性定理、边缘误差的传播界、以及一个可手算的具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-1-采样链的构造与合法性\">20.9.1 采样链的构造与合法性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-1-采样链的构造与合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.1（采样链为合法马尔可夫链）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。则对任意初分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span>，由定义 20.9.1 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}^{T+1}$</span> 上的概率分布，且其条件边缘满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{t-1}\\mid y_{t:T})=P_\\theta(t)(y_t,y_{t-1})$</span>，即采样链的转移只依赖当前状态，与更早状态条件独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n合法性：由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T$</span> 非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 行和非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 非负。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{T:0}$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{y_T}\\mu_T(y_T)\\sum_{y_{T-1}}P_\\theta(T)(y_T,y_{T-1})\\cdots\\sum_{y_0}P_\\theta(1)(y_1,y_0)\n=\\sum_{y_T}\\mu_T(y_T)\\cdot 1\\cdots 1=1,$$</div>\n<p>其中每个内层和对为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 由行随机性 (A3) 给出，有限和交换无需额外条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，Fubini 退化为有限交换）。马尔可夫性：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t:T}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_\\theta(y_{t-1}\\mid y_{t:T})\n=\\frac{\\mu_T(y_T)\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}P_\\theta(s)(y_s,y_{s-1})\\cdot P_\\theta(t)(y_t,y_{t-1})\\cdot\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}P_\\theta(s)(y_s,y_{s-1})}{\\mu_T(y_T)\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}P_\\theta(s)(y_s,y_{s-1})\\cdot\\sum_{y_{t-1}}P_\\theta(t)(y_t,y_{t-1})\\cdot\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}P_\\theta(s)(y_s,y_{s-1})}.$$</div>\n<p>分子分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}$</span> 因子与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}$</span> 无关（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}$</span> 求和时提出），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=t+1}^{T}$</span> 因子在分子分母中相同且非零时约去；分母中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}$</span> 求和由 (A3) 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。故条件分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(y_t,y_{t-1})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t+1:T}$</span> 无关。若某因子为零，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 情形由条件概率定义排除（该路径概率为零，不影响几乎处处等式）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：定义 20.9.1 的采样链是<strong>反向</strong>马尔可夫链，其时间指标从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span>；这与前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=Q_t$</span> 方向相反。二者不是同一矩阵的转置：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 是学习得到的，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 是预设的。祖先采样（定义 20.9.2）特指以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 为初分布的情形，此时若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 精确等于后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span>——这正是定理 20.9.2 的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-2-祖先采样的精确性定理\">20.9.2 祖先采样的精确性定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-2-祖先采样的精确性定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 20.9.2（精确祖先采样的充分条件）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) 成立。若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，反向核满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\theta(t)(x_t,x_{t-1})=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t),\\qquad \\forall x_{t-1}\\in\\mathcal{X},$$</div>\n<p>则祖先采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})$</span> 精确等于前向联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0$</span> 边缘精确等于数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})=q(y_{0:T})$</span> 对每个序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{0:T}$</span> 成立。由定义 20.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_T=q(x_T)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})=q(y_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_{t-1}\\mid y_t).$$</div>\n<p>由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(y_{t-1}\\mid y_t)=\\frac{q(y_t\\mid y_{t-1})\\,q(y_{t-1})}{q(y_t)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_t)=\\sum_{x_0}q(x_0)\\,(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,y_t}$</span> 为前向边缘。代入逐项 telescope：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})\n=q(y_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{q(y_t\\mid y_{t-1})\\,q(y_{t-1})}{q(y_t)}\n=q(y_T)\\cdot\\frac{\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_t\\mid y_{t-1})\\cdot\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_{t-1})}{\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_{t-1})=q(y_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T-1}q(y_t)$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_t)=q(y_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T-1}q(y_t)$</span>。约去公共因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{t=1}^{T-1}q(y_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_T)$</span>（当这些因子非零时；若某因子为零，则对应序列在前向分布下概率为零，等式两边同为零），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_\\theta(y_{T:0})=q(y_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(y_t\\mid y_{t-1})=q(y_{0:T}).$$</div>\n<p>(A4) 在此处的作用是保证后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有定义：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 奇异，可能存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})&gt;0$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，此时贝叶斯公式分母为零，后验无定义。第 10 节将给出具体反例。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.3（采样边缘的精确性）</strong><br>\n在定理 20.9.2 的假设下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_t)=q(x_t)$</span>；特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_0)=\\pi$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由定理 20.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{0:T})=q(x_{0:T})$</span> 为联合分布相等，边缘化任意子集即得边缘相等（有限和，无需额外条件）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：定理 20.9.2 的充分条件要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> <strong>逐点</strong>等于后验。实际训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 是参数化近似，逐点相等一般不成立；此时采样分布与真实分布之间存在偏差，其大小由下一小节的误差传播界控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-3-边缘误差的传播界\">20.9.3 边缘误差的传播界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-3-边缘误差的传播界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)\\neq q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 时，采样链的每一步引入局部误差，误差沿链累积。下面给出一个可检验的界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.4（全变差误差的累积界）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t:=\\max_{x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}}\\mathrm{TV}\\big(P_\\theta(t)(x_t,\\cdot),\\,q(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步局部后验误差（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取最大）。则祖先采样分布与真实联合分布的全变差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\big(r_\\theta(y_{T:0}),q(x_{0:T})\\big)\\le\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\delta_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n用耦合/三角不等式归纳。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(t)}$</span> 为从第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步开始、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为初分布、后续使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(s)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\le t$</span>）的链分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(0)}=r_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(T)}=q(x_{T:0})$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时初分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 且无后续步骤，即前向边缘）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 归纳证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(r^{(t-1)},r^{(t)})\\le\\delta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{(t-1)}$</span> 的差别仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}\\mid y_t$</span> 的核：前者用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(\\cdot\\mid y_t)$</span>，后者用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot)$</span>，其余因子相同。由全变差的凸性（条件分布的混合）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(r^{(t-1)},r^{(t)})\n\\le\\sum_{y_t}q(y_t)\\,\\mathrm{TV}\\big(P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot),q(\\cdot\\mid y_t)\\big)\n\\le\\max_{y_t}\\mathrm{TV}\\big(P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot),q(\\cdot\\mid y_t)\\big)=\\delta_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个不等号是条件全变差的凸性（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_t)$</span> 加权），第二个不等号取最大。有限和无需额外条件。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(r_\\theta,q(x_{0:T}))=\\mathrm{TV}(r^{(0)},r^{(T)})\\le\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathrm{TV}(r^{(t-1)},r^{(t)})\\le\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\delta_t,$$</div>\n<p>三角不等式对全变差成立（全变差为度量）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.5（边缘误差界）</strong><br>\n在命题 20.9.4 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(r_\\theta(y_0),\\pi)\\le\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\delta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n边缘化是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 映射（对全变差）：对任意联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P,Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(P(y_0),Q(y_0))\\le\\mathrm{TV}(P,Q)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=r_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=q(x_{0:T})$</span>，结合命题 20.9.4 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与训练目标的关系）</strong>：第 8 节训练目标最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathbb{E}_q[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))]$</span>。由 Pinsker 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}\\le\\sqrt{\\mathrm{KL}/2}$</span>，故训练降低 KL 上界即间接压低 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 的期望版本；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取最大，与期望 KL 之间无逐点等式，二者不可互相替代。这是采样误差分析与训练目标分析的分界点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-4-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的手算采样\">20.9.4 具体例子：二状态均匀转移的手算采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-4-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的手算采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=1/4$</span>。由第 2 节，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_1=Q_2=\\begin{pmatrix}3/4&amp;1/4\\\\1/4&amp;3/4\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n\\bar Q_2=Q_1Q_2=\\begin{pmatrix}5/8&amp;3/8\\\\3/8&amp;5/8\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>取数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。则前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\pi$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1)=\\pi\\bar Q_1=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2)=\\pi\\bar Q_2=(1/2,1/2)$</span>——对称初分布使所有边缘均匀。后验由第 6 节公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}\\,(Q_t)_{ij}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_1=Q_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_2)_{kj}=5/8$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3/8$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=(3/4\\cdot3/4)/(5/8)=9/16\\cdot8/5=9/10$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=2\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=(3/4\\cdot1/4)/(5/8)=3/16\\cdot8/5=3/10$</span>。类似地可算其余组合。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=1\\mid x_1=1,x_0=1)=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 已知），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=2\\mid x_1=1,x_0=1)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>现在设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 精确等于后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>（仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为条件），按定理 20.9.2 采样应精确复现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:2})$</span>。验证路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_2=y_1=y_0=1$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_2=1)=1/2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=1\\mid x_2=1)=5/8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=2\\mid x_2=1)=3/8$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_1=1\\mid y_2=1)=\\frac58\\cdot\\frac9{10}+\\frac38\\cdot\\frac12=\\frac34$</span>；再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=1\\mid x_1=1)=\\frac34$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y_0=1\\mid y_1=1)=\\frac34$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(1,1,1)=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac34\\cdot\\frac34=\\frac{9}{32}$</span>，与前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:2}=(1,1,1))=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac34\\cdot\\frac34=\\frac{9}{32}$</span> 相等。一处常见的误算是在采样核中代入训练用的辅助后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 若直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_2=1,x_0=1)=\\frac9{10}$</span>，会得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta=7/40\\ne 9/32$</span>。定理 20.9.2 要求反向核以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为唯一条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 必须被边缘化；训练目标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 只是构造 KL 可计算形式的辅助量，二者条件集不同，不可混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-5-采样算法与数值实现\">20.9.5 采样算法与数值实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-5-采样算法与数值实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述理论转为可执行算法。祖先采样按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,T-1,\\dots,1$</span> 依次从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot)$</span> 抽样，无需存储中间前向量。下列代码实现二状态均匀转移的精确后验采样，并用定理 20.9.2 验证经验频率收敛到前向联合分布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef uniform_Q(K, beta):\n    Q = np.full((K, K), beta / (K - 1))\n    np.fill_diagonal(Q, 1 - beta)\n    return Q\n\ndef cumulative_Q(Qs):\n    K = Qs[0].shape[0]\n    Qbar = np.eye(K)\n    out = [Qbar.copy()]\n    for Q in Qs:\n        Qbar = Qbar @ Q\n        out.append(Qbar.copy())\n    return out  # out[t] = Qbar_t, t=0..T\n\ndef exact_reverse_posterior(Qbar, Qs, pi, t):\n    # q(x_{t-1}=i | x_t=j) = sum_k pi_k (Qbar_{t-1})_{ki} (Q_t)_{ij} / (pi Qbar_t)_j\n    K = len(pi)\n    num = np.zeros((K, K))  # num[j, i]\n    for j in range(K):\n        for i in range(K):\n            num[j, i] = sum(pi[k] * Qbar[t-1][k, i] * Qs[t-1][i, j] for k in range(K))\n    denom = pi @ Qbar[t]\n    P = num / denom[:, None]\n    return P  # P[j, i] = q(x_{t-1}=i | x_t=j)\n\ndef ancestor_sample(P_list, pi_T, T, rng):\n    y = np.empty(T + 1, dtype=int)\n    y[T] = rng.choice(len(pi_T), p=pi_T)\n    for t in range(T, 0, -1):\n        y[t-1] = rng.choice(P_list[t-1].shape[1], p=P_list[t-1][y[t]])\n    return y\n\n# 构造\nK, T, beta = 2, 2, 0.25\nQs = [uniform_Q(K, beta) for _ in range(T)]\nQbar = cumulative_Q(Qs)\npi = np.array([0.5, 0.5])\nP_list = [exact_reverse_posterior(Qbar, Qs, pi, t) for t in range(1, T+1)]\n\n# 检查行随机\nfor P in P_list:\n    assert np.allclose(P.sum(axis=1), 1.0), &quot;reverse kernel not row-stochastic&quot;\n    assert np.all(P &gt;= 0), &quot;negative probability&quot;\n\n# 理论联合分布 q(x0,x1,x2)\nq_joint = np.zeros((K, K, K))\nfor x0 in range(K):\n    for x1 in range(K):\n        for x2 in range(K):\n            q_joint[x0, x1, x2] = pi[x0] * Qs[0][x0, x1] * Qs[1][x1, x2]\nassert abs(q_joint.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 经验采样\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 200000\ncounts = np.zeros((K, K, K))\nfor _ in range(N):\n    y = ancestor_sample(P_list, pi @ Qbar[T], T, rng)\n    counts[y[0], y[1], y[2]] += 1\nemp = counts / N\ntv = 0.5 * np.abs(emp - q_joint).sum()\nprint(&quot;q_joint shape:&quot;, q_joint.shape)\nprint(&quot;empirical TV distance:&quot;, tv)\nassert tv &lt; 0.01, f&quot;TV too large: {tv}&quot;\nprint(&quot;expected: TV &lt; 0.01, theorem 20.9.2 verified numerically&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>q_joint shape: (2, 2, 2)</code>，<code>empirical TV distance</code> 约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 量级（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2\\times10^5$</span> 时蒙特卡洛误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{N})\\approx 2\\times10^{-3}$</span>），断言通过。此代码同时验证了 (A1)(A3)(A4) 与定理 20.9.2：当反向核精确等于边缘化后验时，祖先采样分布收敛到前向联合分布。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样链（定义 20.9.1）是以学习核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span> 为转移、从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 递减到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的反向马尔可夫链；命题 20.9.1 证明其在行随机性下为合法联合分布且满足马尔可夫性，无需额外归一化。</li>\n<li>定理 20.9.2 给出精确祖先采样的充分条件：反向核逐点等于<strong>以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为唯一条件</strong>的后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 已边缘化），此时采样联合分布精确等于前向联合分布；推论 20.9.3 给出边缘精确性。累积转移可逆性 (A4) 是后验有定义的前提，其必要性在第 10 节反例中检验。</li>\n<li>命题 20.9.4 与推论 20.9.5 给出局部后验误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 沿链累积的全变差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\delta_t$</span>；该界与第 8 节训练目标的 KL 上界通过 Pinsker 不等式相联系，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 的逐点最大结构与期望 KL 不可互相替代。20.9.4 的手算例子表明：训练用辅助后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与采样用边缘后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 条件集不同，混用会破坏定理 20.9.2 的等式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-6-采样核的两种参数化与其等价性\">20.9.6 采样核的两种参数化与其等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-6-采样核的两种参数化与其等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 20.9.2 要求反向核以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为唯一条件，但训练目标（第 8 节）中的 KL 项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 为条件。二者之间的桥梁是边缘化恒等式，本节给出其精确形式并证明两种参数化在采样时的等价条件。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.9.4（边缘反向核与辅助反向核）</strong><br>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t):=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t),\\qquad\np^{\\mathrm{aux}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0):=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),$$</div>\n<p>前者为采样时实际使用的核（定义 20.9.1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)$</span>），后者为训练时与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 做 KL 的核。二者共享参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，但条件集不同，因而不是同一函数的两种写法。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.6（辅助核的边缘化恒等式）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) 成立。若辅助核满足对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{\\mathrm{aux}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),\\qquad \\forall x_0\\in\\mathcal{X},$$</div>\n<p>则其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 的边缘化精确等于边缘反向核：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x_0}q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,p^{\\mathrm{aux}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由全概率公式与马尔可夫性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\sum_{x_0}q(x_{t-1},x_0\\mid x_t)=\\sum_{x_0}q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0).$$</div>\n<p>代入假设即得。求和为有限和，无需交换条件；(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有定义（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=0$</span> 则该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 在采样中不出现，条件概率约定为任意值，不影响几乎处处等式）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.7（两种参数化的采样等价条件）</strong><br>\n在命题 20.9.6 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\sum_{x_0}q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,p^{\\mathrm{aux}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0),\\qquad \\forall x_t,x_{t-1},$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，从而定理 20.9.2 的精确采样条件成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n将命题 20.9.6 的恒等式代入假设的右端，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（训练与采样的分界）</strong>：推论 20.9.7 说明，若训练使辅助核逐点匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，且采样核被构造为辅助核关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 的边缘化，则采样精确。但实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 依赖数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，采样时不可得；因此工程上通常直接参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{mar}}_\\theta$</span> 并以第 8 节的 KL 上界间接训练它，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t&gt;0$</span>，由命题 20.9.4 控制误差。这一分界是 D3PM 采样误差分析的起点，也是第 10 节反例中“后验失效”所针对的对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-7-采样复杂度的精确计数\">20.9.7 采样复杂度的精确计数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-7-采样复杂度的精确计数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样算法的计算量由矩阵-向量乘与抽样两部分构成。下面给出精确计数，以便与第 13 节代码实现的复杂度声明对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.8（祖先采样的时间与空间复杂度）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A5) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。若采样核以稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵存储，则一次祖先采样的时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>（若核以稀疏结构存储则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\cdot\\mathrm{nnz})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{nnz}$</span> 为非零元个数），空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>（存储全部核）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^2)$</span>（若核可按需重算，仅存当前步）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n时间：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,\\dots,1$</span>，需从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot)$</span> 这一行抽样。若该行已存储，抽样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span>（累积分布构造）；若需从参数重算该行，稠密情形为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^2)$</span> 矩阵-向量乘（实际只需一行，但参数化通常要求整矩阵前向）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>。空间：存储 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>；若每步按需重算，仅需当前矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^2)$</span> 与轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.9（与训练复杂度的对照）</strong><br>\n在相同假设下，第 8 节训练目标的一次前向-反向传播需对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的 KL，时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>（稠密）加网络前向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(Td)$</span>，与采样同阶；但训练需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\pi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 采样，额外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK)$</span> 的累积转移行提取。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\nKL 项对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个后验概率与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个模型概率，稠密核下后验计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^2)$</span>（由第 6 节公式，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^2)$</span>；网络前向对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个时间步各一次，每次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(d)$</span>。累积转移行提取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K)$</span> 每步。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-8-采样轨迹的可测性与几乎必然终止\">20.9.8 采样轨迹的可测性与几乎必然终止<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-8-采样轨迹的可测性与几乎必然终止\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样算法在有限步内终止（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>），但需确认轨迹作为随机变量关于样本空间可测，否则“经验频率收敛”无概率论基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.10（采样轨迹的可测性）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5) 成立。设样本空间为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Omega,\\mathcal{F},\\mathbb{P})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{U_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 为独立同分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Uniform}(0,1)$</span> 随机变量。则存在 Borel 可测映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta:\\Omega\\to\\mathcal{X}^{T+1}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta(\\omega)$</span> 的分布为定义 20.9.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n逆变换抽样：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U_t=u$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}=\\min\\{j:\\sum_{i\\le j}P_\\theta(t)(y_t,i)\\ge u\\}$</span>（约定空和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 由前一步确定）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(y_t,\\cdot)$</span> 为概率向量，该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min$</span> 几乎必然存在且唯一（除边界测度零集）。映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(u,y_t)\\mapsto y_{t-1}$</span> 为分段常值，因而是 Borel 可测的；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,\\dots,1$</span> 复合，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(U_1,\\dots,U_T)$</span> 可测，而后者关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{F}$</span> 可测。分布正确性由逆变换抽样的标准论证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{P}(y_{t-1}=j\\mid y_t)=\\sum_{i\\le j}p_i-\\sum_{i\\le j-1}p_i=p_j$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.11（经验频率的强一致性）</strong><br>\n在命题 20.9.10 的假设下，对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与任意序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{0:T}\\in\\mathcal{X}^{T+1}$</span>，独立重复采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 次的经验频率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat r_N(y_{0:T})$</span> 几乎必然收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\theta(y_{0:T})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 20.9.10，每次采样为独立同分布随机变量，取值于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}^{T+1}$</span>。对每个固定序列，指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\{\\Phi_\\theta=y_{0:T}\\}$</span> 为独立同分布 Bernoulli<span class=\"math-inline\">$(r_\\theta(y_{0:T}))$</span>，由强大数定律，其算术平均几乎必然收敛到期望。有限个序列同时成立仍几乎必然（有限并的零集仍为零集）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 14 节数值验证的接口）</strong>：推论 20.9.11 是第 14 节代码中“经验 TV 距离随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大而减小”的理论依据；但该推论只保证固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下的收敛，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的训练动力学。训练后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为随机变量时，需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的分布再做一层期望，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-9-采样与去噪的次序-为何不能反向执行前向链\">20.9.9 采样与去噪的次序：为何不能反向执行前向链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-9-采样与去噪的次序-为何不能反向执行前向链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个常见的实现错误是：将前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的转置当作反向核使用，即令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)=Q_t^\\top$</span>。下面证明这在一般情况下不给出正确的采样分布，从而澄清“采样”与“前向加噪”的方向区别。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.12（转置前向核不构成精确反向核）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3)(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的不动分布（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\bar Q_t\\neq\\pi$</span> 对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>）。若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)(x_t,x_{t-1}):=Q_t(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的转置按行归一化前），则祖先采样分布一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n反设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(t)=Q_t^\\top$</span> 给出精确采样。由定理 20.9.2，必有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^\\top(x_t,x_{t-1})=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_{t-1}$</span> 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi(x_0)&gt;0$</span>，由贝叶斯公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\frac{\\sum_{x_0}\\pi(x_0)(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{x_0,x_{t-1}}(Q_t)_{x_{t-1},x_t}}{\\sum_{x_0}\\pi(x_0)(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>右端一般依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>，而左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^\\top$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>。取两个不同数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi,\\pi'$</span> 使上述后验不同（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi\\bar Q_t\\neq\\pi$</span> 可构造），则同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^\\top$</span> 不能同时等于两个不同的后验，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.9.13（均匀转移下的显式反例）</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/4$</span> 的均匀转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi=(1,0)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=1\\mid x_1=1)=1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1^\\top(1,1)=3/4$</span>，二者不等；故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta(1)=Q_1^\\top$</span> 的祖先采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_1=1$</span> 时以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0=2$</span>，而真实后验以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0=2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1)=\\pi Q_1(1)=\\pi(1)\\cdot3/4+\\pi(2)\\cdot1/4=3/4$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0=1,x_1=1)=\\pi(1)\\cdot3/4=3/4$</span>；故后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1^\\top(1,1)=Q_1(1,1)=3/4\\neq1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此推论说明，反向核必须由后验（依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>）构造或学习，不能由前向矩阵转置直接得到。第 10 节将把这一观察推广为“转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效”的系统反例；本节只给出单步的显式对比，不重复第 10 节的完整构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-20-9-10-采样误差与训练目标的不可替代性\">20.9.10 采样误差与训练目标的不可替代性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-20-9-10-采样误差与训练目标的不可替代性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个恒等式，说明为何不能把“训练 KL 小”直接当作“采样误差小”的充分条件，从而为第 8 节与本节的分工划界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.9.14（KL 与逐点 TV 的不等价）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)(A3) 成立。存在参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t)}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_{\\theta_1}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\big]\n&lt;\n\\mathbb{E}_{q(x_t)}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_{\\theta_2}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\big],$$</div>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_1)&gt;\\delta_t(\\theta_2)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 为命题 20.9.4 的逐点最大 TV 误差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 时对两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>（即后验确定），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 时均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=1)=q(x_t=2)=1/2$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=1)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=2)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_2}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=1)=(1,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_2}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=2)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\mathrm{KL}((1,0)\\|(1/2,1/2))+\\mathrm{KL}((0,1)\\|(1/2,1/2)))=\\ln2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 在同点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 两者 KL 相同。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1$</span> 的期望 KL 大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 的期望 KL（差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\ln2$</span>）。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_1)=\\max\\{1/2,1/2\\}=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_2)=\\max\\{0,0\\}=0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_2}$</span> 精确等于后验的边缘化？此处需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 比较的是边缘后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 而非辅助后验）。修正构造：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t=1)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，则边缘后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t=1)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_1}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=1)=(1/2,1/2)$</span> 精确匹配，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_1)=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta_2}(\\cdot\\mid x_t=1)=(1,0)$</span> 不匹配，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_2)=1/2$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1$</span> 的期望 KL 更大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span> 更小——与命题陈述方向相反。将两参数角色互换即得所需方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 的期望 KL 小（因辅助后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 处为确定值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 精确匹配辅助后验故 KL 为零），但边缘后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 的边缘核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span> 与之 TV 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1$</span> 的边缘核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span> 精确匹配边缘后验，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_1)=0$</span>，但其辅助核不匹配辅助后验，KL 为正。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2$</span> 的期望 KL 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(\\theta_2)&gt;\\delta_t(\\theta_1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（分界的意义）</strong>：命题 20.9.14 说明，训练目标（对辅助后验的期望 KL）与采样误差（对边缘后验的逐点最大 TV）是两个不同的泛函，前者小不蕴含后者小。这正是第 8 节训练目标与本节采样分析必须分开陈述的原因；二者通过命题 20.9.6 的边缘化恒等式相联系，但联系需要额外的“采样核等于辅助核边缘化”条件（推论 20.9.7），该条件在参数化不当时不成立。第 10 节的反例将展示这一条件失效的具体机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-反例-转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效\">反例：转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-反例-转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb{N}_{\\ge 2}$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb{R}^{K\\times K}$</span> 为行随机矩阵（每行非负且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（乘积按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span> 的次序，作用在行向量上：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>）；后验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式在离散状态上定义。本节新增符号如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（后验可行性）</strong>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>，则称三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 是<strong>后验可行</strong>的；否则称<strong>后验不可行</strong>。对后验可行的三元组，后验分布定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal{X}}q(x_t\\mid y)\\,q(y\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>定义（逐点不可逆）</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 处<strong>逐点不可逆</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,i)=0$</span> 且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)&gt;0$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> <strong>全局不可逆</strong>，若对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 都存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,i)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（行随机与非负）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j Q_t(i,j)=1$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 行随机，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 为合法概率向量。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（后验分母正性）</strong>：对考虑的三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y}q(x_t\\mid y)q(y\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>。此假设是后验分布良定义的必要条件；本节将展示它在不可逆转移下如何失效。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（ELBO 的可积性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{E}_q[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))]&lt;\\infty$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 在离散分布上取通常定义，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\log(a/0)=+\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a&gt;0$</span>）。此假设在标准 D3PM 中由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的全支撑性保证；本节将说明当后验退化时该假设如何被破坏。</p>\n<p>本节的核心论点是：<strong>转移矩阵的不可逆性（具体表现为对角元为零）会使某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 三元组的后验分母为零，从而后验分布不存在；此时 ELBO 中的 KL 项无定义，训练目标失效。</strong> 这不是数值精度问题，而是概率模型的结构性缺陷。下面逐条拆解假设 A2 与 A3，并给出定量构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-反例构造-二状态全局不可逆转移\">反例构造：二状态全局不可逆转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-反例构造-二状态全局不可逆转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal{X}=\\{1,2\\}$</span>。定义单步转移矩阵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>它满足假设 A1（行随机、非负），且在两个状态上都逐点不可逆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(1,1)=0,Q(1,2)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(2,2)=0,Q(2,1)=1$</span>。这是<strong>确定性翻转</strong>算子，其作用是交换两个状态。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（累积转移的周期性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 如上。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t=Q^t=\\begin{cases}Q,&amp;t\\text{ 为奇数},\\\\ I,&amp;t\\text{ 为偶数}.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^2=I$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 是对合置换矩阵），再由归纳法得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^t=Q$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 奇）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 偶）。关键等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明累积转移是确定的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\delta_{x_t,\\,x_0\\oplus t}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\oplus$</span> 表示模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 加法（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\oplus 1=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\oplus 1=1$</span>）。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 被唯一确定，没有任何随机性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（后验分母为零）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 如上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数。<strong>结论</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span>，后验分母为零，三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1,t)$</span> 后验不可行。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\delta_{x_t,\\,x_0\\oplus 1}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。后验分母为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{y\\in\\{1,2\\}}q(x_t=1\\mid y)\\,q(y\\mid x_0=1)=q(1\\mid 1)q(1\\mid 1)+q(1\\mid 2)q(2\\mid 1).$$</div>\n<p>逐项计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(1\\mid 1)=Q(1,1)=0$</span>，故第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot 0=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(2\\mid 1)=Q(1,2)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(1\\mid 2)=Q(2,1)=1$</span>，第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\cdot 1=1$</span>。注意：这里需要小心：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y\\mid x_0=1)$</span> 是单步转移还是累积转移？后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y\\mid x_0)$</span> 是<strong>累积到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 步</strong>的转移，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_{t-1})$</span>，而非单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>。这正是反例的关键：不可逆性在<strong>单步</strong>上破坏对角元，而累积转移的奇偶性使后验分母在某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 组合上为零。</p>\n<p>按累积转移计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 为偶数，由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y\\mid x_0=1)=\\delta_{y,1}$</span>。于是后验分母为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{y}q(x_t=1\\mid y)\\,q(y\\mid x_0=1)=q(1\\mid 1)\\cdot 1+q(1\\mid 2)\\cdot 0=q(1\\mid 1)=Q(1,1)=0.$$</div>\n<p>因此分母为零，后验分布不存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2 的定量版本</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span>，后验分母恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(2\\mid 1)=1&gt;0$</span>，后验可行且退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=1\\mid x_t=2,x_0=1)=1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为偶数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=Q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y\\mid x_0=1)=\\delta_{y,2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 时分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(1\\mid 2)=1&gt;0$</span>，后验可行；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 时分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(2\\mid 2)=Q(2,2)=0$</span>，后验不可行。<strong>不可行的三元组恰好是那些要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 在奇偶性上“同号”的组合</strong>，其数量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的奇偶交替。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-拆解假设-A2-后验分母正性失效的机制\">拆解假设 A2：后验分母正性失效的机制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-拆解假设-A2-后验分母正性失效的机制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>假设 A2 要求分母严格为正。命题 2 表明，在全局不可逆转移下，A2 对某些三元组成立不了。失效的机制可以精确刻画如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（A2 失效的充要条件）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立。<strong>结论</strong>：三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 后验不可行当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in\\mathcal{X}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid y)\\,q(y\\mid x_0)=0$</span>。等价地，不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(y,x_t)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,y)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：后验分母是有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y q(x_t\\mid y)q(y\\mid x_0)$</span>，每项非负（A1 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 非负）。有限个非负数之和为零当且仅当每项为零。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid y)=Q_t(y,x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(y\\mid x_0)=\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,y)$</span>，故每项为零等价于不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 同时满足两个正性条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 把“后验失效”化归为<strong>支撑集不相交</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 列的正支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行的正支撑没有交集。在命题 2 的翻转例子中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 列仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=2$</span> 处为正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(2,1)=1$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 行仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=1$</span> 处为正，两者不相交，故分母为零。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（不可逆性的充分条件）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 全局不可逆（每个状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,i)=0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 处退化（即存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,y_0)=1$</span>），则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=y_0$</span> 时后验不可行，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(y_0,y_0)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 只支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_0$</span>，交集为空。翻转例子正是此推论的特例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span> 在每行退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 对角为零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-拆解假设-A3-ELBO-的-KL-项无定义\">拆解假设 A3：ELBO 的 KL 项无定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-拆解假设-A3-ELBO-的-KL-项无定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>标准 D3PM 的 ELBO 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb{E}_q\\left[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\right].$$</div>\n<p>当后验不可行时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 不存在，KL 项无定义。更严重的是，即使强行把不可行三元组从期望中剔除，ELBO 的<strong>变分下界性质</strong>也会失效，因为剔除相当于改变了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是生成轨迹的真实分布，不能任意截断。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（ELBO 在不可行三元组上的发散）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在全支撑上严格为正（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 的每个分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为翻转矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：若形式化地令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为任意在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2\\}$</span> 上的分布（例如均匀分布），则 KL 项为有限值，但该值与真实后验无关，ELBO 不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的下界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：真实后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,1,t)$</span> 上不存在，因为分母为零。若强行指定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,2\\}$</span>，则 KL 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\log\\frac{1/2}{p_\\theta(1\\mid 1)}+\\frac12\\log\\frac{1/2}{p_\\theta(2\\mid 1)}$</span>，有限。但 ELBO 的推导依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是真实后验：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge\\mathbb{E}_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)-\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)]$</span> 的证明中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span> 作为重要性分布，而此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\delta_{x_1,2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 的事件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下概率为零，却被强行赋了正概率，违反了测度一致性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点是：不可行三元组在真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下是<strong>零概率事件</strong>，把它们纳入 ELBO 的期望等于对零测集赋正权重，破坏了 ELBO 作为下界的测度论基础。正确做法是限制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑，但那样得到的就不是原模型的 ELBO。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\">正确表述需要补什么条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-正确表述需要补什么条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>要让后验在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 上良定义，必须补上<strong>全支撑条件</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 和每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(\\cdot,x_t)$</span> 的正支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,\\cdot)$</span> 的正支撑对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 都有交集。一个充分条件是<strong>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的所有元素严格为正</strong>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 也全正，任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的分母都为正。这正是均匀转移（本章第 2 节）满足的性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时全正。吸收转移（第 3 节）在吸收态上对角为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、非对角为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，对非吸收态则全正，需单独验证；高斯化转移（第 4 节）在截断高斯核下通常全正。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（全正转移保证后验可行）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span>，后验分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>，后验分布良定义，且 ELBO 的 KL 项有限（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 全正下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(y,x_t)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,y)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 是全正矩阵的乘积，仍全正）。故每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid y)q(y\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>，有限和为正。KL 项有限因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 都全正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 给出了边界：<strong>不可逆性本身不致命，致命的是不可逆性导致的支撑集不相交</strong>。翻转矩阵的不可逆性（对角为零）与累积转移的退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span>）联合作用，才使分母为零。若只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 不可逆但全正（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}0.1&amp;0.9\\\\0.9&amp;0.1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，对角非零但非对称），则后验仍可行。因此，本章第 10 节的标题“转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效”应精确理解为：<strong>在累积转移退化的配合下，逐点不可逆（对角为零）会使后验分母为零</strong>；单纯的不可逆（非对称）不构成反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值验证\">数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1、2、3、5，并打印预期结果。代码使用 NumPy，所有断言可运行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef cumulative(Q, t):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 bar Q_t = Q_1 Q_2 ... Q_t，行向量作用。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    K = Q.shape[0]\n    bar = np.eye(K)\n    for _ in range(t):\n        bar = bar @ Q\n    return bar\n\ndef posterior_denominator(Q, x0, xt, t):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;计算后验分母 sum_y q(xt|y) q(y|x0)，q(y|x0) 为累积到 t-1 步。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    bar_prev = cumulative(Q, t - 1)\n    # q(xt|y) = Q[y, xt]（单步，第 t 步）\n    # q(y|x0) = bar_prev[x0, y]\n    return sum(Q[y, xt] * bar_prev[x0, y] for y in range(Q.shape[0]))\n\n# 翻转矩阵\nQ_flip = np.array([[0.0, 1.0], [1.0, 0.0]])\nassert np.allclose(Q_flip @ Q_flip, np.eye(2)), &quot;Q^2 应为 I&quot;\nassert np.allclose(cumulative(Q_flip, 1), Q_flip)\nassert np.allclose(cumulative(Q_flip, 2), np.eye(2))\nassert np.allclose(cumulative(Q_flip, 3), Q_flip)\nprint(&quot;命题1: 累积转移周期性验证通过&quot;)\n\n# 命题2: t=1 奇数, x0=1, xt=1, 分母为零\nden = posterior_denominator(Q_flip, x0=0, xt=0, t=1)  # 0-indexed: 状态1-&gt;索引0\nassert den == 0.0, f&quot;分母应为0, 实际 {den}&quot;\nprint(f&quot;命题2: t=1, x0=1, xt=1 后验分母 = {den} (预期 0)&quot;)\n\n# t=1, x0=1, xt=2 分母为正\nden2 = posterior_denominator(Q_flip, x0=0, xt=1, t=1)\nassert den2 == 1.0\nprint(f&quot;命题2: t=1, x0=1, xt=2 后验分母 = {den2} (预期 1)&quot;)\n\n# 命题3: 支撑集不相交\nbar_prev = cumulative(Q_flip, 0)  # t-1=0, 即 I\nsupport_Q_col = {y for y in range(2) if Q_flip[y, 0] &gt; 0}  # xt=1 列的正支撑\nsupport_bar_row = {y for y in range(2) if bar_prev[0, y] &gt; 0}  # x0=1 行的正支撑\nassert support_Q_col == {1} and support_bar_row == {0}\nassert support_Q_col &amp; support_bar_row == set(), &quot;支撑集应不相交&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题3: 支撑集不相交验证通过&quot;)\n\n# 命题5: 全正转移保证后验可行\nQ_full = np.array([[0.1, 0.9], [0.9, 0.1]])\nfor t in range(1, 5):\n    for x0 in range(2):\n        for xt in range(2):\n            den = posterior_denominator(Q_full, x0, xt, t)\n            assert den &gt; 0, f&quot;全正转移下分母应为正, t={t}, x0={x0}, xt={xt}, den={den}&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题5: 全正转移下所有后验分母为正，验证通过&quot;)\nprint(&quot;形状检查: Q_flip.shape =&quot;, Q_flip.shape, &quot;预期 (2, 2)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：命题 1 至 5 的断言全部通过，最后打印 <code>Q_flip.shape = (2, 2)</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-反例的推广-多状态置换与部分不可逆\">反例的推广：多状态置换与部分不可逆<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-反例的推广-多状态置换与部分不可逆\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 至 5 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的翻转矩阵上完成了反例的最小构造。本节将反例推广到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，并区分“全局不可逆”与“部分不可逆”两种情形，说明后验失效的范围如何随不可逆性的结构变化。这一推广不是重复，而是把命题 3 的支撑集判据放到更大的状态空间上检验，从而给出失效三元组的计数与定量估计。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（置换矩阵的累积退化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 置换矩阵（每行每列恰有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的循环分解中有一个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\ge 2$</span> 的循环。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q^t$</span> 仍为置换矩阵；对属于该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>-循环的状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\equiv 0\\pmod L$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(x_0,x_0)=1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\not\\equiv 0\\pmod L$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(x_0,x_0)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：置换矩阵的乘积仍为置换矩阵，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 每行每列恰有一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 所在循环为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1,\\dots,x_{L-1})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x_i,x_{i+1})=1$</span>（下标模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^t(x_0,x_{t\\bmod L})=1$</span>，其余为零。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span> 即得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 把命题 1 的奇偶性推广为循环长度。翻转矩阵是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=2$</span> 的特例。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L\\ge 3$</span> 的循环，后验失效不再逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 交替，而是每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 步在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0$</span> 处出现一次。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（置换反例的后验失效计数）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为单一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>-循环置换（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=K$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 后验不可行，即所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0\\oplus(t\\bmod K)$</span> 的对；其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K(K-1)$</span> 个三元组后验可行。失效三元组占全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^2$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 对的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0\\oplus((t-1)\\bmod K)$</span> 处的单点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 列正支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{y: Q(y,x_t)=1\\}=\\{x_t\\ominus 1\\}$</span>（唯一前驱）。交集非空当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ominus 1=x_0\\oplus((t-1)\\bmod K)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=x_0\\oplus(t\\bmod K)$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个状态给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个失效对。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 给出定量估计：失效比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span> 随状态数增大而减小，但<strong>不为零</strong>，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，纯置换转移都存在后验不可行的三元组。这排除了“状态足够多就自动安全”的误解：失效是结构性的，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 无关地存在，只是比例变化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（部分不可逆不导致失效）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 处逐点不可逆（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(1,1)=0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne 1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(1,j)&gt;0$</span>），但在其余状态上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(i,i)&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 全正（除对角外所有元素严格为正）。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span>，后验分母严格为正，后验分布良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 除对角外全正，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(\\cdot,x_t)$</span> 的正支撑至少包含除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 外的所有状态（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne 1$</span>，还包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 自身因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(x_t,x_t)&gt;0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 作为全正矩阵（除对角外）的乘积，其每行正支撑为全体状态（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1\\ge 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 至少含单位阵的支撑，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的非对角正性使乘积扩散到全支撑）。故交集非空，分母为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 精确界定了反例的边界：<strong>逐点不可逆（对角为零）必须与累积转移的退化（支撑集收缩为单点）联合，才使分母为零</strong>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的非对角全正，则即使对角为零，累积转移也不会退化到单点，后验仍可行。这与命题 5 的全正条件形成对照：全正（含对角）是充分条件，非对角全正（对角可零）也是充分条件；真正的反例需要<strong>对角为零且非对角稀疏</strong>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的列支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行支撑可以不相交。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-反例对-ELBO-梯度的影响\">反例对 ELBO 梯度的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-反例对-ELBO-梯度的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 说明了 ELBO 在不可行三元组上的测度不一致。本节进一步指出，即使训练时用掩码跳过不可行三元组，梯度也会因掩码而偏离真实 ELBO 的梯度。这不是“目标值相等”的问题，而是“梯度不等”的问题，须与禁止事项 4 的纪律一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（掩码梯度的偏差）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为翻转矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 全正且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与期望可交换（由 Dominated Convergence 保证，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度在紧参数集上一致有界）。<strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 为真实 ELBO（在可行三元组上定义），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 为对不可行三元组置零的掩码 ELBO，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\tilde{\\mathcal L}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L$</span> 在一般参数点上成立；偏差等于被掩码三元组的 KL 梯度之和。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\sum_{(x_0,x_t,t)\\text{ 可行}}\\mathbb{E}_{q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal L}$</span> 在不可行三元组上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。两者之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{\\text{不可行}}\\mathbb{E}_q[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}]$</span>，其梯度一般非零（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 全正，KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度在不可行三元组的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上仍有定义）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\tilde{\\mathcal L}=\\nabla\\mathcal L-\\nabla(\\text{不可行项})$</span>，偏差非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的要点：掩码不是“去掉无定义项”的中性操作，它改变了目标函数的梯度场。正确做法是<strong>修改模型使后验处处可行</strong>（如命题 5 的全正转移），而非在训练时打补丁。这与本章第 8 节训练目标的推导一致：ELBO 的每一项都对应一个可计算的 KL，前提是后验存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-与连续扩散的边界对照\">与连续扩散的边界对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与连续扩散的边界对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的反例在离散状态上构造，但其机制在连续扩散中有对应物，须明确区分以免混淆（禁止事项 4 要求不得把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈，此处同理）。</p>\n<p>在连续扩散中，前向过程由 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dX_t=f(X_t,t)\\,dt+g(t)\\,dW_t$</span> 给出，其转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 时对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 全支撑（高斯核），故后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 处处良定义。离散反例的对应条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)=0$</span>（确定性漂移），此时转移核退化为 Dirac 测度，后验在支撑不相交处无定义。因此，<strong>离散 D3PM 的不可逆反例对应于连续扩散的零噪声极限</strong>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t)&gt;0$</span> 的连续设定中，不存在本节意义下的后验失效。这一对照说明：D3PM 的后验可行性依赖于转移矩阵的全支撑性，而连续扩散的高斯核天然满足此条件；两者的边界在噪声强度趋于零时重合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（零噪声极限下的后验退化）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：连续扩散的转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\,m_t(x_0),\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 良定义；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0$</span> 时，后验退化为 Dirac 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_{t-1}^\\star}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}^\\star$</span> 由确定性漂移的逆映射给出；若逆映射不存在（漂移不可逆），则后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=0$</span> 处无定义，与离散反例同构。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：高斯核全支撑，故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})p(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,dx_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_{t-1}^\\star}$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 可逆），后验随之退化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_t$</span> 不可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可能无原像，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 测度支撑为空，后验无定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 把本节的反例嵌入连续扩散的框架：离散翻转矩阵是“零噪声 + 不可逆漂移”的极端情形，其失效机制与连续零噪声极限一致。这为本章第 12 节“与连续扩散的对照”提供了接口，但本节只做边界陈述，不展开连续推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-构造性修复-加性平滑\">构造性修复：加性平滑<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-构造性修复-加性平滑\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 给出了充分条件（全正转移），但全正转移会改变模型的可表示性（如均匀转移丢失了吸收态的结构）。一个折中方案是<strong>加性平滑</strong>：在不可逆转移上叠加一个小的全正扰动，使后验处处可行，同时保留原转移的主要结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（平滑后的后验可行性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：A1 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 为翻转矩阵，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon=(1-\\epsilon)Q+\\epsilon U$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 为均匀矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U(i,j)=1/K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon$</span> 全正，故由命题 5，所有后验可行；且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon\\to Q$</span> 逐元素，后验在可行三元组上收敛到原后验，在不可行三元组上分母趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon(i,j)=(1-\\epsilon)Q(i,j)+\\epsilon/K&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon/K&gt;0$</span>）。全正性由命题 5 给出后验可行。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\to 0$</span> 时逐元素收敛显然；对可行三元组，分母连续依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon$</span> 且极限为正，故后验收敛；对不可行三元组，原分母为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^\\epsilon$</span> 的分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span>，趋于零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 说明：反例不是“不可修复”的，加性平滑以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 的代价恢复后验可行性。但平滑改变了转移核的支撑，训练时须重新推导 ELBO（本章第 7 节），不能直接套用原公式。这再次印证本节的核心论点：<strong>后验可行性由转移矩阵的支撑结构决定，而非由矩阵是否可逆决定</strong>；修复必须触及支撑结构，而非仅调整数值。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逐点不可逆（对角为零）的转移矩阵在累积转移退化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=I$</span>）的配合下，会使某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 的后验分母为零，后验分布不存在；翻转矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为奇数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=x_t$</span> 时的精确反例。</li>\n<li>后验失效的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 列正支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行正支撑不相交（命题 3）；此时 ELBO 的 KL 项无定义，强行赋值会破坏变分下界的测度一致性（命题 4）。</li>\n<li>正确表述需补全支撑条件：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 全正（如均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>）即可保证所有后验可行且 KL 有限（命题 5）；不可逆性本身不致命，致命的是不可逆性与累积退化的联合作用。</li>\n<li>后验失效的充要条件是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 列正支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行正支撑不相交（命题 3）；此时 ELBO 的 KL 项无定义，强行赋值会破坏变分下界的测度一致性（命题 4），掩码训练则使梯度偏离真实 ELBO（命题 9）。</li>\n<li>正确表述需补全支撑条件：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 全正（如均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>）即可保证所有后验可行且 KL 有限（命题 5）；不可逆性本身不致命，致命的是不可逆性与累积退化的联合作用；置换反例的失效比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/K$</span>（命题 7），加性平滑以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 代价恢复可行性（命题 11）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-与-masked-扩散的关系\">与 masked 扩散的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与-masked-扩散的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_1,\\dots,x_T$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>；转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t)_{ij}=q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>，每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且元素非负；累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（乘积按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span> 的顺序，行向量约定下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>）；前向联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由第 6 节给出；ELBO 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^T D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n本节额外引入的符号如下，均在此处定义，后续不再重复。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 A（吸收态与吸收转移）</strong>：固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 为吸收态（mask 记号）。吸收转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 定义为：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{im}=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}=1-\\beta_t$</span>，其余元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{mm}=1$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 B（masked 扩散的联合分布）</strong>：给定吸收转移族与初始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，masked 扩散指满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 行随机核的马尔可夫链，其联合分布与前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 C（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>-增广边缘）</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{\\mathrm{aug}}(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率向量，其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(m)}(x_0):=q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)$</span>，其余分量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(\\ne m)}(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 H1（有限状态与行随机）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 非负且行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。本节所有矩阵运算均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 内进行，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 H2（吸收参数非退化）</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减。此假设保证吸收链在有限步内以正概率进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，从而后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 时退化但可定义。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 H3（条件期望可积）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上任意，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，所有条件期望均为有限和，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 的条件自动满足；本节凡涉及期望交换处，均引用有限和版本的 Fubini 定理。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 H4（参数化后验可计算）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta$</span> 可微。本节只做恒等变形，不涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导与积分交换，故无需额外正则性。</p>\n<p>下面给出四个命题，依次完成：核心定义与相邻概念的区别、主定理、可检验推论、具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-1-吸收转移是-masked-扩散的精确核-且与均匀转移在结构上不同\">命题 1（吸收转移是 masked 扩散的精确核，且与均匀转移在结构上不同）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-1-吸收转移是-masked-扩散的精确核-且与均匀转移在结构上不同\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：masked 扩散的前向核恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，其累积矩阵具有显式形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=I+\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)-1\\Big)\\,e_m e_m^\\top+\\Big(1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)\\Big)\\,\\mathbf 1 e_m^\\top,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个标准基向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1=(1,\\dots,1)^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 单位阵。该形式与第 2 节二状态均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时不同：均匀转移的平稳分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>，而吸收转移的极限分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_m$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证累积形式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_1^{\\mathrm{abs}}=Q_1^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>。直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 元素：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 时对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,m)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(m,m)=1$</span>。右端在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I+((1-\\beta_1)-1)e_me_m^\\top+(1-(1-\\beta_1))\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top=I-\\beta_1 e_me_m^\\top+\\beta_1\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span>。逐元素核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m,j=m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_1+\\beta_1=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m,j\\ne m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 时成立，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\n=\\Big[I+(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top+(1-c_{t-1})\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top\\Big]Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m^\\top Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=e_m^\\top$</span>（吸收行不变）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1^\\top Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span>（行随机），逐项乘开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}+(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top+(1-c_{t-1})\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top.$$</div>\n再将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=I-\\beta_t e_me_m^\\top+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top-\\beta_t\\sum_{i\\ne m}e_ie_i^\\top+\\beta_t\\sum_{i\\ne m}e_ie_m^\\top$</span> 代入并合并同类项。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne m}e_ie_i^\\top=I-e_me_m^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i\\ne m}e_ie_m^\\top=\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top-e_me_m^\\top$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=I-\\beta_t(I-e_me_m^\\top)+\\beta_t(\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top-e_me_m^\\top)\n=I-\\beta_t I+\\beta_t e_me_m^\\top+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top-\\beta_t e_me_m^\\top\n=(1-\\beta_t)I+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top.$$</div>\n代回得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=(1-\\beta_t)I+\\beta_t\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top+(1-c_{t-1})\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top.$$</div>\n合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span> 系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t+1-c_{t-1}=1-c_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)=1-c_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_me_m^\\top$</span> 系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}-1$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=(1-\\beta_t)I+(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top+(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top.$$</div>\n再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I=I-\\beta_t I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}-1$</span> 的关系：注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)+(c_{t-1}-1)=c_{t-1}-\\beta_t=c_t-1$</span> 不直接匹配，需将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_me_m^\\top+(I-e_me_m^\\top)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 的行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I$</span> 给出对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，而目标形式要求对角 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>；差额为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)-c_t=(1-\\beta_t)(1-c_{t-1})$</span>，恰由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 列贡献，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span> 列无贡献，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j\\ne m$</span> 处需为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i$</span>。检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j\\ne i$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，正确。<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，但目标应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>，矛盾。故需逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I$</span> 的对角在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 处应被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span> 修正吗？该矩阵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=i\\ne m$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 处值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，而目标形式中该位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+(1-c_t)\\cdot 0=c_t$</span>。二者不等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}=1$</span>。这说明上述合并有误：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 元素应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的该元素应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 吗。事实并非如此：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 元素是“从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 出发经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步仍停在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>”的概率，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)=c_t$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的该元素是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，乘上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,i$</span> 元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>。上面的矩阵乘法中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,i$</span> 元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ik}(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ki}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}=c_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{im}=1-c_{t-1}$</span>，其余为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{mi}=0$</span>。故和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)=c_t$</span>。而按右端形式计算该元素：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_{t-1}-1)e_me_m^\\top$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span>，不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>。因此右端形式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 处不匹配，说明显式形式应写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=c_t\\,(I-e_me_m^\\top)+(1-c_t)\\,\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+e_me_m^\\top.$$</div>\n验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m,j=m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=m,j\\ne m$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。正确。此形式与命题陈述中的形式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m,j=i$</span> 处相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)-c_t$</span>，故陈述应修正为该形式。由于本节要求公式自洽，以下以精确形式为准，并记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=c_t\\,(I-e_me_m^\\top)+(1-c_t)\\,\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+e_me_m^\\top,\\qquad c_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s).$$</div>\n再证与均匀转移的区别。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，其累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}c_t&amp;1-c_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_2$</span>。而第 2 节均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 的双随机性使其平稳分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-2\\beta_s)$</span>，不收敛到点质量（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 使该乘积趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 且初值特殊）。故二者结构不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 1 的陈述中显式形式以修正后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(I-e_me_m^\\top)+(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+e_me_m^\\top$</span> 为准；这与第 3 节吸收转移的定义一致，且是本节后续推导的唯一依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-2-masked-扩散的后验是-D3PM-后验在吸收核下的特例\">命题 2（masked 扩散的后验是 D3PM 后验在吸收核下的特例）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-2-masked-扩散的后验是-D3PM-后验在吸收核下的特例\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2、H3。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：在吸收核下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 具有如下分段形式。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_t$</span> 几乎必然（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\delta_{x_t}$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t=m,x_0)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{(1-\\beta_t)\\,q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)}, &amp; j\\ne m,\\\\[1ex]\n\\dfrac{\\beta_t\\,q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)}, &amp; j=m,\n\\end{cases}$$</div>\n其中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)=1-c_t$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=m$</span>），由命题 1 的累积形式给出。该后验与第 6 节一般后验公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\propto q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 完全一致，是其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 时的显式求值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}=j)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n分子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}=j)=(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{j,x_t}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{j,x_t}=1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_t$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（因为非吸收行只以正概率跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 或留在原地，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 只能由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_t$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 到达，但此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{x_t,x_t}=1-\\beta_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故需仔细）。实际上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{j,x_t}=1-\\beta_t$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne j$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{m,x_t}=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span>。因此分子仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_t$</span> 时非零，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=x_t\\mid x_0)(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，归一化后得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_t}$</span>。严格说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\ne m\\mid x_0)$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=x_t\\mid x_0)(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 求和，故条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_t$</span> 处。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{j,m}=\\beta_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{m,m}=1$</span>。代入即得分段公式。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)$</span> 由命题 1 的累积形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_m=1-c_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=m$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.1（ELBO 的 masked 分解）</strong>：在吸收核下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=m\\}}\\sum_{j=1}^K q(j\\mid m,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(j\\mid m,x_0)}{p_\\theta(j\\mid m)}\\Big],$$</div>\n因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 时后验为点质量，KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)=1$</span> 时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（否则）。此恒等式将 masked 扩散的训练目标化为“仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 处计算交叉熵”的形式，与第 7 节 ELBO 的一般表达式一致，但显式暴露了吸收核导致的稀疏性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\delta_{x_t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\delta_{x_t}\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t))=-\\log p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)=1$</span> 则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，否则为正。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span>，KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j\\mid m,x_0)\\log(q(j\\mid m,x_0)/p_\\theta(j\\mid m))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-3-均匀转移不能表示为吸收核的混合-除非退化\">命题 3（均匀转移不能表示为吸收核的混合，除非退化）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-3-均匀转移不能表示为吸收核的混合-除非退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：不存在概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(m,\\beta_t)\\}_{m\\in\\mathcal X}$</span> 上使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\int Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(m,\\beta_t)\\,\\mu(dm)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为第 2 节二状态均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 的情形。等价地，均匀转移的非对角元在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，而任何吸收核混合的非对角元至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 且仅在吸收行出现，故无法匹配均匀转移的两行对称非零非对角元。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时，吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(1,\\beta_t)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(2,\\beta_t)=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。混合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\mu_1\\delta_1+\\mu_2\\delta_2$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}\\mu_1+\\mu_2(1-\\beta_t)&amp;\\mu_2\\beta_t\\\\ \\mu_1\\beta_t&amp;\\mu_2(1-\\beta_t)+\\mu_1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>。要等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mu_2=1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1+\\mu_2=1$</span> 矛盾（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）。故不存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题说明 masked 扩散与均匀 D3PM 是转移核族中两个不可互相归约的成员；第 4 节高斯化转移亦然。三者的可表示性差异正是第 10 节反例节讨论“不可逆导致后验失效”的出发点，但本节不展开该反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-4-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的累积与后验数值验证\">命题 4（具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的累积与后验数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-4-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的累积与后验数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2、H3；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,3\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：按命题 1 的精确形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=0.4$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_2^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的显式矩阵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_2^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n0.4&amp;0&amp;0.6\\\\\n0&amp;0.4&amp;0.6\\\\\n0&amp;0&amp;1\n\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=3\\mid x_0=1)=0.6$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_2=3,x_0=1)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.4\\cdot 0.8/0.6,\\ 0,\\ 0.2\\cdot 0.8/0.6)=(0.5333,0,0.2667)$</span> 加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2\\cdot 0.8/0.6$</span> 的修正需按命题 2 计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_0=1)=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=3\\mid x_0=1)=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=3\\mid x_1=1)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=3\\mid x_1=3)=1$</span>，故分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.8\\cdot 0.5,\\ 0,\\ 0.2\\cdot 1)=(0.4,0,0.2)$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2/3,0,1/3)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=1-0.2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=0.8\\cdot 0.5=0.4$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_2^{\\mathrm{abs}}=c_2(I-e_3e_3^\\top)+(1-c_2)\\mathbf 1e_3^\\top+e_3e_3^\\top$</span> 得上述矩阵。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2=3\\mid x_0=1)=(1,0,0)\\bar Q_2^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 分量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6$</span>。后验按命题 2 的分段公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=3=m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j\\mid m,x_0)=(1-\\beta_2)q(x_1=j\\mid x_0)/q(x_2=m\\mid x_0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_0=1)=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=2\\mid x_0=1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=3\\mid x_0=1)=0.2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5\\cdot 0.8/0.6=2/3$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=3$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2\\cdot 0.2/0.6=0.5\\cdot 0.2/0.6=1/6$</span>？但命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 的分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=3\\mid x_0=1)=0.2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1/0.6=1/6$</span>。而上面按转移概率直接算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2/0.6=1/3$</span>。差异源于命题 2 的公式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 的分子应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)\\cdot (Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{m,m}=0.2\\cdot 1=0.2$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)$</span>。命题 2 的陈述中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 分支写错了：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{m,m}=1$</span>，故分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)$</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)$</span>。修正后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=3$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2/0.6=1/3$</span>。归一化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3+1/3=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 分支应修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)/q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)$</span>。本节后续以精确形式为准。该例子同时验证了命题 1 的累积矩阵与命题 2 的后验公式在数值上自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-与相邻概念的区别\">与相邻概念的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与相邻概念的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>masked 扩散与第 2 节均匀转移、第 4 节高斯化转移同属 D3PM 转移核族，但三者在以下三点上不同：(i) 吸收核的极限分布为点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_m$</span>，均匀核的极限为均匀分布，高斯化核的极限为离散高斯；(ii) 吸收核的后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 时退化为点质量，使 ELBO 的 KL 项稀疏化（推论 2.1），而均匀核的后验在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上均为非退化分布；(iii) 吸收核不可表示为均匀核的混合（命题 3），故 masked 扩散不是均匀 D3PM 的特例，而是与之平行的构造。第 15 节“与 masked 章的接口”将把本节的后验分段公式作为接口条件使用，本节不重复该接口的陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-5-masked-扩散的-ELBO-与去噪得分参数化的等价改写\">命题 5（masked 扩散的 ELBO 与去噪得分参数化的等价改写）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-5-masked-扩散的-ELBO-与去噪得分参数化的等价改写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2、H3、H4；吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 与命题 1 的累积形式；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(m)}(x_0):=q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)=1-c_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span>）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=m$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：在吸收核下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 可等价改写为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的“单步交叉熵”之和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^T \\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=m\\}}\\Big(-\\sum_{j=1}^K q(j\\mid m,x_0)\\log p_\\theta(j\\mid m)\\Big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 采样。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid m)$</span> 取“预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 再经吸收核回推”的参数化\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(j\\mid m)=\\sum_{x_0'\\in\\mathcal X}\\hat p_\\theta(x_0'=j\\mid x_t=m)\\,q(j\\mid m,x_0'),$$</div>\n则 KL 项等于以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_\\theta$</span> 为预测器的加权交叉熵，权重为后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j\\mid m,x_0)$</span>。此改写与第 7 节 ELBO 的一般表达式在数值上相等，但把求和从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步的联合期望压缩为逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件期望。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 2.1，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)=1$</span> 的约定），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j\\mid m,x_0)\\log(q(j\\mid m,x_0)/p_\\theta(j\\mid m))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 取期望时，利用马尔可夫性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_t q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 Fubini（有限和，假设 H3），可将对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span> 的求和逐项化为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=m\\}}f(x_{t-1},x_0)\\big]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{x_t}q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=m\\}}\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}[f]\\Big].$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 处，内层期望即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j\\mid m,x_0)f(j,x_0)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log(q/p_\\theta)$</span> 得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的参数化直接代入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j\\mid m,x_0)\\log(q(j\\mid m,x_0)/p_\\theta(j\\mid m))$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(j\\mid m)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_\\theta$</span> 的混合替代，展开即得加权交叉熵形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题说明 masked 扩散的训练目标在数学上不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的联合结构，只依赖每个时间步的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>；这与第 8 节训练目标的一般 D3PM 形式一致，但吸收核使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 具有命题 1 的闭式，从而可直接采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 而不必展开整条链。第 13 节代码将利用这一性质做逐时间步采样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-6-masked-扩散与连续扩散的极限对照-吸收核的-时间重标定\">命题 6（masked 扩散与连续扩散的极限对照：吸收核的“时间重标定”）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-6-masked-扩散与连续扩散的极限对照-吸收核的-时间重标定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>；令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t/T)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,1]\\to[0,1]$</span> 连续、单调不减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(0)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(1)=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta(s/T))$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to\\exp(-\\int_0^{t/T}\\beta(u)\\,du)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t/T\\to\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span> 的尺度下一致收敛；即吸收核的“存活概率”<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 是连续时间吸收过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$dN_t=-\\beta(\\tau)N_t\\,d\\tau$</span> 的解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=t/T$</span> 处的值。由此，masked 扩散的离散链在时间重标定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=t/T$</span> 下弱收敛于一个“仅含吸收态与非吸收态”的两状态连续时间马尔可夫链，其生成元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\beta(\\tau)&amp;\\beta(\\tau)\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,m\\}$</span> 两状态上）。这与第 12 节连续扩散的生成元（含扩散系数与漂移）在结构上不同：masked 扩散的连续极限没有扩散项，只有向吸收态的“漂移”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log c_t=\\sum_{s=1}^t\\log(1-\\beta(s/T))$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta(s/T))=-\\beta(s/T)+O(\\beta(s/T)^2)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta(s/T)\\cdot(1/T)\\to\\int_0^{t/T}\\beta(u)\\,du$</span>（Riemann 和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续故一致收敛）。余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_s O(\\beta(s/T)^2)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\cdot\\max\\beta^2/T^2=O(1/T)$</span> 控制，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log c_t\\to-\\int_0^{t/T}\\beta(u)\\,du$</span>。指数化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to\\exp(-\\int_0^{t/T}\\beta)$</span>。生成元由两状态链的转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，其连续时间极限的生成元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}-I)/\\Delta t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span> 下的极限，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题只做结构对照，不声称弱收敛的完整证明（完整构造属第 12 节）；本节用它说明 masked 扩散的“连续极限”是纯吸收的，因而其得分函数在吸收态处退化，不能直接套用连续扩散的得分匹配框架。第 15 节接口将据此说明 masked 章与连续扩散章的符号不可直接互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-7-吸收核的不可逆性与后验失效的边界条件\">命题 7（吸收核的不可逆性与后验失效的边界条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-7-吸收核的不可逆性与后验失效的边界条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上任意但固定。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的马尔可夫算子不可逆（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q)$</span> 意义下），因为其吸收行 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m^\\top$</span> 的像为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_m$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_m$</span> 在非吸收行下的原像非唯一。具体地，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'\\in\\mathcal X$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne x_0'$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)=q(x_t=m\\mid x_0')$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'$</span> 均非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(m)}=1-c_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关），故从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 无法反推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t=m)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 上非退化但不可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 单独识别。此即第 10 节反例节“转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效”的边界条件：后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 仍可定义（因条件中含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 不可由前向核单独恢复。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：不可逆性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 可逆，则其行列式非零。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 行除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(m,m)=1$</span> 外全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne m$</span> 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 行在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\ne i,m$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；按第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列展开行列式，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=1\\cdot\\det(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{[K]\\setminus\\{m\\},[K]\\setminus\\{m\\}}$</span>。子矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)I_{K-1}$</span>，行列式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)^{K-1}&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 作为矩阵可逆。但作为马尔可夫算子，其伴随（在均匀测度下）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})^\\top$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})^\\top$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 的倍数（因每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})^\\top$</span> 的像含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 方向，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的像不含该方向（吸收行像为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_m$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 与其伴随不满足细致平衡，不可逆。后验失效：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)=1-c_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t=m)\\propto q(x_0)(1-c_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span> 上正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，不可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 单独识别。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题与第 10 节反例节的分工是：第 10 节给出“不可逆导致后验失效”的完整反例构造；本节只给出边界条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 时矩阵可逆但算子不可逆；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t^{(m)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关），不重复反例的展开。命题 2 的后验之所以仍可定义，是因为条件中保留了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，则后验在非吸收初值上退化为先验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-8-masked-扩散与均匀-D3PM-的-ELBO-差异恒等式\">命题 8（masked 扩散与均匀 D3PM 的 ELBO 差异恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-8-masked-扩散与均匀-D3PM-的-ELBO-差异恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2、H3；<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>；均匀核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{unif}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 与吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$</span> 共享同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=(q_0,1-q_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：两种核的 ELBO 第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项之差可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_t:=\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{unif}}-\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}\n=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=1\\}}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q^{\\mathrm{unif}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]\n+\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\mathbf 1_{\\{x_t=2\\}}\\big(D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{unif}}-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{abs}}\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\mathrm{unif}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为均匀核的后验（非退化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 为命题 2 的吸收核后验 KL。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 时吸收核后验为点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 在该分支为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(1\\mid 1)=1$</span>），而均匀核在该分支有非零 KL；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 时两者均有非零 KL，但均匀核的后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)q(x_{t-1}=1\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t q(x_{t-1}=2\\mid x_0)$</span> 的混合，吸收核的后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)q(x_{t-1}=1\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=2\\mid x_0)$</span> 的混合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 分支系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>），故两者不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 2.1 与均匀核的一般后验公式（第 6 节），逐分支相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 时吸收核后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_1$</span>（命题 2），均匀核后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=1\\mid x_0)(1-\\beta_t)/q(x_t=1\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=2\\mid x_0)\\beta_t/q(x_t=1\\mid x_0)$</span> 的混合；两者 KL 之差即第一项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 时两后验的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2$</span> 分支系数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，代入 KL 定义相减即得第二项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此恒等式说明两种核的 ELBO 不可互相替代：均匀核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=1$</span> 分支有非零 KL，吸收核在该分支为零；吸收核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span> 分支的后验把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 分量权重从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故其 KL 更大（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 时）。这正是第 10 节反例节讨论“不同转移核的 ELBO 不可比”的定量依据，本节只给出恒等式，不展开反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-9-masked-扩散的采样-吸收态的-冻结-性质\">命题 9（masked 扩散的采样：吸收态的“冻结”性质）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-9-masked-扩散的采样-吸收态的-冻结-性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2；吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>；反向参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(m\\mid m)=1$</span>（吸收态在反向也冻结）。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：在反向采样中，一旦某坐标进入吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，它在所有更早的时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'&lt;t$</span> 上保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t'}=m\\mid x_t=m)=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'&lt;t$</span> 成立（在参数化满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(m\\mid m)=1$</span> 且逐层复合下）。因此 masked 扩散的采样轨迹是“单调填 mask”的：每个坐标至多从非吸收态跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 一次，不会从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 跳回非吸收态。这与均匀核的采样（可在两状态间反复跳转）在轨迹结构上不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由反向链的马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t'}=m\\mid x_t=m)=\\sum_{x_{t'-1}}p_\\theta(x_{t'-1}\\mid x_t=m)\\cdots$</span>，逐层应用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(m\\mid m)=1$</span> 得每层条件概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。严格说，需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'=t-1$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(m\\mid m)=1$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t'-1$</span> 用同样条件，归纳得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此命题是第 9 节采样在吸收核下的特化；它说明 masked 扩散的采样不需要“重新加噪”，只需按时间逆序逐坐标填 mask。第 15 节接口将把这一性质作为 masked 章采样算法的接口条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-10-吸收核的累积矩阵与-掩码比例-的恒等关系\">命题 10（吸收核的累积矩阵与“掩码比例”的恒等关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-10-吸收核的累积矩阵与-掩码比例-的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：H1、H2；吸收核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>陈述</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，前向边缘满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=m\\mid x_0)=1-c_t,\\qquad q(x_t=x_0\\mid x_0)=c_t,\\qquad q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)=0\\quad(j\\ne m,\\ j\\ne x_0).$$</div>\n即吸收核下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，且取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>。此恒等式把“掩码比例”<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span> 与前向边缘直接联系起来，是命题 1 累积形式的逐元素推论。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 的累积形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=c_t(I-e_me_m^\\top)+(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+e_me_m^\\top$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\ne m$</span> 取第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 行：<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=x_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>（来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(I-e_me_m^\\top)$</span> 的对角），<span class=\"math-inline\">$j=m$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span>（来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top$</span>），其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：此恒等式是命题 1 的直接推论，单独列出是因为它是第 13 节代码中“按掩码比例采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>”的依据：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，只需以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，无需展开整条链。它与第 2 节均匀核的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\ne x_0\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span>（可在非吸收态间跳转）形成对照。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>吸收转移的累积矩阵具有显式形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=c_t(I-e_me_m^\\top)+(1-c_t)\\mathbf 1e_m^\\top+e_me_m^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>；它与均匀转移在极限分布与后验结构上均不同，且不能由均匀核混合表示。</li>\n<li>吸收核下的后验是 D3PM 一般后验的特例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 时为点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=m\\mid x_0)$</span> 的归一化混合；由此 ELBO 的 KL 项仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=m$</span> 处非零，给出 masked 扩散的稀疏训练目标。</li>\n<li>本节所有命题均在有限状态与行随机假设下证明，未引入额外正则性；命题 1 与命题 2 的显式形式已按推导修正，数值例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>）逐项验证了累积矩阵与后验公式的一致性。</li>\n<li>吸收核的 ELBO 可改写为仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的逐时间步交叉熵（命题 5），其稀疏性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\ne m$</span> 时后验退化为点质量；参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid m)$</span> 经“预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 再回推”后等价于加权交叉熵。</li>\n<li>吸收核的连续极限是纯吸收的两状态链（命题 6），生成元无扩散项；其算子不可逆（命题 7），导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t=m)$</span> 在非吸收初值上退化为先验，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 仍可定义，这是第 10 节反例节的边界条件。</li>\n<li>吸收核与均匀核的 ELBO 差异有显式恒等式（命题 8），采样轨迹单调填 mask（命题 9），前向边缘只取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 且掩码比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t$</span>（命题 10）；这些性质共同构成第 15 节“与 masked 章的接口”所需的全部数学条件。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-与连续扩散的对照\">与连续扩散的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与连续扩散的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 为行随机矩阵（每行非负、行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>；累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（乘积按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span> 的顺序，作用在行向量上），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由第 6 节给出，其存在性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的相应元素非零；ELBO 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T} D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有以下三个，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>连续扩散对照对象</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal Y=\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y_s)_{s\\in[0,1]}$</span> 由 Itô 随机微分方程\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm dY_s=f(Y_s,s)\\,\\mathrm ds+g(s)\\,\\mathrm dW_s,\\qquad Y_0\\sim p_0,$$</div>\n  给出，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\times[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g:[0,1]\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 满足：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 关于空间变量全局 Lipschitz、关于时间局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{s\\in[0,1]}g(s)&gt;0$</span>。记转移密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s(y\\mid y_0)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_0=y_0$</span> 下的条件密度（关于 Lebesgue 测度），并记时间离散化步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/T$</span>，离散时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=t\\Delta$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>得分函数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{s_t}(y_t)$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Euclidean 梯度，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t$</span> 各坐标分量求偏导组成的向量；本节只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{s_t}(\\cdot)$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且处处正的假设下使用它。</li>\n<li><strong>Gaussian 化转移的连续极限参数</strong>：对第 4 节的高斯化转移，记其单步参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span>（该量与第 4 节的定义一致，此处仅作引用性重述，不引入新构造）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设逐条列明，并在对应命题中显式引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)（矩阵正则性）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且不可约；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的所有元素严格为正。此假设在第 2、3、4 节的具体构造下均成立（均匀与吸收转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 时显然；高斯化转移在截断参数满足第 4 节条件时成立），故在本节情境下非空。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)（连续过程正则性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 全局 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 有正下界，保证 SDE 强解存在唯一且转移密度关于 Lebesgue 测度存在、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(y,s)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 具有紧支撑光滑密度的前提下）。此假设在本节对照中为标准配置，用于支撑 Leibniz 求导。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)（可积性）</strong> 本节出现的所有 KL 项与期望均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$</span> 中取值，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 在支撑上与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 同支撑时取有限值；对连续侧，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\|\\nabla\\log p_{s_t}(Y_t)\\|^2]&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，以保证得分匹配型恒等式的期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)（离散化一致性）</strong> 连续侧采用 Euler–Maruyama 离散时，单步条件高斯转移的均值与方差分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}+f(y_{t-1},s_{t-1})\\Delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s_{t-1})^2\\Delta$</span>；本节对照只在“单步转移为高斯”这一结构层面进行，不主张离散 D3PM 与某连续 SDE 在路径测度上弱收敛（该主张需额外紧性论证，超出本节范围，故不陈述）。</p>\n<p>下面四个小节依次完成：核心定义与区别、主对照定理及证明、可检验推论、具体例子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-1-对照的定义-结构对应而非测度对应\">1. 对照的定义：结构对应而非测度对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-1-对照的定义-结构对应而非测度对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（结构对照）</strong> 称离散 D3PM 与前向 SDE 在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处<strong>结构对照</strong>，若存在映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=\\int_{\\Phi_t^{-1}(\\{j\\})}p_{s_t}(y\\mid \\Phi_0(i))\\,\\mathrm dy,\\qquad \\forall i,j\\in\\mathcal X,$$</div>\n即离散条件分布是连续条件密度在分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Phi_t^{-1}(\\{j\\})\\}_{j=1}^{K}$</span> 上的积分。此定义与“弱收敛”不同：它只要求每个时刻的边缘条件分布匹配，不要求联合路径测度匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>（本节必须显式区分，避免与前序节混淆）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>与第 5 节累积转移的区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 是矩阵乘积，编码的是离散半群的<strong>代数</strong>结构；定义 1 编码的是离散分布与连续密度之间的<strong>测度积分</strong>关系。二者可以同时成立而不互相蕴含。</li>\n<li>与第 11 节 masked 扩散的区别：masked 扩散的转移核是吸收型（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 含吸收态），其连续类比不是各向同性 Gaussian 噪声，而是“到吸收态的跳跃”；故定义 1 对 masked 扩散不适用（吸收态无 Lebesgue 密度）。</li>\n<li>与反向 SDE 漂移的区别：本节只对照<strong>前向</strong>转移；反向 SDE 的漂移含得分项，属于第 7 节 ELBO 的连续类比，不在定义 1 范围内。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-2-主对照定理-KL-的离散-连续分解恒等式\">2. 主对照定理：KL 的离散—连续分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-2-主对照定理-KL-的离散-连续分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（KL 分解恒等式）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 如定义 1 且为可测分割。则对任意离散后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与任意参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(j\\mid x_t)},$$</div>\n且若进一步假设存在连续密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}(y\\mid y_t,y_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(y\\mid y_t)$</span> 满足定义 1 的积分关系（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_{t-1}$</span> 两侧同时），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{j=1}^{K}q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(j\\mid x_t)}=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}(y\\mid y_t,y_0)\\log\\frac{q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}(y\\mid y_t,y_0)}{p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(y\\mid y_t)}\\,\\mathrm dy+R_t,$$</div>\n其中余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$R_t=\\sum_{j=1}^{K}q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)\\log\\frac{q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)}{\\int_{\\Phi_{t-1}^{-1}(\\{j\\})}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}(y\\mid y_t,y_0)\\,\\mathrm dy}-\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\log\\frac{q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}}{\\int_{\\Phi_{t-1}^{-1}(\\{j(y)\\})}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy}\\,\\mathrm dy,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 只依赖分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t-1}$</span> 与连续后验，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设核对</strong>：(A1) 保证离散后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 有定义且分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(x_0,j)Q_t(j,x_t)&gt;0$</span>；(A3) 保证两侧 KL 有限或同时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，从而等式在扩展实数系中成立；连续侧对数的可积性由 (A3) 的得分平方可积性经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的局部有界性推出（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 的支撑上）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤逐步写出）：</p>\n<p><em>第一步：离散 KL 的展开。</em> 由 KL 定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)=\\sum_{j}q(j)\\big(\\log q(j)-\\log p_\\theta(j)\\big),$$</div>\n其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j)=0$</span> 时该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。此步仅用有限和，无需额外假设。</p>\n<p><em>第二步：把离散项写成对分割的积分。</em> 由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\int_{A_j}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}(y\\mid y_t,y_0)\\,\\mathrm dy$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j=\\Phi_{t-1}^{-1}(\\{j\\})$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_j q(j)\\log q(j)=\\sum_j\\Big(\\int_{A_j}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy\\Big)\\log\\Big(\\int_{A_j}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy\\Big).$$</div>\n类似地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j)\\log p_\\theta(j)=\\sum_j\\big(\\int_{A_j}q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy\\big)\\log p_\\theta(j)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>第三步：与连续 KL 相减。</em> 连续 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\log q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy-\\int q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta\\,\\mathrm dy.$$</div>\n两式相减，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\int_{A_j}=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}$</span>（分割的可加性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t-1}$</span> 可测保证）以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(j)=p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 上的积分（定义 1 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 侧同样成立），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\text{离散 KL}-\\text{连续 KL}=\\sum_j q(j)\\log q(j)-\\int q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\log q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}\\,\\mathrm dy.$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的第一项与第二项之差（符号已按命题中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的定义整理）。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 项完全抵消，这正是命题断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>”的来源。</p>\n<p><em>第四步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的有限性。</em> 由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}|\\log q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}|&lt;\\infty$</span>；离散侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q(j)|\\log q(j)|&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限和）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注 1</strong>：命题 1 的实质是：在结构对照下，离散 ELBO 与连续 ELBO 之差是一个<strong>与参数无关的常数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span>。因此对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 与连续 ELBO 的梯度在结构对照下相等——但这是<strong>梯度相等</strong>，不是目标值相等；命题只断言差值常数，不断言两者目标值相等。此区分正是本节对照的数学内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-3-可检验推论-单步高斯的离散-连续梯度恒等式\">3. 可检验推论：单步高斯的离散—连续梯度恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-3-可检验推论-单步高斯的离散-连续梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（高斯化转移的梯度对照）</strong> 设第 4 节高斯化转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限下退化为单步条件高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y_t\\mid y_{t-1}\\sim\\mathcal N(y_{t-1},\\sigma_t^2)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span>），且 (A2)–(A4) 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=\\mathbb E_{q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}}\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(y_{t-1}\\mid y_t)\\big]+\\nabla_\\theta R_t,$$</div>\n且当分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t-1}$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta R_t=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，离散 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=$</span> 连续 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$+R_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，需交换期望与梯度。由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}$</span> 可积的控制函数界住（(A3) 的得分平方可积性给出局部控制），故由 Dominated Convergence 可交换。连续 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{q}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta]$</span>，整理符号即得第一式。第二式因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 的表达式只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{t-1}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故梯度为零。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>检验方式</strong>：推论 1 给出一个可数值验证的恒等式——在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 较大时，离散梯度与连续梯度之差应随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 增大而趋于零（在固定分割细化下）。第 14 节的数值验证代码正是检验此收敛性（该节将给出具体实现，本节不重复）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-4-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的连续对照\">4. 具体例子：二状态均匀转移的连续对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-4-具体例子-二状态均匀转移的连续对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>（本章 canonical 形式），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。由第 2 节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+(1-2\\beta_t)^t&amp;1-(1-2\\beta_t)^t\\\\1-(1-2\\beta_t)^t&amp;1+(1-2\\beta_t)^t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>（对常 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 情形；变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 时用乘积定义）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t:\\{1,2\\}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(1)=-\\mu_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(2)=+\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t&gt;0$</span>，分割为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_1=(-\\infty,0]$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_2=(0,\\infty)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1（对称二状态的 KL 显式值）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，则后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=1\\mid x_t=2,x_0=1)=\\frac{\\bar Q_{t-1}(1,1)Q_t(1,2)}{\\bar Q_t(1,2)},\\qquad q(x_{t-1}=2\\mid\\cdot)=1-q(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot).$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的显式元素（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}(1,1)=\\frac12(1+(1-2\\beta)^{t-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(1,2)=\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(1,2)=\\frac12(1-(1-2\\beta)^t)$</span>），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(1\\mid 2,1)=\\frac{\\beta\\big(1+(1-2\\beta)^{t-1}\\big)}{1-(1-2\\beta)^t}.$$</div>\n此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span> 时属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>，验证 (A1) 的后验非退化。若取连续对照 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(y\\mid y_t)=\\mathcal N(y;\\hat y_\\theta,\\sigma^2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,0}$</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_1,A_2$</span> 上的截断高斯，则命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 可由两个截断高斯的对数积分与离散对数和之差直接算出；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\infty$</span> 时截断质量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t\\to 0$</span>，离散 KL 与连续 KL 在极限下重合。此例验证了命题 1 的余项确实随分割细化而消失，且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（梯度恒等式的数值核对思路）</strong> 在例 1 的参数化下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(j\\mid x_t)=\\mathrm{softmax}(\\theta)_j$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\in\\{1,2\\}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 有闭式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=q(1)\\log(q(1)/p_\\theta(1))+q(2)\\log(q(2)/p_\\theta(2))$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=p_\\theta-q$</span>（softmax 的梯度恒等式）。连续侧对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta$</span> 在 Gaussian 参数化下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\hat y_\\theta-y)/\\sigma^2\\cdot\\nabla_\\theta\\hat y_\\theta$</span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\infty$</span> 下应一致，这正是推论 1 的检验点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-5-对照的边界-哪些结构不能对照\">5. 对照的边界：哪些结构不能对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-5-对照的边界-哪些结构不能对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节必须显式指出对照的失效边界，以免读者把结构对照误读为普适等价：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>吸收转移不可对照</strong>：第 3 节吸收转移含吸收态（一旦进入即停留），其单步分布在吸收态处为原子，无 Lebesgue 密度，定义 1 的积分表示不存在。故命题 1 对吸收转移不适用；这与第 11 节 masked 扩散的关系一致（masked 扩散即吸收型）。</li>\n<li><strong>不可逆转移的后验失效不影响对照</strong>：第 10 节的反例说明不可逆 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可使后验分母为零；但命题 1 只要求 (A1) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t&gt;0$</span>，若该条件破坏，后验本身无定义，对照命题的前提不成立，故不构成对照的反例，而是对照的<strong>前提失效</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>路径测度不对照</strong>：定义 1 只匹配每个时刻的边缘，不匹配联合路径。若读者需要路径级对照（如 Girsanov 定理下的似然比），需额外假设离散链的转移核与连续 SDE 的 Euler 离散在每步条件分布上一致，此假设在本章未建立，故本节不陈述路径级结论。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散 D3PM 与连续扩散的对照是<strong>结构对照</strong>（定义 1）：每个时刻的离散条件分布等于连续条件密度在可测分割上的积分；它与累积转移的代数结构、masked 扩散的吸收结构、反向 SDE 的漂移结构均不同，不可混用。</li>\n<li>主定理（命题 1）证明：在结构对照与 (A1)–(A3) 下，离散 KL 与连续 KL 之差为与参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span>；推论 1 由此得到梯度恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta]+\\nabla_\\theta R_t$</span>，且分割不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta R_t=0$</span>——这是<strong>梯度相等</strong>，不是目标值相等。</li>\n<li>对照的边界是明确的：吸收转移因原子性不可对照；不可逆转移破坏 (A1) 时对照前提失效而非对照被推翻；路径测度级对照需额外假设，本章不主张。二状态均匀转移的例子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 随分割细化趋于零的显式验证路径。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-6-连续侧-ELBO-的显式形式与离散侧逐项对应\">6. 连续侧 ELBO 的显式形式与离散侧逐项对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-6-连续侧-ELBO-的显式形式与离散侧逐项对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节只建立了 KL 差为常数的恒等式，尚未把离散 ELBO 的求和结构与连续侧的时间积分结构逐项对齐。本小节补足这一对齐，使命题 1 的“逐时刻”对照上升为“整条链”对照。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（连续侧变分目标）</strong> 设 (A2)–(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(Y_s)$</span> 为前向 SDE 强解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(y_{s_{t-1}}\\mid y_{s_t})$</span> 为参数化反向转移密度。定义连续侧变分目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q_{s_{0:T}}}\\left[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,s_0}\\,\\|\\,p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid y_{s_t})\\big)\\right],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,s_0}$</span> 为连续前向过程在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(y_{s_t},y_{s_0})$</span> 下的后验密度，期望取在前向联合密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_{0:T}}$</span> 上。</p>\n<p>此定义与第 7 节离散 ELBO 的唯一结构差别是：离散侧 KL 作用于有限状态上的概率向量，连续侧 KL 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的密度。其余（逐时刻求和、期望取前向联合、参数只出现在反向项）完全同构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（整链对照恒等式）</strong> 在定义 1 的结构对照下，设对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 命题 1 的余项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 有限，且 (A1)–(A3) 成立。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}(\\theta)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}R_t,$$</div>\n右端求和为有限和，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{cont}}$</span> 当且仅当每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，命题 1 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{s_{t-1}\\mid s_t,s_0}\\|p^{\\mathrm{cont}}_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid y_{s_t})\\big)+R_t.$$</div>\n两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取期望。离散侧期望为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的求和，连续侧期望为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_0,s_t}$</span> 的积分；由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0,x_t)=\\int_{\\Phi_0^{-1}(x_0)\\times\\Phi_t^{-1}(x_t)}q_{s_0,s_t}\\,\\mathrm dy_0\\,\\mathrm dy_t$</span>，故两侧期望在分割可加性下相等（Fubini 用于交换求和与积分，条件为 (A3) 的可积性）。逐项相加即得第一式。第二式由有限和的线性性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta R_t=0$</span>（命题 1 的注 1）直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注 2</strong>：命题 2 澄清了一个常见误读——离散 ELBO 与连续 ELBO 的<strong>目标值</strong>一般不等（差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t R_t$</span>），但<strong>梯度</strong>在分割不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变时相等。因此用离散 D3PM 训练出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与用连续扩散训练的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在同一参数化下沿相同方向更新，但损失曲面的绝对高度不同。这一区分对工程实践有意义：早停准则若基于损失绝对值，两者不可互换；若基于梯度范数或验证集梯度方向，则可互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-7-得分匹配恒等式-离散有限差分的连续类比\">7. 得分匹配恒等式：离散有限差分的连续类比<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-7-得分匹配恒等式-离散有限差分的连续类比\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与推论 1 只涉及 KL 与梯度，尚未触及连续扩散的核心对象——得分函数。本小节补足这一环，给出离散转移矩阵的有限差分与连续得分之间的恒等式，这是本节对照在“得分动力学”层面的落点。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（离散得分算子）</strong> 设 (A1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 给出。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，定义离散得分算子\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_t(j):=\\log q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)-\\log q(x_t=j-1\\mid x_0),\\qquad j=2,\\dots,K,$$</div>\n即相邻状态对数概率的一阶前向差分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（得分对照恒等式）</strong> 设定义 1 的结构对照成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t$</span> 取等距分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(j)=j\\Delta y$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta y&gt;0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且处处正。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=2,\\dots,K$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_t(j)=\\int_{0}^{\\Delta y}\\nabla\\log q_{s_t\\mid s_0}\\big((j-1)\\Delta y+u\\,\\big|\\,\\Phi_0(x_0)\\big)\\,\\mathrm du+O(\\Delta y^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span> 项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span> 在分割区间上的二阶导一致有界控制（(A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span> 正则性给出该界）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>（关键步骤）：</p>\n<p><em>第一步：对数差的积分表示。</em> 由微积分基本定理，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(j\\Delta y)-\\log q((j-1)\\Delta y)=\\int_{(j-1)\\Delta y}^{j\\Delta y}\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm dy}\\log q(y)\\,\\mathrm dy=\\int_{0}^{\\Delta y}\\nabla\\log q\\big((j-1)\\Delta y+u\\big)\\,\\mathrm du.$$</div>\n此步只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在区间上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且正，由 (A2) 保证。</p>\n<p><em>第二步：离散侧与积分侧的匹配。</em> 由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(j\\Delta y)=\\int_{A_j}q_{s_t\\mid s_0}\\,\\mathrm dy$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 个分割区间。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_j$</span> 上变化平缓（二阶导有界），积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{A_j}q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在中点的值之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^3)$</span>，取对数后差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span>。将此代入第一步的积分表示，即得命题中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span> 余项。</p>\n<p><em>第三步：一致有界性。</em> 余项常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{y\\in A_j}|\\partial_y^2\\log q_{s_t\\mid s_0}(y)|$</span> 控制，该上确界在紧分割上有限（(A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注 3</strong>：命题 3 说明离散得分算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(j)$</span> 是连续得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span> 在分割区间上的<strong>平均</strong>，误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span>。这正是“离散转移矩阵决定得分动力学”的数学内容：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的有限差分结构在结构对照下逼近连续得分，逼近阶由分割细度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta y$</span> 控制。此结论与第 16 节“转移矩阵决定扩散”的推导链一致，本节只提供对照侧的恒等式，不重复该节的推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-8-一个反例边界-非等距分割下得分对照失效\">8. 一个反例边界：非等距分割下得分对照失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-8-一个反例边界-非等距分割下得分对照失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 依赖等距分割。若分割不等距，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(j)$</span> 不再是对连续得分的平均，而带有与分割间距相关的权重偏差。本小节给出一个具体的失效构造，说明该假设不可省略。</p>\n<p><strong>构造</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(1)=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(2)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_t(3)=10$</span>，即分割间距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta y_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta y_2=9$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_t\\mid s_0}(y)=\\mathcal N(y;0,1)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_t(2)=\\log q(1)-\\log q(0)=-\\tfrac12,\\qquad S_t(3)=\\log q(10)-\\log q(1)\\approx-\\tfrac{99}{2}.$$</div>\n而连续得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1(-y)\\,\\mathrm dy=-\\tfrac12$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(2)$</span> 恰好一致（因区间短）；但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[1,10]$</span> 上的平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_1^{10}(-y)\\,\\mathrm dy/\\Delta y_2=-\\tfrac{99}{2}\\cdot\\tfrac{1}{9}\\approx-5.5$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(3)\\approx-49.5$</span> 相差近一个数量级。故命题 3 的等距假设不可省略：非等距分割下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(j)$</span> 与连续得分平均的偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y_j)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y_j^2)$</span>，且偏差随间距增大而发散。</p>\n<p>此构造只用于说明命题 3 的假设边界，不构成对命题 1 或命题 2 的反例——后两者的结构对照只要求可测分割，不要求等距。三者的假设差异正是本节对照的分层结构：KL 对照（命题 1、2）只需可测分割；得分对照（命题 3）需等距分割加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span> 正则性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-9-对照表的数学内容\">9. 对照表的数学内容<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-9-对照表的数学内容\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 1–3 与注 1–3，本节对照可整理为一张分层表，每层列出对照对象、所需假设与结论强度。此表不是文献综述，而是本节三个命题的逻辑汇总，供第 14 节数值验证与第 16 节推导链引用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对照层</th>\n<th>离散对象</th>\n<th>连续对象</th>\n<th>所需假设</th>\n<th>结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>分布层</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span></td>\n<td>定义 1 可测分割</td>\n<td>边缘分布积分匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KL 层</td>\n<td>离散 KL</td>\n<td>连续 KL</td>\n<td>(A1)–(A3) + 定义 1</td>\n<td>差为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span>，梯度相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>得分层</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(j)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_{s_t\\mid s_0}$</span></td>\n<td>等距分割 + <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{2,1}$</span> + <span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span></td>\n<td>平均逼近，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>三层假设逐层加强，结论逐层具体。第 14 节的数值验证应分别检验三层：分布层检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与截断高斯积分的匹配；KL 层检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于零；得分层检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t(j)$</span> 与连续得分平均的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta y^2)$</span> 收敛率。第 16 节“转移矩阵决定扩散”的推导链中，分布层对应累积转移的构造，KL 层对应 ELBO 的梯度，得分层对应反向 SDE 漂移的离散类比——三层共同构成“转移矩阵决定扩散”的完整数学内容。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-代码-D3PM-训练\">代码：D3PM 训练<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-代码-D3PM-训练\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>；前向转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span>，每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机（每行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、元素非负）；累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>）；前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，即行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_{x_0}^{\\top}\\bar Q_t$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由第 6 节给出；反向网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为行随机的条件分布矩阵值函数。本节只做数值实现与验证，不重复上述推导。</p>\n<p>本节实现所依赖的假设（逐条显式）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 数值可实现性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span>，所有矩阵元素为 IEEE-754 双精度浮点数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的元素在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 内。</p>\n<p>(A2) 行随机性保持：浮点乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span> 后需验证每行和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-12}$</span>；若超出则说明实现有误，而非数学失效。</p>\n<p>(A3) 后验计算的对数域稳定性：后验公式含除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，当该边缘概率下溢至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时须用对数域或加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 保护；本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 使所有边缘概率严格为正，从而分母不消失，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 随机量的统计断言：Monte Carlo 估计的样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 500$</span>，误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差判定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 由二项分布方差解析给出。</p>\n<p>本节输入输出契约如下。输入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>（整数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\le K\\le 4$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（整数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le T\\le 4$</span>）、转移类型字符串、随机种子。输出：（i）累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_T\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,K)$</span>，行和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 1$</span>；（ii）后验张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^{T\\times K\\times K\\times K}$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,K,K,K)$</span>，指标顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,x_0,x_{t-1})$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,x_0)$</span> 切片对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；（iii）ELBO 的 Monte Carlo 估计标量；（iv）若干解析断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-算法定义-训练循环的数学契约\">算法定义：训练循环的数学契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-算法定义-训练循环的数学契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>D3PM 训练在第 8 节已给出目标：对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，最小化</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>本节代码不实现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的参数化与梯度，只实现“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下的前向采样、后验计算、KL 求和”这一确定性数值管线，并用它验证三条核心等式：（i）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的行随机性；（ii）后验切片的归一性；（iii）当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取后验本身时 KL 为零。第三条是本节的核心断言，因为它把“训练目标在最优解处取零”这一解析事实变成可执行检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>累积矩阵的更新为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵乘法，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span> 时无稳定性问题；行随机性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机与归纳法保证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\bar Q_{t-1}(Q_t\\mathbf 1)=\\bar Q_{t-1}\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>。浮点误差每步约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\cdot\\mathrm{eps}\\approx 4\\times 2.2\\times 10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span> 步累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span>，故断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 有余量。</p>\n<p>后验公式（第 6 节）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t=i,x_0=k)=\\frac{q(x_t=i\\mid x_{t-1}=j)\\,q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_0=k)}{q(x_t=i\\mid x_0=k)},$$</div>\n<p>其中分子两项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{k,j}\\cdot(Q_t)_{j,i}$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{k,i}$</span>。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.3$</span>，所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 元素严格为正（最小元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_1)(1-\\beta_2)$</span> 量级），分母不消失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码块自包含，仅用 numpy 与 sympy，矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span>，运行时间远小于 30 秒。所有解析期望值在块内用 sympy 有理数算出，浮点容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---- 解析量（sympy 有理数） ----\nb1 = sp.Rational(1, 5)   # 0.2\nb2 = sp.Rational(3, 10)  # 0.3\nQ1s = sp.Matrix([[1-b1, b1], [b1, 1-b1]])\nQ2s = sp.Matrix([[1-b2, b2], [b2, 1-b2]])\nQbar2s = Q1s * Q2s\n# 手算：Qbar2[0,0] = (4/5)(7/10)+(1/5)(3/10) = 28/50+3/50 = 31/50\ndiag_sym = Qbar2s[0, 0]\noff_sym  = Qbar2s[0, 1]\nprint(&quot;sym Qbar2:&quot;, Qbar2s.tolist(), &quot;diag=&quot;, diag_sym, &quot;off=&quot;, off_sym)\n\n# ---- 数值实现 ----\nK, T = 2, 2\nQ1 = np.array([[1-0.2, 0.2], [0.2, 0.8]], dtype=np.float64)\nQ2 = np.array([[1-0.3, 0.3], [0.3, 0.7]], dtype=np.float64)\nprint(&quot;Q1 shape&quot;, Q1.shape, &quot;Q2 shape&quot;, Q2.shape)\n\n# 归一化并检查行随机性\nfor name, Q in [(&quot;Q1&quot;, Q1), (&quot;Q2&quot;, Q2)]:\n    rs = Q.sum(axis=1)\n    print(name, &quot;row sums&quot;, rs)\n    assert np.all(np.abs(rs - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12) and np.all(Q &gt;= 0)\n\nQbar2 = Q1 @ Q2\nprint(&quot;Qbar2 shape&quot;, Qbar2.shape)\nprint(&quot;Qbar2 =\\n&quot;, Qbar2)\nrs = Qbar2.sum(axis=1)\nprint(&quot;Qbar2 row sums&quot;, rs)\nassert np.all(np.abs(rs - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12)\n\n# 断言：数值 Qbar2 与 sympy 逐元素一致\nQbar2_sym_np = np.array(Qbar2s.tolist(), dtype=np.float64).reshape(K, K)\nprint(&quot;Qbar2 sym np =\\n&quot;, Qbar2_sym_np)\nassert np.all(np.abs(Qbar2 - Qbar2_sym_np) &lt; 1e-6)\nassert abs(Qbar2[0, 0] - float(diag_sym)) &lt; 1e-6\nassert abs(Qbar2[0, 1] - float(off_sym))  &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---- 后验切片（t=1 时 Qbar_0 = I） ----\nI = np.eye(K)\npost = np.zeros((T, K, K, K), dtype=np.float64)  # (t, x_t, x_0, x_{t-1})\nfor t in range(1, T+1):\n    Qbar_prev = I if t == 1 else Qbar2\n    Q_t = Q1 if t == 1 else Q2\n    denom_mat = Qbar_prev @ Q_t  # = Qbar_t\n    for xt in range(K):\n        for x0 in range(K):\n            num = Qbar_prev[x0, :] * Q_t[:, xt]  # shape (K,)\n            den = denom_mat[x0, xt]\n            post[t-1, xt, x0, :] = num / den\nprint(&quot;post shape&quot;, post.shape)\nslice_sums = post.sum(axis=3)\nprint(&quot;slice sums =\\n&quot;, slice_sums)\nassert np.all(np.abs(slice_sums - 1.0) &lt; 1e-6)\nassert np.all(post &gt;= -1e-12)\n\n# ---- 核心等式：p_theta = 后验时 KL = 0 ----\nkl = 0.0\nfor t in range(1, T+1):\n    for xt in range(K):\n        for x0 in range(K):\n            q = post[t-1, xt, x0, :].reshape(K)\n            p = q.copy()\n            m = q &gt; 0\n            kl += float(np.sum(q[m] * np.log(q[m] / p[m])))\nprint(&quot;KL(p=q) =&quot;, kl)\nassert abs(kl - 0.0) &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---- Monte Carlo 前向边缘（3σ） ----\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 400\nx0 = rng.integers(0, K, size=N).reshape(N)\nu = rng.random(N).reshape(N)\ncum = np.cumsum(Qbar2, axis=1).reshape(K, K)\nassert np.all(np.abs(cum[:, -1] - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12)\nx2 = np.array([np.searchsorted(cum[x0[n]], u[n]) for n in range(N)]).reshape(N)\np_an = float(Qbar2s[0, 0])\nmask0 = (x0 == 0)\nn0 = int(mask0.sum())\np_hat = float(np.mean(x2[mask0] == 0))\nsigma = np.sqrt(p_an * (1 - p_an) / max(n0, 1))\nprint(f&quot;MC p_hat={p_hat:.4f} analytic={p_an:.4f} 3sigma={3*sigma:.4f} n0={n0}&quot;)\nassert abs(p_hat - p_an) &lt; 3 * sigma + 1e-6\n\nprint(&quot;ALL ASSERTIONS PASSED&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>Qbar2</code> 数值矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\begin{pmatrix}0.62&amp;0.38\\\\0.38&amp;0.62\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，行和打印为 <code>[1. 1.]</code>；<code>post</code> 形状 <code>(2,2,2,2)</code>，切片和全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<code>KL total</code> 打印为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0$</span>（精确零，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 时每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1=0$</span>）；Monte Carlo 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 估计与解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.62$</span> 的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 内（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\approx 0.024$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx 0.073$</span>）。误差量级：矩阵乘法浮点误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>，后验归一误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span>，KL 精确零无浮点误差（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 1=0$</span> 在 IEEE-754 下精确），Monte Carlo 误差由二项分布方差控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三条误差来源需分别说明。其一，矩阵乘法的舍入误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时每次乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 次乘加，单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2\\cdot\\mathrm{eps}\\cdot\\|Q\\|\\approx 10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 步累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>，故行随机性断言取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 是保守的。其二，后验除法的舍入误差：分子分母均为正且远离下溢（最小元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 0.38\\times 0.7\\approx 0.27$</span>），相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 3\\mathrm{eps}\\approx 7\\times 10^{-16}$</span>，切片和误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span>。其三，Monte Carlo 采样误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=400$</span> 时二项标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{p(1-p)/n_0}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.62$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n_0\\approx 200$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\approx 0.034$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx 0.10$</span>，断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma+10^{-6}$</span> 与误差阶匹配，未用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 卡随机量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-边界与退化情形\">边界与退化情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-边界与退化情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码未覆盖的退化情形有两类，均在前序第 10 节已构造反例，此处只声明边界。其一，当某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 奇异（如吸收转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的某些行退化为吸收态独热），后验分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可能为零，此时后验无定义，KL 为无穷——这正是第 10 节“转移矩阵不可逆导致后验失效”的数值表现；本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 严格正使所有元素为正，从而规避该退化。其二，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 在某切片上与后验支撑不相交（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q&gt;0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0$</span>），KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，代码中 <code>np.log(q/p)</code> 会产生 <code>inf</code>；本节断言 4 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span> 故不触发，但实现中若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 由网络输出且未加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 平滑，训练时需用 <code>clamp(p, eps, 1)</code> 防 <code>inf</code>，这是数值稳定性条件，不是数学条件的放宽。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>本节把 D3PM 训练管线拆成三个确定性数值步骤：累积矩阵乘法、后验切片计算、KL 求和；三者均以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 矩阵与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,K,K,K)$</span> 张量显式表示，形状与指标顺序在代码注释中固定，避免了隐式广播导致的索引错位。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>核心断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 取后验时 KL 为零”是解析事实而非近似：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span> 时每项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q/p)=\\log 1=0$</span> 在 IEEE-754 下精确为零，故容差可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>；这与 Monte Carlo 断言必须用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差形成对照，体现了“确定性等式用紧容差、随机量用统计容差”的纪律。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>数值误差量级由矩阵维度与步数决定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span> 时累积舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span>，后验归一误差同量级；唯一需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 保护的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的对数域计算，其触发条件是后验支撑与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 支撑不相交，对应第 10 节的反例边界。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-训练目标的梯度可交换性\">命题：训练目标的梯度可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-训练目标的梯度可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前面代码只验证了前向管线与 KL 的数值一致性，未触及训练真正需要的对象：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span>。本节补足这一论证，因为它决定了代码中“先算后验、再算 KL”的顺序是否与梯度计算合法交换。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.13.1（梯度交换）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（前向过程无参数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^K$</span> 上的正概率向量且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]\n=\\mathbb E_{q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>　(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X^T$</span> 上的概率质量函数，期望为有限和，不涉及积分与极限交换；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的每个分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的紧邻域上连续可微且有正下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的梯度有界；(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，是常数权重。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X^T$</span> 有限，期望是有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_{1:T}}q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)(\\cdot)$</span>，有限和的梯度等于梯度的有限和，无需 Dominated Convergence。对每个固定轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:T}$</span>，KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微函数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)=\\sum_j q_j\\log q_j-\\sum_j q_j\\log p_{\\theta,j}$</span>，第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{\\theta,j}$</span> 的线性组合；由假设 (ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_{\\theta,j}$</span> 存在且有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 存在。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_{x_{1:T}}q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdots)=\\sum_{x_{1:T}}q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdots),$$</div>\n<p>即梯度与有限和交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的工程含义是：代码可以先对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,x_0)$</span> 切片独立计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>，再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 加权求和，无需构造联合轨迹的自动微分图。前序第 8 节的训练目标因此可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^3)$</span> 次切片计算内完成，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^T)$</span> 次轨迹枚举。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 连续，则假设 (i) 失效，须改用 Leibniz 规则并验证被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Lipschitz 条件；本节不展开该情形，因其属于连续扩散章的范围。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-命题-后验计算的复杂度与数值下界\">命题：后验计算的复杂度与数值下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-命题-后验计算的复杂度与数值下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.13.2（后验切片的计算量）</strong>　对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，后验张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的全部 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T K^3$</span> 个元素可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^3)$</span> 次浮点乘除内算出，且每个元素的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(\\bar Q_t)_{x_0,x_t}$</span> 若满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{k,i}(\\bar Q_t)_{k,i}\\ge\\delta&gt;0$</span>，则后验元素的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\mathrm{eps}/\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 元素非负、行随机；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 所有元素严格正且有统一下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>；浮点运算为 IEEE-754 双精度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　元素数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\cdot K\\cdot K\\cdot K=TK^3$</span>，每个元素两次乘法一次除法，故计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^3)$</span>。相对误差：分子为两个正浮点数的乘积，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2\\mathrm{eps}$</span>；分母为一个正浮点数，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\mathrm{eps}$</span>；除法相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\mathrm{eps}$</span>。合计相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 4\\mathrm{eps}$</span>，但分母可能因累积乘法而偏离解析值，其绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le TK\\mathrm{eps}\\cdot\\|\\bar Q_t\\|_\\infty$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 后相对误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TK\\mathrm{eps}/\\delta$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=K=4$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.1$</span>，上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 16\\times 2.2\\times 10^{-16}/0.1\\approx 3.5\\times 10^{-14}$</span>，与本节代码的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 容差一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出代码中容差选择的依据：容差不是拍脑袋的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，而是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TK$</span> 推出的误差上界。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 更小（如吸收转移后期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 趋近独热，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to 0$</span>），上界发散，此时必须改用对数域计算后验，否则浮点除法失去意义。这正是第 10 节反例的数值根源：不是后验公式错了，而是分母趋零使相对误差失控。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-推导-对数域后验的等价变形\">推导：对数域后验的等价变形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-推导-对数域后验的等价变形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 过小、直接除法不可靠时，代码应改用对数域。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t(j,i;k)=\\log\\big((\\bar Q_{t-1})_{k,j}(Q_t)_{j,i}\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t(i;k)=\\log(\\bar Q_t)_{k,i}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=j\\mid x_t=i,x_0=k)=\\exp\\big(L_t(j,i;k)-Z_t(i;k)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j q=1$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j\\exp(L_t(j,i;k)-Z_t(i;k))=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t(i;k)=\\log\\sum_j\\exp L_t(j,i;k)$</span>，这正是 log-sum-exp 归一化。代码实现时先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 个分量，取最大值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 后计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(L_t-m)$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\sum\\exp(L_t-m)+m$</span>，再逐分量减之。该变形与直接除法在数学上恒等，但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 小时数值稳定：减最大值保证指数不溢出，求和不为零保证归一化不失效。本节代码因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge 0.27$</span> 未启用该路径，但实现契约要求：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\bar Q_t)&lt;10^{-6}$</span> 时必须切换到对数域，这是数值稳定性条件，不是数学假设的放宽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-推导-KL-求和与轨迹期望的等价\">推导：KL 求和与轨迹期望的等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-推导-KL-求和与轨迹期望的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 7 节给出的 ELBO 是对轨迹的期望，本节代码按切片求和。两者等价性需显式写出，否则读者会误以为代码漏掉了轨迹相关性。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\sum_{t=1}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big]\n=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\sum_{x_t,x_0}q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,q(x_0)\\,D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>推导：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，故对轨迹期望可先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:t-1},x_{t+1:T}$</span> 边缘化，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x_t,x_0}q(x_t,x_0)D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span>；再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)$</span> 分解。代码中 <code>kl_total</code> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,x_0)$</span> 三重循环求和，正是该式的离散实现；若再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 的样本权重，即得训练目标的 Monte Carlo 估计。本节代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=q$</span> 故每项为零，未显式乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，但断言 4 的循环结构已覆盖该分解的全部切片。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-实现契约的补充条款\">实现契约的补充条款<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-实现契约的补充条款\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上四个小节，本节代码的实现契约在原有三条之外补两条。其一，后验计算必须检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\bar Q_t)$</span>：若小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 则切换到对数域 log-sum-exp，否则直接除法；该阈值由命题 20.13.2 的误差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$TK\\mathrm{eps}/\\delta\\le 10^{-12}$</span> 反解得出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\ge 10^{-6}$</span> 时上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-9}$</span>，仍在可接受范围。其二，KL 求和必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_t,x_0)$</span> 切片独立计算再累加，不得先构造联合轨迹再求期望；前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK^3)$</span>，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K^T)$</span>，且由命题 20.13.1 二者梯度相等，故切片实现不损失正确性。这两条与本节代码的断言 3、断言 4 一一对应：断言 3 验证切片归一（分母非零），断言 4 验证切片 KL 为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q$</span>），共同构成“切片实现合法”的数值证据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-代码-转移矩阵的数值验证\">代码：转移矩阵的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-代码-转移矩阵的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号。设状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。转移矩阵族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 为行随机矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=1}^K Q_t(i,j)=1$</span>。累积转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>（矩阵乘法按时间顺序左乘，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span>，行向量约定下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>）。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{Q_t(i,j)\\,\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)}{\\bar Q_t(k,j)},$$</div>\n<p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span>（否则该条件后验无定义，见第 10 节反例）。本节数值验证聚焦三条核心等式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>行随机性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 为全 1 列向量），对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>；</li>\n<li>累积一致性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与逐元素连乘在二状态均匀情形下闭式一致；</li>\n<li>后验归一：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(j,k)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=1$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>本节只做数值验证，不重复推导；推导见第 5、6 节。数值环境为 numpy + sympy，矩阵维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>，样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\le 500$</span>，全部断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span>，解析期望值在块内用 sympy 有理数精确算出后转浮点比对。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-验证对象与张量形状契约\">验证对象与张量形状契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-验证对象与张量形状契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 个行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1,\\dots,Q_T$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,K)$</span>；初始分布行向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,K)$</span>；样本数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span>。输出：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Qbar</code>：形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,K,K)$</span>，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 片为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>；</li>\n<li><code>post</code>：形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(T,K,K,K)$</span>，<code>post[t-1,i,j,k]</code><span class=\"math-inline\">$=q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)$</span>；</li>\n<li><code>samples</code>：形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,T+1)$</span>，每行一条从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 出发的链，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\dots,K-1\\}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有概率量取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span>，行和恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（浮点意义下误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span> 量级，来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 次加法舍入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le4$</span> 时可忽略）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\">核心更新公式与稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-核心更新公式与稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>累积矩阵按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_1=Q_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span> 递推。数值稳定性条件：每步乘法后不重新归一化，因为行随机矩阵之积仍行随机（精确算术下），舍入误差累积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le4$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-14}$</span>，无需 clamp。后验计算中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)$</span> 可能为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>：在均匀与吸收转移下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 则正，否则该条件后验无定义。代码中仅对分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span> 的条目计算后验，并对分母加 <code>eps=1e-300</code> 防止除零（仅影响不可达条目，这些条目不参与断言）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值验证代码\">数值验证代码<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值验证代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---------- 2 状态均匀转移 Q = [[3/4, 1/4], [1/4, 3/4]]，b = 1/4 ----------\nK, T = 2, 3\nb = sp.Rational(1, 4)\nQ_sym = sp.Matrix([[1 - b, b], [b, 1 - b]])\nQ = np.array(Q_sym.tolist(), dtype=float)\nprint(&quot;Q shape:&quot;, Q.shape)\nassert Q.shape == (K, K)\n# 不变量：行和=1，非负，对称\nassert np.allclose(Q.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\nassert np.all(Q &gt;= 0)\nassert np.allclose(Q, Q.T, atol=1e-12)\n\n# ---------- 累积矩阵：数值递推 vs sympy 精确幂，两条独立路径互验 ----------\nQbar = np.empty((T, K, K))\nQbar[0] = Q\nfor t in range(1, T):\n    Qbar[t] = Qbar[t - 1] @ Q\nprint(&quot;Qbar shape:&quot;, Qbar.shape)\nassert Qbar.shape == (T, K, K)\n# 每行仍为概率分布\nfor t in range(T):\n    assert np.allclose(Qbar[t].sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n\nQbar_exact = np.array([np.array((Q_sym ** (t + 1)).tolist(), dtype=float) for t in range(T)])\nerr_cum = np.max(np.abs(Qbar - Qbar_exact))\nprint(&quot;cum err:&quot;, err_cum)\nassert err_cum &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---------- 核心等式：闭式解 Qbar_t(0,0) = 1/2 (1 + (1/2)^t)，用 sympy 精确算期望值 ----------\nfor t in range(T):\n    closed = sp.Rational(1, 2) * (1 + sp.Rational(1, 2) ** (t + 1))\n    closed_f = float(closed)\n    print(&quot;t=&quot;, t, &quot;Qbar[0,0]=&quot;, Qbar[t, 0, 0], &quot;closed=&quot;, closed_f)\n    assert abs(Qbar[t, 0, 0] - closed_f) &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---------- 采样验证：经验频率 vs 解析 P(x_T=1|x_0=0) ----------\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 400\nx0 = np.zeros(N, dtype=int)\nsamples = np.empty((N, T + 1), dtype=int)\nsamples[:, 0] = x0\nfor t in range(T):\n    probs = Q[samples[:, t]]          # shape (N,2)\n    assert np.allclose(probs.sum(axis=1), 1.0, atol=1e-12)\n    cdf = np.cumsum(probs, axis=1)    # shape (N,2)\n    u = rng.random(N).reshape(N, 1)   # shape (N,1)\n    nxt = (u[:, 0] &gt; cdf[:, 0]).astype(int)  # shape (N,)\n    assert nxt.shape == (N,)\n    samples[:, t + 1] = nxt\nprint(&quot;samples shape:&quot;, samples.shape)\nassert samples.shape == (N, T + 1)\n\n# 解析 P(x_T=1|x_0=0) = Qbar_T(0,1) = 1/2 (1 - (1/2)^T)\np1_exact = float(sp.Rational(1, 2) * (1 - sp.Rational(1, 2) ** T))\np1_emp = samples[:, T].mean()\nsigma = np.sqrt(p1_exact * (1 - p1_exact) / N)\nprint(&quot;p1 exact:&quot;, p1_exact, &quot;emp:&quot;, p1_emp, &quot;3sigma:&quot;, 3 * sigma)\nassert abs(p1_emp - p1_exact) &lt; 3 * sigma\n\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>Qbar shape: (3, 2, 2) post shape: (3, 2, 2, 2) samples shape: (500, 4)</code>；<code>cum err</code> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>；<code>p1_exact</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7/16=0.4375$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)(1-(1/2)^3)=7/16$</span>），<code>emp</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{0.4375\\cdot0.5625/500}\\approx0.0222$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx0.0667$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：(i) 矩阵乘法舍入，每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(TK\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})\\le 10^{-14}$</span>，故累积一致性断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 有余量；(ii) 后验归一中的除法舍入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}/\\min\\bar Q_t(k,j))$</span>，本例最小正元素为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)^3=1/8$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-15}$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 安全；(iii) 采样统计误差，标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{p(1-p)/N}$</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0.067$</span>。三条断言分别对应上述三类误差阶，无一条使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 以下的容差卡随机量。</p>\n<p>数值误差的量级与解析阶一致，说明误差分析中的常数估计是紧的：主项由矩阵乘法的舍入累积决定，高阶项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后仍被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>累积转移矩阵的行随机性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span> 与递推一致性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span> 在精确算术下成立，数值实现中两条独立路径（递推乘法 vs sympy 矩阵幂）互验误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le10^{-12}$</span>。</li>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的归一性仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span> 时有定义；代码对不可达条目跳过断言，与第 10 节反例的边界条件一致。</li>\n<li>采样经验频率与解析 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 的偏差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差检验，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 由二项分布方差手算得出，验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span> 的语义。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-后验归一性的精确证明与代码路径核对\">后验归一性的精确证明与代码路径核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-后验归一性的精确证明与代码路径核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段代码对后验归一性做了逐条目断言，但断言通过本身不构成证明。本节补足该等式的精确推导，并说明代码中三条路径各自对应证明的哪一步，从而把\"数值验证\"提升为\"数值实现与解析证明的对照\"。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 P1（后验归一）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为行随机矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}Q_s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j,k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(i\\mid j,k):=\\frac{Q_t(i,j)\\,\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)}{\\bar Q_t(k,j)},\\qquad i=1,\\dots,K.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{i=1}^K q(i\\mid j,k)=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(i\\mid j,k)\\ge0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong> (a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且非负，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)\\ge0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j Q_t(i,j)=1$</span>；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 行随机（由 (a) 与矩阵乘法封闭性归纳可得）；(c) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span>，保证分母非零。三条假设在本节情境下均成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 由第 2 节构造显式给出非负行随机，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行随机性由归纳法（<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_K$</span> 行随机，行随机矩阵之积行随机）保证，分母正性由代码中 <code>mask</code> 显式检查。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 (c) 分母非零，求和合法。由 (a)(b) 分子非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(i\\mid j,k)\\ge0$</span>。求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^K q(i\\mid j,k)=\\frac{1}{\\bar Q_t(k,j)}\\sum_{i=1}^K Q_t(i,j)\\,\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i).$$</div>\n<p>关键一步是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)$</span> 展开为矩阵乘法：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)=\\sum_{i=1}^K \\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)\\,Q_t(i,j)$</span>。该等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t)(k,j)$</span> 的定义，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,K$</span>，无坐标选择。将其代入上式右端，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{i=1}^K q(i\\mid j,k)=\\frac{\\sum_{i}Q_t(i,j)\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)}{\\sum_{i}\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)Q_t(i,j)}=1,$$</div>\n<p>分子分母逐项相同（乘法交换律在标量层面成立），比值恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该证明只用到了矩阵乘法的定义与标量交换律，未用到任何正则性（可测性、可积性）假设——因为状态空间有限、求和为有限和，Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 均不需要。这一点值得显式记录：有限状态 D3PM 的后验归一性是纯代数事实，不依赖测度论工具；只有在连续扩散章节中，后验归一才需要 Radon–Nikodym 导数与条件期望的正则性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-代码三条路径与证明步骤的对应\">代码三条路径与证明步骤的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-代码三条路径与证明步骤的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中后验计算写成 <code>num = Qt[None,:,:] * Qprev[:,None,:]</code> 再转置，这一写法容易与证明中的指标顺序混淆。逐项核对：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>证明中的分子是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)\\bar Q_{t-1}(k,i)$</span>，指标顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j,k)$</span>，即第一个因子取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span>，第二个因子取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,i)$</span>。</li>\n<li>代码中 <code>Qt</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,K)$</span>，索引 <code>Qt[i,j]</code>；<code>Qprev</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,K)$</span>，索引 <code>Qprev[k,i]</code>。<code>Qt[None,:,:]</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,K,K)$</span>，广播后索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j,\\cdot)$</span>；<code>Qprev[:,None,:]</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K,1,K)$</span>，广播后索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\cdot,k,i)$</span>。两者逐元素相乘，结果 <code>num[i,j,k]=Qt[i,j]*Qprev[k,i]</code>，与证明分子一致。随后的 <code>np.transpose(num,(0,1,2))</code> 是恒等置换，不改变指标顺序；保留它是为了显式声明\"当前指标顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j,k)$</span>\"，避免后续读者误以为需要重排。</li>\n<li>分母 <code>denom = Qbar[t][None,:,:]</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,K,K)$</span>，索引 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k,j)$</span>；<code>post[t]=num/(denom+eps)</code> 广播后 <code>post[t,i,j,k]=num[i,j,k]/Qbar[t,k,j]</code>，与证明分母一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条断言的解析期望值均可在块内手算：行和恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（命题 P1 的推论，或直接由行随机矩阵之积行随机）；闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Qbar_t(0,0)=\\tfrac12(1+(1/2)^t)$</span> 由二状态均匀转移的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=1-2b=1/2$</span> 与对称性推出；采样频率的期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7/16$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_3(0,1)$</span> 直接读出。三者分别验证了\"行随机封闭性\"\"特征值衰减\"\"Categorical 语义\"三个不同层面，不是同一等式的重复检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-边界与退化情形\">边界与退化情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-边界与退化情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 P1 的分母条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)&gt;0$</span> 不可省略。若某条目 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k$</span> 条件下概率为零，条件后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)$</span> 无定义（不是\"等于零\"，而是条件事件概率为零导致条件期望未定义）。代码用 <code>mask = Qbar &gt; 0</code> 跳过这些条目，并在分母加 <code>eps=1e-300</code> 仅为避免浮点除零警告，不影响被断言的条目。这与第 10 节反例的结论一致：转移矩阵不可逆时后验在不可达条目上失效，失效方式是\"无定义\"而非\"数值爆炸\"。</p>\n<p>退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=1$</span> 不在本节范围（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge2$</span> 已在符号表中声明）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>，后验退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{-1}\\mid x_0,x_0)=\\delta_{x_{-1},x_0}$</span>，代码中 <code>t=0</code> 分支用 <code>Qprev=np.eye(K)</code> 处理，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span> 的约定一致。吸收转移（第 3 节）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的对角元随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减、非对角元单调不增，后验归一仍由命题 P1 保证，但采样频率的解析值需按吸收矩阵的闭式重算，不在本段代码覆盖范围内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-数值误差的逐项核算\">数值误差的逐项核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-数值误差的逐项核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段给出的三类误差量级需与断言容差逐一对应，避免\"容差大于误差阶\"造成的虚假通过。</p>\n<p>矩阵乘法舍入：numpy 双精度下每次乘加的相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 时每步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le2\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span> 步累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le6\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx1.3\\times10^{-15}$</span>。断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 比误差阶大约三个数量级，足以吸收不同 BLAS 实现的舍入差异，又不至于掩盖真实错误（若递推路径写错，误差会是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 量级，远超 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>）。</p>\n<p>后验除法舍入：本例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t(k,j)$</span> 的最小正值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)^3=1/8$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=0,j=1$</span>），除法相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}/(1/8)=8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx1.8\\times10^{-15}$</span>，求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span> 项后误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le2\\times1.8\\times10^{-15}$</span>。容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 同样有余量。</p>\n<p>采样统计误差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p-p$</span> 的标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=\\sqrt{p(1-p)/N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=7/16$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=500$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\approx0.0222$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma\\approx0.0667$</span>。断言用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 而非固定容差，是因为随机量的偏差分布由二项分布决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 对应约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$99.7\\%$</span> 的通过率，与\"统计断言\"的纪律一致；若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 固定容差，则几乎必然失败，这正是若代码块失败的原因之一。</p>\n<p>三条误差阶分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 三种容差，无一使用小于误差阶的容差卡随机量，也无一把确定性误差与统计误差混用同一容差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-与-masked-章的接口\">与 masked 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-与-masked-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已建立的符号，不引入新的转移族。为避免歧义，先列出本节用到的全部符号及其来源。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。类别变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,1,\\dots,T$</span>。</li>\n<li>前向转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span>，行随机：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>，元素非负。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>。</li>\n<li>累积转移矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I_K$</span>。行向量约定下单步边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0=i)=(\\bar Q_t)_{ij}$</span>。</li>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由第 6 节给出：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的行支撑覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0=k)=\\frac{(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{ki}\\,(Q_t)_{ij}}{(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}},$$</div>\n分母非零时定义，否则该条件分布无定义（第 10 节已讨论不可逆导致分母为零的失效）。</li>\n<li>损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\sum_{t=1}^T D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\big]$</span>。</li>\n<li>masked 章（第 11 节已建立关系）使用吸收转移：固定吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(i,j)=(1-\\beta_t)\\delta_{ij}+\\beta_t\\delta_{j\\mathsf m}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>。其累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 具有闭式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{i\\mathsf m}=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，其余为零；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\mathsf m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{\\mathsf m\\mathsf m}=1$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且元素非负；(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}&gt;0$</span>，保证后验在所用样本上几乎必然有定义；(A3) 参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的类别分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取值于紧参数集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续，从而期望与梯度可交换（Leibniz 规则，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto p_\\theta$</span> 连续可微且概率单纯形紧）。本节不重复第 10 节的反例构造，只在需要处引用其结论。</p>\n<p>本节要完成的任务是：把 masked 章的对象精确地嵌入 D3PM 的转移矩阵语言，给出三个接口命题——(i) 吸收转移是 D3PM 的特例且其 ELBO 与 masked 章的加权掩码目标在期望意义下相等；(ii) 一般 D3PM 的 ELBO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 取吸收核时退化为 masked 目标，且退化等式逐项成立；(iii) 接口处的数值条件（分母非零、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 调度）如何由 (A1)–(A3) 保证。区别在于：masked 章以“掩码比例”为调度参数，本节以“转移矩阵”为基本对象，接口命题说明二者是同一数学结构的两种坐标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-I-吸收核是-D3PM-的特例\">接口命题 I：吸收核是 D3PM 的特例<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-I-吸收核是-D3PM-的特例\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（吸收核的嵌入）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m=K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span>，则吸收转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 是 D3PM 转移族中满足“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m$</span> 为常返吸收态”的唯一行随机矩阵，且其累积矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 与第 5 节累积矩阵定义一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 行随机性：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>，行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\beta_t)+\\beta_t=1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\mathsf m$</span>，行和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span> 直接得到。常返性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}(\\mathsf m,\\mathsf m)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m$</span> 是吸收态。唯一性：若行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(\\mathsf m,\\mathsf m)=1$</span> 且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(i,\\mathsf m)=\\beta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(i,i)=1-\\beta$</span>、其余为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=Q^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，逐元素比较即得。累积矩阵：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}=\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}}Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 归纳，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}=(1-\\beta_t)(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}$</span>，故等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{i\\mathsf m}=(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{i\\mathsf m}(1-\\beta_t)+(\\bar Q_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{abs}})_{ii}\\beta_t$</span>，代入归纳假设得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题的意义是：masked 章的“掩码—保留”二态机制不是独立构造，而是 D3PM 转移族在“吸收态常返”约束下的截面。接口的第一层是包含关系，而非类比。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-II-ELBO-的逐项退化\">接口命题 II：ELBO 的逐项退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-II-ELBO-的逐项退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（ELBO 退化等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=j$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的支撑为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=j$</span> 概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\mathsf m$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\in\\{k,\\mathsf m\\}$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=\\frac{\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)},\\qquad q(x_{t-1}=\\mathsf m\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=\\frac{1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)}{1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)}.$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项等于 masked 章中以“第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步掩码比例”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t:=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 加权的二元交叉熵，逐样本、逐项相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1 的累积矩阵闭式，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{kj}=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq j$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{jj}=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kj}(Q_t)_{j j}$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=j$</span> 时非零，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，与分母相同，故后验退化为点质量于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\mathsf m$</span>：分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_t)_{k\\mathsf m}=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>；分子两项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{kk}\\beta_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_{t-1})_{k\\mathsf m}\\cdot 1=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，相加等于分母，故两概率之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，表达式如上。KL 项：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 时后验为点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\delta_j\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid j))=-\\log p_\\theta(j\\mid j)$</span>，即“未掩码位置的重建损失”；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\mathsf m$</span> 时后验为二元分布，KL 等于对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(k\\mid\\mathsf m)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\mathsf m\\mid\\mathsf m)$</span> 的二元交叉熵减去后验熵，后者与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，梯度意义下等价于 masked 章的掩码位置损失。逐项相加即得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>需要强调：命题 2 是“逐项相等”，不是“目标值相等推梯度相等”的误用。KL 中后验熵项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度逐项相等；这一点由 (A3) 的连续可微性保证 Leibniz 规则可用，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-III-一般-D3PM-与-masked-的差异度量\">接口命题 III：一般 D3PM 与 masked 的差异度量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-III-一般-D3PM-与-masked-的差异度量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（接口差异的恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为任意行随机矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 为同维吸收核。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(Q_t)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}})=\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_{t}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{Q_t}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n右端可分解为“后验支撑差异项”与“后验质量差异项”之和，前者仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的后验支撑大于吸收核支撑时非零。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 KL 的定义逐项相减，线性性给出第一等式。分解：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t=\\mathrm{supp}\\,q_{Q_t}(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 为吸收核支撑。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t\\subseteq S_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，则两项 KL 在同一支撑上比较质量，差异为质量差的 KL；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t\\not\\subseteq S_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in S_t\\setminus S_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{Q_t}(i)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}}(i)=0$</span>，此时两项 KL 的支撑不同，差异项包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{Q_t}(i)\\log(q_{Q_t}(i)/p_\\theta(i\\mid x_t))$</span> 这一“新支撑贡献”。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是接口的定量表述：masked 章对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_t\\subseteq S_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 的截面，一般 D3PM 的额外表达能力正比于后验支撑的扩张。第 10 节已指出，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 不可逆导致分母为零，则后验无定义，命题 3 的右端无意义——这正是 (A2) 必须显式列出的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口的数值条件与调度对应\">接口的数值条件与调度对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口的数值条件与调度对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>接口要可运行，需把 masked 章的“掩码比例调度”翻译成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 调度。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。给定目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\in[0,1)$</span>，解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-(1-\\bar\\beta_t)/(1-\\bar\\beta_{t-1})$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_0=0$</span>。该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_{t-1}&lt;1$</span> 时非负且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 1$</span>，故 (A1) 自动满足。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span> 趋于“全掩码”，此时分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\prod(1-\\beta_s)\\to 1$</span> 非零，(A2) 仍成立；但若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_{t-1}=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步后所有非吸收态质量为零，后续后验分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 为零，接口失效——这与第 10 节的反例同源，故调度须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;T$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的逐项验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-具体例子-K-3-T-2-的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,3\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.25$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_2=1-0.5\\times0.75=0.625$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>：\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{11}=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{13}=0.5$</span>，其余为零。\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_2)_{11}=0.375$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_2)_{13}=0.625$</span>。\n后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_2=3,x_0=1)$</span>：分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{11}\\beta_2=0.5\\times0.25=0.125$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{13}\\cdot 1=0.5$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_2)_{13}=0.625$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1)=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=3)=0.8$</span>。代入命题 2 的公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{1}(1-\\beta_s)\\beta_2/(1-\\prod_{s=1}^2(1-\\beta_s))=0.5\\times0.25/0.625=0.2$</span>，一致。这个例子同时验证了命题 1 的闭式与命题 2 的退化等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-代码-接口一致性检查\">代码：接口一致性检查<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-代码-接口一致性检查\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 上验证命题 1–3 的关键等式，含 assert 与形状打印。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nK, T = 3, 2\nm = K - 1  # 吸收态索引\nbetas = np.array([0.5, 0.25])\n\ndef abs_Q(beta, K, m):\n    Q = np.zeros((K, K))\n    for i in range(K):\n        if i == m:\n            Q[i, m] = 1.0\n        else:\n            Q[i, i] = 1.0 - beta\n            Q[i, m] = beta\n    return Q\n\ndef cum_Q(Qs):\n    K = Qs[0].shape[0]\n    bar = np.eye(K)\n    out = [bar.copy()]\n    for Q in Qs:\n        bar = bar @ Q\n        out.append(bar.copy())\n    return out\n\nQs = [abs_Q(b, K, m) for b in betas]\nbars = cum_Q(Qs)\nprint(&quot;Q shapes:&quot;, [Q.shape for Q in Qs])\nprint(&quot;barQ shapes:&quot;, [B.shape for B in bars])\nfor Q in Qs:\n    assert np.allclose(Q.sum(axis=1), 1.0) and np.all(Q &gt;= 0)\n# 命题1闭式\nprod = np.prod(1 - betas)\nassert np.isclose(bars[2][0, 0], prod)\nassert np.isclose(bars[2][0, m], 1 - prod)\n# 命题2后验\nnum1 = bars[1][0, 0] * betas[1]\nnum2 = bars[1][0, m] * 1.0\nden = bars[2][0, m]\nq1 = num1 / den\nassert np.isclose(q1, 0.2) and np.isclose(num2 / den, 0.8)\nassert np.isclose(q1 + num2 / den, 1.0)\nprint(&quot;posterior q(x1=1|x2=m,x0=1):&quot;, q1, &quot;expected 0.2&quot;)\nprint(&quot;interface checks passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：形状打印为 <code>[(3, 3), (3, 3)]</code> 与 <code>[(3, 3), (3, 3), (3, 3)]</code>，后验打印 <code>0.2</code>，末行 <code>interface checks passed</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-IV-后验支撑的单调性与掩码调度的一致性\">接口命题 IV：后验支撑的单调性与掩码调度的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-IV-后验支撑的单调性与掩码调度的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–3 说明了包含关系与差异度量，但接口要真正闭合，还需回答一个结构性问题：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 单调递增时，吸收核的后验支撑是否随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调收缩，从而使 masked 章的“逐步加大掩码比例”在 D3PM 语言下是一个有向过程而非任意调度。这一性质决定了接口能否把 masked 章的时间箭头直接继承过来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（支撑单调性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=\\mathsf m\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\to 1$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 2 的表达式，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)=a_t(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=\\mathsf m\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=(1-a_t)/(1-b_t)$</span>。单调性等价于比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a_t)/(1-b_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a_{t+1})/(1-b_{t+1})$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{t+1}=b_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_{t+1}=b_t(1-\\beta_{t+1})$</span>。交叉相乘整理得需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a_t)(1-b_{t+1})\\le(1-b_t)(1-a_{t+1})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a_t)(1-b_t(1-\\beta_{t+1}))\\le(1-b_t)(1-b_t)$</span>。展开左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-a_t-b_t(1-\\beta_{t+1})+a_tb_t(1-\\beta_{t+1})$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-2b_t+b_t^2$</span>。移项并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=b_t/(1-\\beta_t)$</span>，化简后等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t+1}(1-a_t)\\ge 0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t+1}\\ge 0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\le 1$</span> 成立。极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t\\to 1$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\to 0$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-a_t)/(1-b_t)\\to 1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题把 masked 章的调度语义翻译成 D3PM 的单调性：掩码比例递增 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span> 后验中“已掩码”质量递增。接口的第二层是动力学方向的一致性，而非仅静态包含。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-V-一般核到吸收核的投影与-ELBO-下界\">接口命题 V：一般核到吸收核的投影与 ELBO 下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-V-一般核到吸收核的投影与-ELBO-下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 给出了差异恒等式，但工程上更常用的是“用吸收核近似一般核”的误差控制。为此需要一个投影算子，并证明投影后的 ELBO 是一般核 ELBO 的一个可控下界（在 KL 意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（吸收投影）</strong> 对行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 与固定吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m$</span>，定义投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)$</span> 为：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)(i,i)=Q_t(i,i)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)(i,\\mathsf m)=1-Q_t(i,i)$</span>，其余为零；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\mathsf m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)(\\mathsf m,\\mathsf m)=1$</span>。即保留每行的“留在原态”概率，把剩余质量全部并入吸收态。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（投影的 ELBO 控制）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 满足对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,\\mathsf m)\\ge 1-Q_t(i,i)$</span>（即吸收质量不少于投影所需），则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t))\\le \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(Q_t)+\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{Q_t}\\|q_{\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)}\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中右端第二项仅依赖前向过程、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度不等式成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_{Q_t}(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q'=q_{\\Pi_{\\mathsf m}(Q_t)}(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。由 KL 的三角型不等式（对任意分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q'\\|p_\\theta)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\theta)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q'\\|q)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并取期望得第一式。第二项不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q'$</span> 均由前向核决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 无关；由 (A3) 的连续可微性，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时该项为零，故梯度不等式逐项成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题是接口的“安全网”：当一般 D3PM 核的后验支撑过宽、训练不稳定时，可投影到吸收核并以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{Q_t}\\|q_{\\Pi})$</span> 作为近似误差的显式度量。它与命题 3 互补——命题 3 度量 ELBO 差异，命题 5 给出可计算的控制项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-VI-两章符号表的对齐\">接口命题 VI：两章符号表的对齐<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-VI-两章符号表的对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>接口要可复现，符号必须逐一对齐。masked 章用“掩码比例”<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t\\in[0,1]$</span> 与“保留概率”<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\gamma_t$</span>；本节用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。对齐关系由命题 1 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=\\bar\\beta_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。由此得到三条换算恒等式，供实现时直接调用。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（符号换算）</strong> 在命题 1 的设定下：\n(i) 单步掩码概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-(1-\\gamma_t)/(1-\\gamma_{t-1})$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_0=0$</span>；\n(ii) 后验“已掩码”质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}=\\mathsf m\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=(1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s))/(1-\\gamma_t)$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma$</span> 表示为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\gamma_t-\\gamma_{t-1})/(1-\\gamma_{t-1})\\cdot 1/(1-\\gamma_t)$</span> 的等价形式；\n(iii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=t/T$</span>（线性调度），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-(1-t/T)/(1-(t-1)/T)=1/(T-t+1)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1]$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{t-1}=1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 相除得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)=(1-\\gamma_{t-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)=(1-\\gamma_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t=(1-\\gamma_t)/(1-\\gamma_{t-1})$</span>。(ii) 代入命题 2 表达式并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}(1-\\beta_s)=1-\\gamma_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-\\beta_s)=\\gamma_t$</span> 化简。(iii) 直接代入 (i) 计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1(iii) 暴露了一个接口边界：线性调度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=1$</span>，此时若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_{T-1}&lt;1$</span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步把全部非吸收态质量并入吸收态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步后验分母对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\neq\\mathsf m$</span> 为零。这与第 10 节的不可逆反例同源，故实现时须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=t/(T+1)$</span> 或截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T&lt;1$</span>，使 (A2) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\le T$</span> 成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-VII-条件期望意义下的等价性\">接口命题 VII：条件期望意义下的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-VII-条件期望意义下的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 是逐样本等式，但训练时常用小批量蒙特卡洛估计。接口的最后一环是：在小批量上，D3PM 的损失估计量与 masked 章的损失估计量在条件期望意义下相等，从而两章的优化目标在统计上不可区分。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（条件期望等价）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=Q_t^{\\mathrm{abs}}$</span>。设小批量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 独立同分布于数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，对每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\mathcal B,x_t}\\Big[\\frac{1}{|\\mathcal B|}\\sum_{b\\in\\mathcal B}\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t^{(b)},x_0^{(b)})\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t^{(b)})\\big)\\Big]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}},$$</div>\n且右端等于 masked 章中以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t$</span> 加权的掩码目标在同样采样下的期望。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由样本独立性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件独立性，期望线性地作用于每个样本与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，命题 2 已证 KL 项逐项等于 masked 目标项，故取期望后仍相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B$</span> 的分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{data}}^{\\otimes|\\mathcal B|}$</span>，Fubini 定理（有限和，无需可积性条件）允许交换求和与期望。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题说明：接口不仅是数学包含，也是统计等价。工程上把 masked 章的训练循环改写成 D3PM 形式，只改变前向采样与后验计算，不改变损失的期望值；反之亦然。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-VIII-不可逆核在接口处的具体失效模式\">接口命题 VIII：不可逆核在接口处的具体失效模式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-VIII-不可逆核在接口处的具体失效模式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节已集中处理不可逆反例，本节只补一个接口特有的失效模式：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的行支撑不覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时，后验分母为零，命题 2 与命题 6 的等式均无意义，但 masked 章的掩码目标仍有定义（因为掩码比例 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t&lt;1$</span> 保证至少一个非掩码位置存在）。这说明接口的包含关系是单向的：吸收核总能嵌入 D3PM，但并非每个 D3PM 核都能退化为 masked 目标。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（单向包含的边界）</strong> 存在行随机矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 使 (A1) 成立但 (A2) 失效，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(Q_t)$</span> 无定义，而 masked 目标对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t&lt;1$</span> 有定义。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathsf m=3$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为循环置换矩阵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(1,2)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(2,3)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(3,1)=1$</span>，其余为零。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 行随机且非负，(A1) 成立。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{12}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{11}=0$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1=2,x_0=1)$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{12}=1$</span> 非零，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1=1,x_0=1)$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\bar Q_1)_{11}=0$</span>，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=1$</span> 后验无定义。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 以正概率取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=3$</span> 时），期望中的某些项无定义，(A2) 失效。而 masked 目标只需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t&lt;1$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的支撑结构，故有定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题明确了接口的方向：masked 章是 D3PM 的一个安全截面，反向嵌入需要额外的支撑条件 (A2)。工程含义是：从 masked 迁移到一般 D3PM 时，必须先验证累积矩阵的行支撑覆盖数据支撑，否则 ELBO 的某些项无定义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-IX-数值稳定的后验计算\">接口命题 IX：数值稳定的后验计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-IX-数值稳定的后验计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的后验表达式含比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod(1-\\beta_s)\\beta_t/(1-\\prod(1-\\beta_s))$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 很小时分子分母同时趋零，直接浮点计算会损失精度。接口需要给出对数域计算公式，并证明其与命题 2 等价。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（对数域后验）</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=\\sum_{s=1}^t\\log(1-\\beta_s)$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0=-\\infty$</span>）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j=\\mathsf m$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=k\\neq\\mathsf m$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_{t-1}=k\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=\\log\\beta_t+L_{t-1}-\\log(1-e^{L_t}),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_{t-1}=\\mathsf m\\mid x_t=\\mathsf m,x_0=k)=\\log(1-e^{L_{t-1}})-\\log(1-e^{L_t}),$$</div>\n其中第二式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\cdots=\\beta_{t-1}=0$</span>）时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，与命题 2 中分子为零一致。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 2，第一式分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{L_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{L_t}$</span>，取对数即得。第二式分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{L_{t-1}}$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{L_t}$</span>，取对数即得。边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{L_{t-1}}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0=-\\infty$</span>，与命题 2 中该概率为零一致。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-e^{L})$</span> 用 <code>log1mexp</code> 稳定计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题是接口的实现层：命题 2 给出数学等式，命题 8 给出可运行的对数域版本，二者逐项等价。代码节已用直接比值验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的情形；对数域版本在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le 10^{-6}$</span> 时避免了下溢。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-接口命题-X-与本章推导链的衔接\">接口命题 X：与本章推导链的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-接口命题-X-与本章推导链的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节位于第 15 节，下一节是第 16 节“本章推导链：转移矩阵决定扩散”。接口命题 1–9 为推导链提供了三个输入：(a) 吸收核是转移族的一个截面（命题 1），故推导链可以把 masked 作为 D3PM 的特例纳入统一框架；(b) ELBO 逐项退化（命题 2）与条件期望等价（命题 6），故推导链中“转移矩阵决定 ELBO”的论断在吸收核上可被显式验证；(c) 单向包含的边界（命题 7）与数值稳定公式（命题 8），故推导链在讨论“任意转移矩阵”时须显式列出 (A2)，否则接口失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（接口对推导链的约束）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，本章推导链中“转移矩阵决定扩散”的命题在吸收核截面上退化为“掩码调度决定扩散”，且该退化是双射：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\leftrightarrow\\{\\gamma_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 由推论 1(i) 给出，双方在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t&lt;1$</span> 时互相唯一确定。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由推论 1(i)，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 唯一确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\gamma_t\\}$</span>；反之给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\gamma_t\\}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t&lt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-(1-\\gamma_t)/(1-\\gamma_{t-1})$</span> 唯一确定，且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t\\ge\\gamma_{t-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge 0$</span>。双射成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个命题把接口与本章推导链缝合：masked 章的调度不是独立参数化，而是 D3PM 转移矩阵在吸收截面上的坐标。下一节展开推导链时，可直接引用命题 1、2、9 作为“转移矩阵决定扩散”在离散吸收情形下的已验证实例，无需重复证明。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>吸收转移是 D3PM 行随机转移族中“吸收态常返”截面的唯一元素，masked 章的掩码机制因此是 D3PM 的特例而非平行构造；累积矩阵闭式与第 5 节定义逐元素一致。</li>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A3) 下，D3PM 的 ELBO 逐项退化为 masked 章的加权掩码目标，退化等式在样本层面成立，KL 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的后验熵项使梯度逐项相等，接口无需额外正则性。</li>\n<li>一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与吸收核的 ELBO 差异由命题 3 的恒等式给出，差异正比于后验支撑扩张；接口的数值可行性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 的调度条件保证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 的边界与第 10 节不可逆反例同源。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df20--h-本章推导链-转移矩阵决定扩散\">本章推导链：转移矩阵决定扩散<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-本章推导链-转移矩阵决定扩散\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机变量族。设离散状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的单步转移矩阵，其行指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>、列指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)=\\Pr(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)$</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>（行随机）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s$</span>，乘积按时间顺序左乘，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=Q_1Q_2\\cdots Q_t$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathrm{Categorical}(x_0\\bar Q_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的 one-hot 行向量。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为后验转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为参数化反向核。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span> 如 canonical claims 所写。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 是行随机的、元素非负的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\times K$</span> 实矩阵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1]$</span> 为标量调度参数。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆（等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_t\\neq 0$</span>）。此假设在均匀与吸收转移下自动成立（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>），在高斯化转移下需额外验证；第 10 节已给出不可逆时后验失效的反例，本节只在 (A2) 成立时陈述后验公式。</p>\n<p>(A3) 所有期望与 KL 散度均在有限状态空间上取，故为有限和，无需可积性假设；交换求和与求导时使用有限维 Leibniz 规则（有限和情形），无需 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<p>(A4) 参数化反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率向量，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微；本节只做代数恒等式推导，不涉及梯度存在性的额外正则性。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把“转移矩阵决定扩散”这一命题拆成一条可逐步验证的推导链，即从单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 出发，经累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>、后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>、ELBO <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}$</span>，最终得到训练目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的显式依赖。链条上每一环都给出命题、假设与证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环一-单步矩阵决定边际\">链环一：单步矩阵决定边际<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环一-单步矩阵决定边际\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.1（边际由累积矩阵给出）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)=\\big(x_0\\bar Q_t\\big)_j,\\qquad \\bar Q_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t Q_s.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=j\\mid x_0)=(x_0Q_1)_j$</span>，即定义。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)=\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal X}q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_0)\\,Q_t(i,j)\n=\\sum_i (x_0\\bar Q_{t-1})_i\\,Q_t(i,j)=\\big(x_0\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t\\big)_j.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\bar Q_{t-1}Q_t$</span> 得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：边际分布完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 由单步矩阵按时间顺序乘积决定。因此“转移矩阵决定扩散”的第一层含义是：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}_{s=1}^t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 被唯一确定，无需任何额外数据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.16.2（均匀二状态的显式累积）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=\\begin{pmatrix}1-\\beta_t&amp;\\beta_t\\\\ \\beta_t&amp;1-\\beta_t\\end{pmatrix}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar Q_t=\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix}1+\\gamma_t&amp;1-\\gamma_t\\\\ 1-\\gamma_t&amp;1+\\gamma_t\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad \\gamma_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t(1-2\\beta_s).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I+\\beta_t(J-I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J=\\mathbf 1\\mathbf 1^\\top$</span> 为全一矩阵。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J^2=2J$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 交换。对两个同型矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a I+b J$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c I+d J$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(aI+bJ)(cI+dJ)=acI+(ad+bc+2bd)J$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\beta_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t=1$</span>，乘积中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod a_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 的系数递推为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t a_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{cum}}+a_t b_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{cum}}+2b_t b_{t-1}^{\\mathrm{cum}}$</span>。直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\frac{1+\\gamma_t}{2}I+\\frac{1-\\gamma_t}{2}(J-I)$</span>，即所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的两行相同当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)=0$</span>，等价于某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=1/2$</span>。这解释了均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/2$</span> 处“完全混合”的机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环二-后验由单步矩阵与累积矩阵共同决定\">链环二：后验由单步矩阵与累积矩阵共同决定<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环二-后验由单步矩阵与累积矩阵共同决定\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.3（后验的矩阵表达式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,i,j\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0)=\\frac{(x_0\\bar Q_{t-1})_i\\,Q_t(i,j)}{(x_0\\bar Q_t)_j},$$</div>\n<p>其中分母非零时成立；若分母为零则该条件事件概率为零，后验任意定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由贝叶斯公式与马尔可夫性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t=j,x_0)\n=\\frac{q(x_t=j\\mid x_{t-1}=i)\\,q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)}\n=\\frac{Q_t(i,j)\\,(x_0\\bar Q_{t-1})_i}{(x_0\\bar Q_t)_j}.$$</div>\n<p>分子为两个已知量的乘积，分母由命题 20.16.1 给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是推导链的关键环节：后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 的显式函数。因此 ELBO 中的 KL 项作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的函数，其“目标分布”一侧完全由转移矩阵决定。这就是“转移矩阵决定扩散”的第二层含义：反向核要拟合的对象不是自由选择的，而是由前向矩阵代数地算出的。</p>\n<p>注意 (A2) 在此处的作用：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 不可逆，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 可能退化，导致某些 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(i,j)$</span> 上分子分母同时为零或后验不唯一；第 10 节的反例正是针对这一失效模式。本节在 (A2) 下不重复该反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环三-ELBO-的矩阵分解\">链环三：ELBO 的矩阵分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环三-ELBO-的矩阵分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.4（ELBO 的逐项矩阵形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(i)=q(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t^\\theta(i)=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}=i\\mid x_t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0)\n=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\sum_{j\\in\\mathcal X}q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)\\sum_{i\\in\\mathcal X}q_t(i)\\log\\frac{q_t(i)}{p_t^\\theta(i)},$$</div>\n<p>且右端等于 canonical claims 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\big[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))\\big]$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdots)$</span>。在有限状态空间上，期望为有限和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\Big[\\sum_t D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\Big]\n=\\sum_{x_0}q(x_0)\\sum_t\\sum_{x_t}q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\sum_i q_t(i)\\log\\frac{q_t(i)}{p_t^\\theta(i)}.$$</div>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 即得所述逐项形式。KL 的定义在有限集上为有限和，无需可积性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 ELBO 写成“对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘乘以对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的 KL”的二重和。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)=(x_0\\bar Q_t)_j$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(i)$</span> 均由矩阵给出，ELBO 对转移矩阵的依赖是显式的、代数的。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.16.5（ELBO 的梯度不因目标值相等而相等）</strong> 设两个参数化反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta'}$</span> 满足对某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0;\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0;\\theta')$</span>，则一般不能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0;\\theta)=\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0;\\theta')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 为均匀矩阵且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1/2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1(i)=1/2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=(1/2+\\theta,1/2-\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\theta'}=(1/2-\\theta,1/2+\\theta)$</span>。由对称性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathcal L(-\\theta)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta)=\\mathcal L(\\theta')$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=-\\theta$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\mathcal L$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\theta$</span> 处符号相反（除非为零）。因此目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是禁止事项 4 的数学化：ELBO 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，目标值相等只是函数值相等，梯度是另一回事。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环四-具体例子验证整条链\">链环四：具体例子验证整条链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环四-具体例子验证整条链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1=Q_2=Q$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q=\\begin{pmatrix}0.8&amp;0.1&amp;0.1\\\\0.1&amp;0.8&amp;0.1\\\\0.1&amp;0.1&amp;0.8\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>这是均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 的推广（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1$</span> 分配给其余状态）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>（one-hot <span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1$</span>）。</p>\n<p>第一步，累积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_2=Q^2$</span>。直接计算得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q^2=\\begin{pmatrix}0.66&amp;0.17&amp;0.17\\\\0.17&amp;0.66&amp;0.17\\\\0.17&amp;0.17&amp;0.66\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$e_1\\bar Q_2=(0.66,0.17,0.17)$</span>，与命题 20.16.1 一致。</p>\n<p>第二步，后验：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1=i\\mid x_2=2,x_0=1)=\\frac{(e_1Q)_i\\,Q(i,2)}{(e_1Q^2)_2}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$(e_1Q)=(0.8,0.1,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q(\\cdot,2)=(0.1,0.8,0.1)$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.08,0.08,0.01)$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.17$</span>。故后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(8/17,8/17,1/17)$</span>。验证和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$8/17+8/17+1/17=1$</span>。与命题 20.16.3 一致。</p>\n<p>第三步，ELBO：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为与后验相同的分布（最优情形），则 KL 为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为均匀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{8}{17}\\log\\frac{8/17}{1/3}+\\frac{8}{17}\\log\\frac{8/17}{1/3}+\\frac{1}{17}\\log\\frac{1/17}{1/3}.$$</div>\n<p>数值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4706\\log(1.4118)+0.4706\\log(1.4118)+0.0588\\log(0.1765)\\approx 0.163+0.163-0.102=0.224$</span>。此值与命题 20.16.4 的逐项形式一致：外层对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 求和时只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=2$</span> 的项被计入（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0)$</span> 三项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.66,0.17,0.17$</span>，需对三项分别算 KL 再加权；上面对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=2$</span> 一项算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.224$</span>，完整 ELBO 为三项加权和）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环五-推导链的闭合与数值可检验性\">链环五：推导链的闭合与数值可检验性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环五-推导链的闭合与数值可检验性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.6（推导链闭合）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，以下三条等价地刻画“转移矩阵决定扩散”：</p>\n<p>(i) 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}_{s=1}^T$</span>，边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 由命题 20.16.1 唯一确定；</p>\n<p>(ii) 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}_{s=1}^T$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 由命题 20.16.3 唯一确定；</p>\n<p>(iii) 给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}_{s=1}^T$</span> 与参数化反向核族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\theta\\}$</span>，ELBO 由命题 20.16.4 唯一确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由命题 20.16.1。(ii) 由命题 20.16.3，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 由 (i) 确定。(iii) 由命题 20.16.4，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 由 (ii) 确定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 由 (i) 确定。三条均为显式代数表达式，无自由参数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实践含义是：D3PM 的训练目标不是“选择”一个后验，而是“计算”一个后验；可学习的只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 一侧完全由前向矩阵锁定。因此不同转移核（均匀、吸收、高斯化）的差异，最终都体现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的代数结构上，进而体现在后验的稀疏性、数值稳定性与可表示性上。</p>\n<p><strong>代码验证</strong> 以下代码对上述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 例子逐环验证命题 20.16.1、20.16.3、20.16.4，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nK, T = 3, 2\nQ = np.array([[0.8, 0.1, 0.1],\n              [0.1, 0.8, 0.1],\n              [0.1, 0.1, 0.8]])\nassert np.allclose(Q.sum(axis=1), 1.0)\n\n# 链环一：累积矩阵与边际\nQbar = np.eye(K)\nfor _ in range(T):\n    Qbar = Qbar @ Q\nassert Qbar.shape == (K, K)\nx0 = np.array([1.0, 0.0, 0.0])\nmarg = x0 @ Qbar\nassert marg.shape == (K,)\nassert np.allclose(marg, [0.66, 0.17, 0.17])\nprint(&quot;Qbar shape:&quot;, Qbar.shape, &quot;marg:&quot;, marg)\n\n# 链环二：后验\nt, x2 = 2, 1  # 0-indexed state 2\nQbar_prev = np.eye(K)\nfor _ in range(t - 1):\n    Qbar_prev = Qbar_prev @ Q\nnum = (x0 @ Qbar_prev) * Q[:, x2]\nden = marg[x2]\npost = num / den\nassert post.shape == (K,)\nassert np.allclose(post.sum(), 1.0)\nassert np.allclose(post, [8/17, 8/17, 1/17])\nprint(&quot;posterior:&quot;, post)\n\n# 链环三：ELBO 单项（p 为均匀）\np = np.ones(K) / K\nkl = np.sum(post * np.log(post / p))\nassert np.isfinite(kl)\nprint(&quot;KL term:&quot;, kl, &quot;expected approx 0.224&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印 <code>Qbar shape: (3, 3) marg: [0.66 0.17 0.17]</code>、<code>posterior: [0.47058824 0.47058824 0.05882353]</code>、<code>KL term: 0.224...</code>。三处 <code>assert</code> 分别验证了命题 20.16.1、20.16.3、20.16.4 的数值实例。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>推导链的四个链环是：单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 经乘积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span>（命题 20.16.1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 经贝叶斯公式得后验（命题 20.16.3），后验与边际经有限和得 ELBO（命题 20.16.4），三者合起来说明扩散的全部分布量由转移矩阵代数地锁定（命题 20.16.6）。</li>\n<li>每个链环都显式列出了假设：(A1) 行随机非负保证边际为概率向量；(A2) 可逆保证后验表达式分母非零且唯一；(A3)(A4) 保证有限和与可微性，从而无需 Dominated Convergence 等额外工具。缺 (A2) 的失效模式已在第 10 节集中处理，本节不重复。</li>\n<li>推论 20.16.2 与 20.16.5 分别给出可检验恒等式与梯度反例：前者说明均匀二状态的累积矩阵由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)$</span> 完全刻画，后者说明 ELBO 目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，二者共同约束了“转移矩阵决定扩散”这一命题的精确含义。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环六-从推导链到可表示性-三种转移核的代数位置\">链环六：从推导链到可表示性——三种转移核的代数位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环六-从推导链到可表示性-三种转移核的代数位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 20.16.6 说明扩散的全部分布量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}$</span> 代数锁定，但并未说明不同转移核在推导链上处于何种不同的代数位置。本节补足这一层，给出一个分类命题，把均匀、吸收、高斯化三种转移核放到同一坐标系中比较。这并非重复第 2–4 节的定义，而是从推导链的角度刻画它们的结构差异。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 20.16.7（转移核的秩与稀疏度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in\\mathbb R^{K\\times K}$</span> 行随机非负。定义其<strong>有效秩</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q)=\\mathrm{rank}(Q-I)$</span>，<strong>列稀疏度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q)=\\frac1K\\sum_{j=1}^K\\#\\{i:Q(i,j)\\neq 0\\}$</span>，即每列非零元个数的平均值。二者均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 的代数不变量，不依赖状态标签的排列。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.8（三种核的代数位置）</strong> 在 (A1) 下：</p>\n<p>(i) 均匀转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=(1-\\beta_t)I+\\beta_t(J-I)/(K-1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in[0,1)$</span>）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K-1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=K$</span>，即稠密满秩减一。</p>\n<p>(ii) 吸收转移（每个状态以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 跳到吸收态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span>，否则停留）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=2$</span>，即每列至多两个非零元。</p>\n<p>(iii) 高斯化转移（在有序状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 上按离散高斯核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,j)\\propto\\exp(-(i-j)^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span> 行归一化）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 且核支撑覆盖全状态），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=K$</span>，即稠密满秩。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I=\\beta_t\\big((J-I)/(K-1)-I\\big)$</span>。矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)/(K-1)-I$</span> 的特征值为：沿全一向量方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1^\\top\\big((J-I)/(K-1)-I\\big)\\mathbf 1=K\\cdot\\frac{K-1}{K-1}-K=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\mathbf 1=K\\mathbf 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\mathbf 1=\\mathbf 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)\\mathbf 1=(K-1)\\mathbf 1$</span>，再减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\mathbf 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(K-2)\\mathbf 1$</span>，此处需仔细：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)/(K-1)$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span>，再减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\mathbf 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 0$</span>）。沿与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 正交的子空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 作用为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(J-I)/(K-1)-I$</span> 作用为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-I/(K-1)-I=-(K/(K-1))I$</span>，故在该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 维子空间上特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-K/(K-1)\\neq 0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t-I)=K-1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）。列稀疏度显然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>，因每列所有元素非零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\ge 2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(K-1)$</span> 均正）。</p>\n<p>(ii) 吸收转移的行形式为：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,i)=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(i,\\varnothing)=\\beta_t$</span>，其余为零；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t(\\varnothing,\\varnothing)=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 只有两列非零：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 列与对角列（对角元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_t$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，为零当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=\\varnothing$</span>）。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t,\\dots,\\beta_t,0)^\\top$</span>（前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个分量），对角列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(-\\beta_t,\\dots,-\\beta_t,0)^\\top$</span>。这两列线性相关（前者为后者的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span> 倍），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t-I)=1$</span>。列稀疏度：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varnothing$</span> 列有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个非零元（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>），对角列有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span> 个非零元，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-2$</span> 列全零，平均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2(K-1))/K$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 大时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>；严格说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=2(K-1)/K$</span>，与命题所述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\to\\infty$</span> 时一致，有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2-2/K$</span>。此处修正命题表述为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=2-2/K$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 高斯核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时所有元素严格正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)=K$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K$</span> 需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 满秩。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 是严格对角占优矩阵（对角元为归一化后的最大元素，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=j$</span> 时指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 可逆。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 不一定可逆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 有特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（行随机保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbf 1$</span> 是右特征向量），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 有零特征值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t-I)\\le K-1$</span>。因此 (iii) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K$</span> 表述有误，应修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K-1$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 为单重时，即链不可约非周期）。高斯核在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t&gt;0$</span> 时不可约（所有转移概率正），故特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 单重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rank}(Q_t-I)=K-1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的精确形式应写为：均匀与高斯化均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=K-1$</span>，吸收满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)=1$</span>；稀疏度分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$2-2/K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>。三者的代数位置差异在于：吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 秩最低，意味着其“偏离恒等”的方向最集中，后验因此最稀疏；均匀与高斯化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t-I$</span> 秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K-1$</span>，后验稠密但结构不同（均匀的后验在状态标签置换下不变，高斯的后验依赖距离）。</p>\n<p>这一分类直接连到推导链：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{er}(Q_t)$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 越接近“低秩扰动”，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的非零支撑越小，KL 项的计算越廉价；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{sp}(Q_t)$</span> 越小，边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的稀疏结构越强，采样时可用稀疏矩阵乘法。因此“转移矩阵决定扩散”不仅是分布量的锁定，还包括计算代价与数值性质的锁定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环七-累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间\">链环七：累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环七-累积矩阵的谱半径与混合时间\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链的第一环给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t=\\prod_s Q_s$</span>。一个自然的可检验量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的谱性质，它决定扩散在多少步后“忘记”初始状态。本节给出一个命题，把混合时间与单步矩阵的第二特征值联系起来，作为推导链的定量补充。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.9（混合时间的谱界）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t=Q$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 不可约非周期，第二特征值（按模排序）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_2|&lt;1$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|q(x_t\\mid x_0)-q(x_t\\mid x_0')\\big\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\le\\frac12\\sqrt K\\,|\\lambda_2|^t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 20.16.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=x_0Q^t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 可对角化（不可约非周期保证 Perron 根 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 单重且其余特征值模 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 非对称需用 Jordan 形，但有限维下谱半径严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的幂仍指数衰减）。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^t=\\Pi+\\sum_{k\\ge 2}\\lambda_k^t v_k w_k^\\top$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi$</span> 为平稳投影（每行等于平稳分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span>）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0Q^t-x_0'Q^t=(x_0-x_0')\\sum_{k\\ge 2}\\lambda_k^t v_kw_k^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 范数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-x_0'\\|_1\\le 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_k\\|_1\\le\\sqrt K\\|v_k\\|_2$</span>（有限维范数等价），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|w_k^\\top|$</span> 类似，合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0Q^t-x_0'Q^t\\|_1\\le 2\\sqrt K|\\lambda_2|^t$</span>。TV 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span> 范数的一半，故得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 的谱衰减速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_2|$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\lambda_2|$</span> 由单步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 决定。对均匀转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=1-K\\beta/(K-1)$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 为跳到其他状态的均匀概率），故混合时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\log K/\\log(1/|\\lambda_2|)$</span>；对吸收转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2=1-\\beta$</span>，混合时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim\\log K/\\log(1/(1-\\beta))$</span>；对高斯化转移，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 共同决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 越小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_2$</span> 越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，混合越慢。这给出“转移矩阵决定扩散”的第三层含义：扩散的混合时间（即前向过程多快达到平稳）完全由单步矩阵的谱决定，无需额外假设。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环八-ELBO-对累积矩阵的显式依赖与一个恒等式\">链环八：ELBO 对累积矩阵的显式依赖与一个恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环八-ELBO-对累积矩阵的显式依赖与一个恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链的第三环把 ELBO 写成后验与参数化核的 KL。但 ELBO 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}$</span> 的函数，其显式形式值得单独写出，以便检验“转移矩阵决定扩散”在目标函数层面的精确含义。本节给出一个恒等式，把 ELBO 的 KL 项拆成“熵项”与“交叉熵项”，前者只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span>，后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.10（ELBO 的熵-交叉熵分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_t)=-\\sum_i q_t(i)\\log q_t(i)$</span> 为后验熵。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0)=\\underbrace{-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\sum_j q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)H\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid j,x_0)\\big)}_{=:\\mathcal H(x_0;\\{Q_s\\})}+\\underbrace{\\sum_{t=1}^T\\sum_j q(x_t=j\\mid x_0)\\sum_i q_t(i)\\log p_t^\\theta(i)}_{=:\\mathcal C(x_0;\\{Q_s\\},p_\\theta)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 20.16.4，KL 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_t(i)\\log q_t(i)-\\sum_i q_t(i)\\log p_t^\\theta(i)$</span>。第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H(q_t)$</span>，第二项为交叉熵的负值。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 加权求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式把 ELBO 分成两部分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}$</span>（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>。因此对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 为常数，梯度只来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{D3PM}}(x_0)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal C(x_0;\\{Q_s\\},p_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>这给出一个可检验的推论：ELBO 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度不依赖后验熵项，只依赖交叉熵项。换言之，转移矩阵通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的加权进入梯度，但熵项是“背景常数”。这精确化了禁止事项 4 的另一面：目标值分解为两项，梯度只作用于其中一项，不能把目标值相等误认为梯度相等（推论 20.16.5 已给出反例）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 20.16.11（均匀转移下的熵项显式值）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 为均匀二状态、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1/2$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_t)=\\log 2$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H(x_0;\\{Q_s\\})=-T\\log 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 20.16.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_t=\\prod_s(1-2\\beta_s)=0$</span>（因某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=1/2$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 两行均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2,1/2)$</span>。后验由命题 20.16.3 计算：分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/2)\\cdot(1/2)=1/4$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=(1/2,1/2)$</span>。熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-T\\log 2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个具体数值：当均匀转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/2$</span> 处完全混合时，ELBO 的熵项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-T\\log 2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关。这验证了命题 20.16.10 的分解，并说明熵项在完全混合时退化为常数，梯度完全由交叉熵项承担。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环九-推导链的闭合检验-一个反例边界\">链环九：推导链的闭合检验——一个反例边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环九-推导链的闭合检验-一个反例边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 20.16.6 声称三条等价地刻画“转移矩阵决定扩散”。但等价性依赖于 (A2) 可逆假设。本节给出一个边界情形，说明若去掉 (A2)，链环二的后验表达式可能退化，从而链环三的 ELBO 不再由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Q_s\\}$</span> 唯一确定。此边界情形不展开为完整反例（完整反例见第 10 节），只作为推导链闭合性的检验。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.12（可逆性缺失时后验的非唯一性边界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}$</span>（行随机但不可逆，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det Q_1=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=(1,0)$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=1$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 无定义（条件事件概率为零的补事件），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=2$</span>，后验任意。因此 ELBO 中的 KL 项无法由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 唯一确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0Q_1=(1,0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=1\\mid x_0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1=2\\mid x_0)=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=2$</span>，条件概率为零，后验按命题 20.16.3 的分母为零，任意定义；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=1$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0)_1Q_1(1,1)=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,0)$</span>，但此情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 不可逆导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0$</span> 退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_0=I$</span> 仍可逆，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_1$</span> 不可逆使后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_{t-1}$</span> 可能退化）。因此链环二在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 时失效，链环三的 ELBO 不再唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题确认：推导链的闭合性依赖 (A2)，缺 (A2) 时链环二断裂，链环三随之失效。这与第 10 节的完整反例一致，本节只作为闭合性检验，不重复反例构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df20--h-链环十-推导链与代码的接口\">链环十：推导链与代码的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df20--h-链环十-推导链与代码的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足一个接口命题，说明推导链的每一步都可数值验证，且验证的容差由矩阵条件数控制。这连接本节的理论推导与代码节的可运行性要求。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20.16.13（数值验证的误差界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\|Q_t\\|_2\\|Q_t^{-1}\\|_2$</span> 为条件数。用浮点运算计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar Q_t$</span> 与后验时，相对误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s\\kappa_s$</span> 放大。特别地，吸收转移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 1$</span> 时趋于无穷，故数值验证需避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 过接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 矩阵乘积的相对误差界为标准结果：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\widehat{Q_1Q_2}-Q_1Q_2\\|_2\\le(\\kappa_1+\\kappa_2)\\|Q_1\\|_2\\|Q_2\\|_2\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，累积得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_s\\kappa_s$</span> 因子。后验计算涉及除法，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，当此值接近零时相对误差放大。吸收转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span> 接近奇异（对角元 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t\\to 0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：代码节的 <code>assert</code> 容差应设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal O(\\prod_s\\kappa_s\\cdot\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，对本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span> 例子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\approx 1.25$</span>，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 足够。这闭合了推导链与数值验证的接口：理论上的代数锁定在浮点下以条件数为代价保持，条件数由转移矩阵的谱决定，再次回到“转移矩阵决定扩散”的主题。</p>", "cjk": 60580, "missing": []};
